  <para style="h">Yerimaiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yerimaiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yerimaiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yeri</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yerimaiya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1" />Mme ikọ Yerimaiya ayịn Hilkia, keed ke atu mme aku ke Anatod ke efaak Benyamin. <verse eid="JER 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịm anye ke ayọhọ isua duob mme ita ke ukara Yosaiya ayịn Amọn adidem Yuda, <verse eid="JER 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3" />tutu afịd idaha ukara Yehoiyakịm ayịn Yosaiya adidem Yuda, tutu akesịm ayọhọ afiọñ ition ke ayọhọ isua duob mme keed ke ukara Sedekaiya ayịn Yosaiya adidem Yuda, ke idaha ekekoonoke mbon Yeruselem esio eka asen idịd.<verse eid="JER 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ikood Yerimaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadinsịm miin, ate,<verse eid="JER 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5" />“Mbemiso ami ñkubot fiin ke ntʌñidịb ami mmaudiọọñọ fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">mbemiso afo akemamana ami mmausio fiin nnịm asaña-asaña;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">ami mmaumek fiin nnịm nte prọfed nnọ mme idịd.”<verse eid="JER 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6" />Ndin ami mmaabo, “Sai, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, ami ndiọọñọke naña etañ ikọ; ami ndo ataa etəkayịn.”<verse eid="JER 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Kuubo, ‘Ami ndo ataa etəkayịn.’ Ana afo aka abịne afịd awo se ami udọñ fiin nnọ anyʌñ atañ se adodo a-ami uwuuhọ fiin. <verse eid="JER 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8" />Kuunie ndịk ubaña ammọ, sia ami mmọdo ye afo, ñyaanyʌñ ufak fiin,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanyan ubọk amọ antuuk inua anyʌñ ambo miin, “Ami mmesịn ikọ mmi ke inua mfo. <verse eid="JER 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10" />Mfịn ami, ami mmumek fiin nte akaara mme idịd ye mme abioubọọñ, adiwịppe ñnyʌñ ñwai, adisobo ye adidooro nduọọk, adibọp ye adinam yak asọñada.”<verse eid="JER 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadinsịm miin. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambịp abo, “Yerimaiya, nsoo ke afo akịt?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:11">Ami mmaabọọrọ, “Ami ñkịt ñkọk eto mmansañ mbakara.”<verse eid="JER 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Afo amenekke akịt nọ afọn, sia ami nsʌk ñkpeme adikịt mbo ke ikọ mmi asu.”<verse eid="JER 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaamaana adinsịm miin ate: “Nsoo ke afo akịt?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:13">Ami mmaabọọrọ “Ami ñkịt naña ako afịt. Ako ado anyʌkkọ ato adoro ibịne ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JER 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Eyaenwañña nsobo tọọñọ ke adoro efʌk afịd awo se idʌñ ke isọñ. <verse eid="JER 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15" />Ami mmeyem adikoot afịd mbon awo ke mme abioubọọñ adoro,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">Mme ndidem ammọ eyaedi enyʌñ edidaaha mme ebekpo ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:15">ke inuaatob Yeruselem;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">ammọ eyaedi ekọñ ye afịd ñkanñkʌk ndibene amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:15">ye ke afịd mme abio Yuda.<verse eid="JER 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16" />Ami ñyaabiide ikpe mmi nnọ mbon mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:16">ke ntak ibak a-ammọ enieghe ke ediwọññọ edem iñkpọñ miin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:16">ke edifọp insensi nnọọ mme abasi mfen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:16">ye ke edikpono se ubọk ammọ abot.<verse eid="JER 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17" />“Beeñe idem mfo! Dakka da nyʌñ tañ nọ ammọ ñkpọ akeedodo a-ami udọññọ fiin. Kuunie ndịk ubaña ammọ, imiidooho ami ñyaanam ndịk umʌm fiin ke iso ammọ. <verse eid="JER 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18" />Mfịn ami, ami mmunam fiin akpọsọñ abio, abai ukwak ye ndibene brọns adinwana ye afịd isọñ, ye ndidem Yuda, mme adaaha amọ, mme aku amọ ye mbon isọñ abio. <verse eid="JER 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19" />Ammọ eyaenwana ye afo ado iduukanna fiin ubọk, sia ami mmọdo mba ye afo ndin ñyaufak fiin,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 1:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2" />
  <para style="s1">Isrel Adiañña Akpọñ Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 2:1" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadinsịm miin idem ate: <verse eid="JER 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 2:2" />“Kaa ketañ sịn ke utọñ Yeruselem:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 2:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 2:2">“Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">“ ‘Ami mmetoiyo ñwaidem uyịn mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:2">naña nte anwaan ndọ, afo akemma miin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">anyʌñ añkeene miin asaña aboiyo ke anaan ikọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:2">isọñ a-adooho awo itọọhọ kpaanam.<verse eid="JER 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3" />Isrel akedo adisana anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">akpa mbunwịm idọk amọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">emaekịt ndudue enọ afịd mbon se ikidia anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">nsobo amaanyʌñ asịm ammọ,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4" />Ikop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndufo mme ubon Yekọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:4">afịd mme aduuk Isrel.<verse eid="JER 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">“Nsoo ndudue ke mme ete ndufo ekekịt ke idem mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">anam nọ ammọ eñkpọñ miin?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">Ammọ emaekeene mme ubobodñkpọ i-imiibaaha ufọn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">ndin ammọ ke idem ammọ edikappa edo mbon i-imiibaaha ufọn.<verse eid="JER 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6" />Ammọ ikibịppe ibo, ‘Mmọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">a-akisioho ñnyịn afep ke Iyib</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">anyʌñ idat ñnyịn isañ ke nsaad anaan ikọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">aboiyo ke isọñ mme anaan ye mme abedeñ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">isọñ unana mmọọñ ye ataa ekịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">isọñ a-adooho kpaanam awo ndomokeed ikaaha inyʌññọ idọdʌñ?’<verse eid="JER 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7" />Ami mmaidat ndufo ndisịn ke isọñ nseghe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">nọ edidia mme mfịd ye nti mbunwịm amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">Ado ndufo emaedisappa isọñ mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">enyʌñ enam udeeme mmi ado mbubiam.<verse eid="JER 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8" />Mme aku ikibịppe ibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aba ke mmọọ?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Mbon se inam ñkpọ ibaña mbed ikindiọọñọke miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">mme adadusʌñ emaesọñ iwuod ye ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Mme prọfed emaetañ ñkukịd ke anyịñ Baal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">ekeene mme ubobodñkpọ imiibaaha ufọn.<verse eid="JER 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9" />“Ke ntoro ami mmemaana ikoot ndufo ikpe,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:9">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:9">“Ndin ami ñyaakoot nditọnditọ ndufo ikpe.<verse eid="JER 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10" />Kaaña kaa mme esʌk Saiprọs ke se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:10">dọñ eka Keda ekenekke esuuk anyen ese;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:10">se me kpaanam utọ ñkpọ ntom aba:<verse eid="JER 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11" />Kpaanam idịd ekpəho mme abasi ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">(Kpayeado ammọ idooho mme abasi ndomokeed.)</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">Ado mbon mmi e-ekpəho Abasi ubọọñ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">enọ mme ubobodñkpọ i-imiibaaha ufọn.<verse eid="JER 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12" />Ndufo mme hefịn, ikop ke ataa ñkpaidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:12">inyʌñ ikop ye ataa ndịk,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:12">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13" />“Mbon mmi enam idiọọkñkpọ iba:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">ammọ eñkpọñ miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">idịm mmọọñ uwem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">enyʌñ edọk ube mmọọñ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">mme mboomo ube mmọọñ imiikanna imʌm mmọọñ ikama.<verse eid="JER 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14" />Ado nte Isrel ado ayịnufọk, me afʌn ke emana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:14">Nsoo ido ndin nọ anye ado ñkpọ mbịme?<verse eid="JER 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15" />Mme ekpe ekuun;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">e-ekuun anye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Ammọ etahade isọñ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">efọp mme abio amọ, ndin mme awo emaefeeñe afịd.<verse eid="JER 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16" />Ñko, mme ideen Memfis ye Tapanes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:16">e-ekọñ ñkpọkpọrọ ndufo esiak.<verse eid="JER 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17" />Idooho ndufo eben ukuud ami enọọ idem ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:17">ke adikpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:17">a-akidatta ndufo usʌñ?<verse eid="JER 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18" />Idahami nsoo ido nọ eka Iyib</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:18">ekenwọñ mmọọñ Nail?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Ñko nsoo ido nọ eka Asiria</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:18">ekenwọñ mmọọñ Yufretis?<verse eid="JER 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19" />Ndoom ndufo ayaimia ndufo ufen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">mfiakedem ndufo ayaitʌnọ ndufo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Inekke ise inyʌñ idiọọñọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">naña adiọọk anyʌñ adoro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">ke ndufo adikpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">inyʌññọ inie uteeñe innọ miin,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan.<verse eid="JER 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20" />“Ke anyan ini ndufo emaebiommo mbiomo ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">enyʌñ ebʌñ mme akpọnọ ndufo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">ndufo emaebo, ‘Ñnyịn idiinamma ñkpọ unọ fiin!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">Ke akpanikọ, ke afịd ñkoñ-ñkoñ abod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">ye ke idak eto a-anwañake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">ndufo emaesuuk enaa nte akpara.<verse eid="JER 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21" />Ami ñkitọ ndufo nte asaña-asaña fain</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:21">a-atooho eti uduud.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">Die ndin ke ndufo ekanna enwana ye ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:21">ekappa idiọọk uduud fain?<verse eid="JER 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22" />Akpesʌkado a-ndufo edatta atọñ eyie idem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">enyʌñ edat anem ufịk ndom efiọññọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">ado idiọọñọ ndudue ndufo asʌk ababa ke iso mmi.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">Abọọñ Andikara atan.<verse eid="JER 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23" />“Ndufo ekpenam die ebo, ‘Awo isappake ñnyịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">ñnyịn ifegheke ikeene mme Baal’?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Se naña ndufo ekenam ke abedeñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">iduuñọ se ndufo enam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Ndufo edo mme asọp usọb uman kamel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">efeghe edʌk umi, efeghe edʌk uko,<verse eid="JER 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24" />nte dọñki ikọd a-akpautatan amegheke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">a-anuunoke afịm ke udọñ amọ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">Anie ikan imʌm anye ke ini anye ayemme ayaara?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Ayaara ndomokeed a-abịneke anye idooho se anọ idem ammọ ufen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">sia ayaakịt anye ke afiọñ amọ amaakem.<verse eid="JER 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25" />Ikiifeghe tutu ukod ikpọọñọ ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">itọñ ndufo anyʌñ asat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">Ado ndufo emaebo, ‘Ufọn ibaaha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">Ñnyịn ima mme isen abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">ndin ana ifeghe ikeene ammọ.’<verse eid="JER 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26" />“Kpa naña esuenne inọ ke emaemʌm anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">kpa ntoro ke esuenne mbon Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:26">ammọ ye ndidem ammọ ye mme adaaha ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">mme aku ammọ ye mme prọfed ammọ.<verse eid="JER 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27" />Ammọ ebo eto, ‘Afo ado ete mmi,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">ebo itiad, ‘Afo akemman miin.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Ammọ ewọññọ edem eñwọt miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">ado idooho iso ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">kpayeado ammọ emaeba ke mfịna, ammọ ete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">‘Di di nyaaña ñnyịn!’<verse eid="JER 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28" />Mmọ ndin mme abasi a-ndufo ekenamma enọọ idem ndufo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">Yak ammọ ewuọ edi adieke adooho ammọ eyaekan inyaaña ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">ke emaeba ke mfịna!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Sia afo, Yuda amenie mme abasi ewakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">kpa naña abio mfo ewak.<verse eid="JER 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29" />“Nsoo ido nọ ndufo endot miin ikọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:29">Afịd ndufo emesọñ iwuod ye ami,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:29">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo.<verse eid="JER 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30" />Ufen ami ñkenọọhọ ikọd ndufo ibaaha ufọn ndomokeed;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">sia ammọ ikidatta ukpeebñkpọ ndomokeed.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:30">Akañkañ ndufo asobo mme aku ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">nte ekpe a-akpọsọñ abiọọñ adọññọ.<verse eid="JER 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31" />“Ndufo mbon emana ami, ikop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">“Nte ami mmedo akpautatan nnọ Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">me isọñ ekamba ekịm?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Nsoo ido ntak a-mbon mmi ebooho, ‘Ñnyịn iminie unen adiyooñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">ñnyịn idiidiighe ubịne fiin aba’?<verse eid="JER 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32" />Me abọikpa akpaafre ñkpọ mbanaidem amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:32">me anwaan ndọ akpaafre mme ñkpọ mbanaidem ndọ amọ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">Ado mbon mmi emfre miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:32">ke ananaibad usen.<verse eid="JER 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33" />Emenekke enie mbufiọk ke naña edubịnne ima!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:33">Akpatre idiọọk awonwaan akeme adikpeep ñkpọ nto mme usʌñ ndufo.<verse eid="JER 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 2:34" />Ke afọñ ndufo e-ekịt</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34">iyiib uweene i-imiidueghe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34">akpesʌkado ndufo ikimʌmmọ ammọ naña ebommo usʌñ edʌk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:34">Kpa ye afịd ami<verse eid="JER 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 2:35" />ndufo ete, ‘Ami ndueghe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:35">anye iyatta esịd ye ami.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">Ado ami ñyaabiide ikpe unọ fiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:35">sia afo abo, ‘Ami ndueghe.’<verse eid="JER 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36" />Nsoo ido nọ afo ayooñ ntom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:36">akpəho mme usʌñ mfo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:36">Idodanyen mfo ke Iyib ayaakpa mfʌhọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:36">kpa naña akedo ke Asiria.<verse eid="JER 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37" />Afo ayaanyʌñ akpọñ itie ado</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:37">abiom ubọk ke iwuod mfo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:37">sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-asịn mbon a-afo adotto anyen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:37">ammọ iduunwamma fiin.<verse eid="JER 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JER 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1" />“Adieke awodeen asịnne anwaan amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">ndin anye akpọñ ebe ado akedọ awodeen mfen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">me awodeen ado akeme aditịmme mbịne anye aba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">Ado nte isọñ ikpibiarake ataa afịd-afịd?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Ado afo amedʌñ nte akpara ye mme uwak mbon ima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">nte afo ayaanyọñ ambịne miin ndin?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2" />“Benne anyen se mme anaan abod nyʌñ kịt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">Aba itie se awo imuusappake fiin?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Afo amaatie ke mben usʌñ abet mbon ima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">a-atie ke akpautatan nte ñyooñ akpeme ufene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Afo amesappa isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">ke efịbe ye ibak mfo.<verse eid="JER 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3" />Ke ntak ado edịm ideppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">edịm mbara iduọkkọke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:3">Kpayeado afo amenana iso abuud nte akpara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">afo ukoppo abuud ndomokeed.<verse eid="JER 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4" />Idooho afo añkoot miin idaha ado:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:4">‘Ete mmi, ufan mmi tọọñọ ke uyịn mmi,<verse eid="JER 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5" />nte afo ayaasʌk ayat esịd afịd ini?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:5">Ifiobesịd mfo ayaakaa iso ke nsi-nsi?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:5">Naña afo asitañ ikọ ado ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:5">ado afo anam afịd ndiọiñkpọ se afo akakan.”<verse eid="JER 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isrel Inamma Akpanikọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6" />Ke ini ukara Adidem Yosaiya, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Afo amekịt se anana mbuọdidem Isrel anam? Anye a-adọọk anyọñ afịd ñkoñ-ñkoñ abod ye ke idak afịd eto e-etarake anyʌñ asịn efịbe do. <verse eid="JER 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7" />Ami ñkekere ke anye amaakenam afịd ami, anye ayaanyọñ ambịne miin, ado anye inyọññọ idi, ndin ndudiọ ayịneka amọ Yuda amaakịt ado. <verse eid="JER 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8" />Ami mmaanọ ndudiọ Isrel ñwed uwuọndọ ñnyʌñ nsio anye unyọñ ke ntak afịd efịbe amọ. Kpayeado ami mmaakịt ke ndudiọ ayịneka amọ, Yuda, ikikoppo ndịk ndomokeed; anye ñko amaawuọ anyʌñ akesịn efịbe. <verse eid="JER 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9" />Sia abʌd-abʌd ido Isrel ikidooho ñkpọ ndomokeed ke iso amọ, anye amaasappa isọñ anyʌñ asịn efịbe ye itiad ye eto. <verse eid="JER 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10" />Kpa ye afịd ado, anana mbuọdidem ayịneka amọ awoanwaan, Yuda, ikinyọññọ imbịne miin ke afịd esịd amọ, ado ke abiaña,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Isrel anana mbuọdidem afọn akan Yuda ndudiọ. <verse eid="JER 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12" />Kaa, ke suan etob ami ke adoro:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">“ ‘Tịmme nyọñ di, Isrel anana mbuọdidem,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">‘Ami ndiibọppọ iso aba ye afo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">sia ami ndo anam akpanikọ,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">‘Ami ndiiyatta esịd ke nsi-nsi.<verse eid="JER 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13" />Kap nyịmme ndudue mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">afo amesọñ iwuod ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">afo amesuan mme enọ mfo anọ mme isen abasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">ke idak afịd eto e-etuaññake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">unyʌññọ ukop uyio mmi,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, “Nyọñ di, mbon unana mbuọdidem, sia ami ndo ebe ndufo. Ami ñyaimek ndufo, keed ke abio ye iba ke aduuk, ndin iben ndufo ndi Saiyọn. <verse eid="JER 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15" />Ndin ami ñyainọ ndufo mme akpemeedọñ a-ami mmekke, se idiidat ndufo usʌñ ke ifiọk ye ikike. <verse eid="JER 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16" />Ke mme usen ado, ke ibad ndufo amaanekke awak ke isọñ,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “mbon awo idiibooho aba, ‘Akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ Anye idiidʌkkọ esịd ammọ aba, ammọ idiinyʌññọ itoiyo; awo idiiyemme anye, awo idiinyʌññọ inam mfen. <verse eid="JER 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17" />Ke ini ado ammọ eyaekoot Yeruselem Ebekpo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin afịd mme idịd eyaeboho ke Yeruselem adikpono anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ammọ idiikeeneke nsọñiwuod esịd ibak ammọ aba. <verse eid="JER 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18" />Ke mme usen ado mbon Yuda eyaediana ye mbon Isrel, ndin ke esịd keed ammọ eyaeto isọñ adoro edi isọñ a-ami ñkenọọhọ mme eteete ndufo nte udeeme.<verse eid="JER 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19" />“Ami ke idem mmi mmaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">“ ‘Ami ñyaakop inemesịd adinam ñkpọ ye ndufo nte nditọ mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">ñnyʌñ inọ ndufo eti isọñ inemesịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">udeeme se iyaiya ikan ke afịd idịd.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">Ami ñkekere ke ndufo eyaeñkoot miin ‘Ete’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">inyʌññọ itre adiñkeene miin.<verse eid="JER 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20" />Ado nte awonwaan ammiinamma akpanikọ ye ebe amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:20">kpa ntoro ke afo, Isrel, ambiaña miin,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:20">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo.<verse eid="JER 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21" />Ekop ayịd ke anyọñ mme anaan abod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">ntuaña ye ñkpeubọk mbon Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">sia ammọ enam abʌd-abʌd ido ke usʌñ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">enyʌñ efre <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ.<verse eid="JER 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22" />“Inyọñ idi, mbon unana mbuọdidem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">ami ñyaakọk mfiakedem ndufo.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 3:22" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:22">“Ii, ñnyịn iyaidi ubịne fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">sia afo ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn.<verse eid="JER 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23" />Ke akpanikọ mme ndutịme ye uyom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">mme akpono ndem ke mme anyọñ ntək abod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">ye ke mme ikpọabod edo abiaña;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:23">ke akpanikọ, adinyaaña Isrel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">aba ke ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn.<verse eid="JER 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24" />Tọọñọ ke uyịn ñnyịn mme abasi ndọk e-edia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:24">mbunwịm ubọkutom mme ete ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:24">udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:24">nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ammọ.<verse eid="JER 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25" />Yak ñnyịn isuuk inaa ke abuud ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">ndin yak ndọk ñnyịn ifʌk ñnyịn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:25">Ñnyịn iminam idiọọkñkpọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">ñnyịn ye mme eteete ñnyịn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:25">tọọñọ ke uyịn ñnyịn tutu idahami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">ñnyịn ikoppo ikọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JER 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JER 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, “Isrel, adieke adooho afo ayaatịmme anyọñ adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">ndin nyọñ mbịne miin.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:1">“Adieke afo asioho mme mbubiam ubobodñkpọ mfo afep ke iso mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">unyʌññọ utịn usʌñ aba,<verse eid="JER 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2" />ndin adieke afo anwọñọke ke akpanikọ, unen ye nnekke-nnekke usʌñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">abo, ‘Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:2">ndin mme idịd eyaebọ adidiọñ eto ke anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">enyʌñ ekpọ inua ke anye.”<verse eid="JER 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo mbon Yuda ye Yeruselem:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:3">“Ikappa isọñ ndufo a-awo imiitọọhọ ñkpọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:3">ikiinyʌñ itọ ñkpọ iwaak ye mme akpab.<verse eid="JER 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4" />Inịm idem ndufo asana inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">inam esịd ndufo asana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">ndufo mbon Yuda ye mme andidʌñ ke Yeruselem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:4">imiidooho ntoro ifiobesịd mmi ayaabịppe anyʌñ asak nte ikañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ a-ndufo enamma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">asak inyʌññọ iba awo se inịme anye.<verse eid="JER 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsobo A-atooho Adoro</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5" />“Nọ etob ke Yuda nyʌñ tañ ke Yeruselem nyʌñ bo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">‘Fịt adukpoñ ke afịd isọñ!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">Tua ke akpọsọñ uyio nyʌñ bo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">‘Iboho itie keed!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">Yak ñnyịn ifeeñe ika mme ñkpọsọñ abio!’<verse eid="JER 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6" />Inọ idiọọñọ nọ eka Saiyọn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">Ifeeñe iyem uwem ikiibiat ini!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">Sia ami ñyaaben afanekọñ nto adoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">kpa ataa idiọọk nsobo.”<verse eid="JER 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7" />Ekpe awuọ ato itie nnaa amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">andisobo mme idịd adakka isañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Anye akpọñ itie amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">adisobo isọñ ndufo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Mme abio ndufo eyaeba ke atahade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">andidʌñ ibaaha.<verse eid="JER 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8" />Ke ntoro sịne afọñikpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:8">tua nyʌñ seeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:8">sia akpọsọñ iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:8">iwọññọke ikpọñ ñnyịn.<verse eid="JER 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, “Ke usen ado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:9">adidem ye mme adaaha eyaekop ayeemensia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:9">mme aku eyaeba ke ñkpaidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:9">ndin mme prọfed eyaekpaaña nsa.”<verse eid="JER 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10" />Ndin ami mmaabo, “Sai, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara! Se naña afo abiaña ibon ami ye Yeruselem ataa afịd-afịd ke adibo, ‘Ndufo eyaenie emem,’ ke ini akañkañ abaaha ke itọñ ñnyịn!”<verse eid="JER 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11" />Ke ini ado eyaedọkkọ ibon ami ye Yeruselem, “Ufiob-ufiob afịm a-atooho mbiara ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ke akpautatan afịme abịne mbon mmi, ado idooho adikeñ me adinam asana; <verse eid="JER 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12" />afịm a-asọññọ adudu akan ado anto miin. Idahami ami mmenọ mme ubiideikpe mmi ke abaña ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13" />Kap se! Anye asʌk asaña adi nte mme ntọñanyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">mme sariọd amọ edi nte ayobio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:13">mme enañmbakara amọ esọp ekan mme ntrukpuum.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">Ifọnnọ ye ñnyịn! Ñnyịn imitak!<verse eid="JER 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14" />Yeruselem, yet ndoom sio ke esịd mfo nyʌñ bọ adinyaaña.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:14">Afo uduunie mme akikere ibak nọ akpeene die?<verse eid="JER 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15" />Uyio asʌk ato ke Daan asuan etob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:15">ato ke mme abod Ifrem atañ abaña nsobo.<verse eid="JER 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16" />“Tañ anyem dọkkọ mme idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">Nọ etob baña Yeruselem:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:16">‘Udịmekọñ asʌk ato anyan usʌñ idʌñ adi adikanna akʌk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">akpọk ukịbe ekọñ abaña mme abio Yuda.<verse eid="JER 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17" />Ammọ ekanna anye ekʌk nte ideen e-ekpemeke inwañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:17">sia anye a-asọñ iwuod ye ami,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:17">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18" />“Ido mfo ye mme adinam mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">edat ami usọk fiin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:18">Ufen mfo ado ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">Kop naña anye adoro!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">Kop naña anye akịm adʌk esịd!”<verse eid="JER 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19" />O, iduọesịd mmi, iduọesịd mmi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">Ami mmemiañña ke ubiak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">O, mbʌññọ esịd mmi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">Esịd mmi aduọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">ami ñkanna ndop uyio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Sia ami mmekop uyio adukpoñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">ami mmekop uyio ñkpoyo ekọñ;<verse eid="JER 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20" />Nnananyen akeene nnananyen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:20">afịd isọñ atahade.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">Ke adibọp anyen ntat esobo mme atayad ye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:20">mme itie idʌñ mmi inikeed.<verse eid="JER 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21" />Ami ndiikịt afọñidiọọñọ ekọñ nọ akpeene die</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:21">ñnyʌñ ñkop uyom adukpoñ?<verse eid="JER 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22" />“Mbon mmi edo ndisịme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">ammọ indiọọñọke miin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Ammọ edo nditọ unanaifiọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">ammọ inieghe ikike.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Ammọ enie ifiọk adinam idiọọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">ammọ idiọọñọke adinam eti ñkpọ.”<verse eid="JER 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23" />Ami mmaase ederimbod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:23">anye ikinieghe uyai anyʌñ ado ukpọk;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:23">ñnyʌñ nse mme hefịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:23">ndin unwana ammọ amaanyọñ.<verse eid="JER 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24" />Ami mmaase mme ikpọabod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">ndin ammọ ekesʌk enyeñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">afịd mme ntək abod ekesʌk enyeeñe.<verse eid="JER 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25" />Ami mmaase, ndin mme awo ikibaaha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:25">afịd inuen ke ikpaanyọñ emaefuurọ enyọñọ.<verse eid="JER 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26" />Ami mmaase, ndin nseghe isọñ akedo akpautatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">afịd mme abio amọ ekeba ke atahade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke iso ufiob iyadesịd amọ.<verse eid="JER 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:27">“Eyaetahade afịd isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:27">akpesʌkado ami ndiisoboke anye ataa afịd-afịd.<verse eid="JER 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28" />Ke ntoro ederimbod ayaafʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">mme hefịn ke anyọñ eyaekịm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">sia ami mmetañ ndiinyʌññọ ntre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">ami mmebiere ndin ndiitịmmeke edem.”<verse eid="JER 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29" />Ke uyio mme awad enañmbakara ye mme atobidañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">afịd abio efeeñe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Ubaak edọñọ ikọd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">usʌk edọọk anyọñ ikpọ itiad.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">E-efeeñe ema ke mme abio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">ibaaha awo se idʌñ ke esịd.<verse eid="JER 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30" />Nsoo ke afo anam, afo awo nnananyen?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Nsoo ido nọ asịne afọñ ubọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">anyʌñ asịne mme ñkpọ mbanaidem kold?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Nsoo ido nọ adeppe anyen mfo ye ñkpọ mbanaidem?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Afo abana idem mfo ikpu-ikpu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Sia mbon ima mfo usọọn fiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">ammọ eyem aduwot fiin.<verse eid="JER 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31" />Ami mmekop ayịd nte ake awonwaan u-uman abiakka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">mmịm nte awonwaan a-amanna akpa ayịn amọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">ayịd Adiaha Saiyọn a-anweeghe ayem afịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">a-anyanna ubọk amọ abo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">“Se miin! Mmesʌkkọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">e-eyaak uwem mmi enọ mme awodawo.”<verse eid="JER 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ibaaha ake Ado Adinen</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1" />“Saña dọọk nyʌñ saña tịkke mme efaak ke Yeruselem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">nekke se nyʌñ kere baña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">duuñọ se ke mme afe amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Adieke afo akịtte awo keed</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">a-anamma se inen anyʌñ ayem akpanikọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">ami ñyaafeen nnọ abio ami.<verse eid="JER 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2" />Akpesʌkado a-ammọ ebooho, ‘Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:2">kpayeado ammọ esʌk enwọñọ ke nsu.”<verse eid="JER 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado nte anyen mfo iyemme akpanikọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">Afo amaayʌppọ ammọ, ado ammọ ikoppo ubiak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">afo amaasọnnọ ammọ, ado ammọ esịn adibọ ukpeeb.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Ammọ emaenam iso ammọ asọñ akan itiad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">enyʌñ esịn edikappa esịd.<verse eid="JER 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4" />Ami mmaakere, “Mbon ami edoñño mme uweene ikpọọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:4">ammọ edo ndisịme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:4">sia ammọ idiọọñọke usʌñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:4">se Abasi ammọ ayem.<verse eid="JER 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5" />Ke ntoro ami ñyaakaa mbịne mme adadusʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">ñnyʌñ ntañ ikọ ye ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">ke akpanikọ ammọ ediọọñọ usʌñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">se Abasi ayem.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Ado ke esịd keed ammọ ñko emaekọññọ akpọnọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">enyʌñ ekịp mme udʌk.<verse eid="JER 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6" />Ke ntoro ekpe ayaato akai ikọd adita ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">ewaikọd ayaato akpautatan adisobo ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">ekpeñkem ayaanaa abet ammọ ke ñkpere abio ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">adiwai awo akeedodo a-anyanna iso ke esiin mbai-mbai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">sia nsọñiwuod ammọ akpon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">mfiakedem ammọ anyʌñ awak.<verse eid="JER 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7" />“Ntak ami ñkpefeene inọọ ndufo-o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">Nditọ ndufo emaensịn miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">enyʌñ enwọñọ ke mme abasi a-mmiidooho mme abasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Ami mmaanọ afịd se ammọ eyem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">ado ammọ emaesịn efịbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">enyʌkkọ ekeyọhọ ke mme ufọk mme akpara.<verse eid="JER 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8" />Ammọ edo mme ndia ñyʌkkọ, akop idem ñyaara enañmbakara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:8">ammọ keedekeed eyem anwaan awo mfen.<verse eid="JER 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9" />Nte ikpinaaha ami mmia ammọ ufen ke adinam ami?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:9">“Nte ami ñkpisioho usiene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">ye utọ idịd ami?<verse eid="JER 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10" />“Saaña ke mme inwañ fain amọ nyʌñ biat ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">ado kuusobo ammọ ataa afịd-afịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">Diappa mme ñkọk amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">sia ibon ami idooho ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11" />Mbon Isrel ye mbon Yuda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:11">inamma akpanikọ ye ami,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:11">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo.<verse eid="JER 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12" />Ammọ esʌhọ nsu ebaña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:12">ammọ emaebo, “Inieghe se anye adiinam!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:12">Unọmọ ndomokeed idiisịmme ñnyịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:12">tutu amama ñnyịn idiikịtte ekọñ me akañ.<verse eid="JER 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13" />Mme prọfed edoñño afịm kpọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:13">ndin ikọ Abasi ibaaha ammọ ke idem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:13">ke ntoro yak se ammọ etañ atịppe anọ ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan abo adom:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:14">“Sia ibon ami etañ mme ikọ ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">ami ñyaanam ikọ mmi ke inua mfo ado ikañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">ndin ibon ami edo ifia se ikañ ado ata.<verse eid="JER 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15" />Mbon Isrel,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">“Ami nsʌk mben idịd ke anyan usʌñ ndi ekọñ ye ndufo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:15">akaan idịd anyʌññọ akop adudu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">mbon a-adooho ndufo idiọọñọke usem ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">edeme ikọ ammọ inwañake ndufo.<verse eid="JER 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16" />Ekpad idañ ammọ atie nte anainwañ udi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:16">afịd ammọ edo ñkpọsọñ mbon ekọñ.<verse eid="JER 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17" />Ammọ eyaesobo mme idọk ye ndidia ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">esobo nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ndufo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">ammọ eyaesobo udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">esobo mme fain ye mme eto fik ndufo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Ye akañkañ ke ammọ ediisobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">mme ñkpọsọñ abio a-ndufo ebuọttọ idem.<verse eid="JER 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18" />“Ado kpa ke mme usen ado,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “ami ndiisoboke ndufo ataa afịd-afịd. <verse eid="JER 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19" />Ndin mbon awo emaebịp, ‘Nsoo ido nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn anam afịd ami ye ñnyịn?’ ndufo eyaedọkkọ ammọ, ‘Kpa naña ndufo eñkpọñ miin ekekpono mme isen abasi ke abio ndufo, ntoro ke ndufo ediikinam ñkpọ inọ mme isenawo ke isọñ a-mmiidooho ake ndufo.’<verse eid="JER 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20" />“Nọ mbon ubon Yekọb etob ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:20">nyʌñ tañ anye ke Yuda:<verse eid="JER 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21" />Ikop ami, ndufo mme ndisịme ye mbon unana ifiọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:21">a-adooho emenie anyen ado ikịtte ñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:21">emenie utọñ ado ikoppo ñkpọ:<verse eid="JER 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22" />Ndufo ikpimbaagha miin?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">“Ndufo ikpinieghe uteeñe ke iso mmi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Ami ñkenam ntan ado adaña anọ akpainyañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">nsi-nsi ubiọọñọ a-anye imiikanna ikaaña.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Ayobio akeme ikpot, ado ammọ ikanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">ammọ ekeme ikuun, ado ikanna ikaaña anye.<verse eid="JER 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23" />Ado ibon ami enie esịd emiom ye nsọñiwuod;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:23">ammọ ewọññọ enyʌñ ekaa usʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24" />Ammọ ibooho idem ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:24">‘Yak ñnyịn ibaak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:24">a-anọọhọ edịm ye ukpere edem edịm ke ini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:24">anam ñnyịn inie idọk ke udua ke udua.’<verse eid="JER 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25" />Mme nnamndue ndufo enam mme ñkpọ ami ibaaha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:25">ndiọiñkpọ ndufo enam ndufo ikịtte eti.<verse eid="JER 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26" />“Mbon ibak e-eba ke atu mbon mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">e-edịbeke nte mbon e-ekọọhọ afia eyem imʌm mme inuen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">ye nte mbon e-ekọọhọ afia eyem imʌm mbon awo.<verse eid="JER 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27" />Nte efọk a-ayọhọke ye inuen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:27">mme ufọk ammọ eyọhọ ye abiaña;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:27">ammọ efooño imọ enyʌñ enie adudu,<verse eid="JER 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28" />ndin ekpoon enyʌñ emọọnọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:28">Ndoom ammọ inieghe adaña;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">ammọ iyemme unen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:28">Ammọ iyemme ufọn nditọ unana ete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">ammọ ikpeeghe unen ikpe inọ mbon uweene.<verse eid="JER 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29" />Nte ikpinaaha ami mmia ammọ ufen ke ntak ami?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:29">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:29">“Nte ikpinaaha ami nsio usiene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:29">ye utọ idịd a-atieghe ntom?<verse eid="JER 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30" />“Ñkpọndịk ye ñkpọ ñkpaidem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:30">atịppe ke isọñ:<verse eid="JER 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31" />Mme prọfed etañ nsu-nsu prọfesi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">mme aku ekaara ke adudu ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:31">ndin mbon mmi ema naña aba ntom.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">Ado nsoo ke afo uduunam ke utịd?<verse eid="JER 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ekanna Yeruselem Ekʌk</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1" />“Mbon Benyamin, ifeeñe iyem ifuuro!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">Ifeeñe ikpọñ Yeruselem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Ifịt adukpoñ ke Tekoa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">Idịppe idiọọñọ iwọt ke Bed Hakerem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Sia afanekọñ asʌk ato adoro adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">ataa idiọọk nsobo.<verse eid="JER 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2" />Ami ñyaasobo Adiaha Saiyọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:2">ataa uyaiya ye mmeem-mmeem abọikpa.<verse eid="JER 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3" />Mme akpemeedọñ ye udịmedọñ ammọ eyaebịne anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">ammọ eyaebọp mme atayad ammọ ekanna anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">anie itie amọ ase ñkpọ abaña.”<verse eid="JER 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4" />“Ibeeñe idem ekọñ ye anye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">Idakka ida, yak inwana ke ufọọd uweemeayio!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:4">Ado, kase, unwana uweemeayio atọọñọ inyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">ndukpọñ ndubiayio anyọọñ.<verse eid="JER 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5" />Ke ntoro idakka ida, yak ñnyịn ika ekọñ ye anye ke akonayio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:5">inyʌñ isobo mme ñkpọsọñ itie udịbe amọ!”<verse eid="JER 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan abo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">“Ikpok mme eto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">inyʌñ ibọp mme mbood ubiọọñọ ikanna Yeruselem ikʌk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">Ana emia abio ami ufen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">anye ayọhọ ye ufiik.<verse eid="JER 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7" />Kpa naña ube mmọọñ anwañña mmọọñ amọ asio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">kpa ntoro ke anye anwañña ibak amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:7">Afai ye nsobo eyoyomo anye ke idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">udọñọ ye mme unan amọ eba ke iso mmi afịd ini.<verse eid="JER 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8" />Yeruselem, kop item,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">imiidooho ntoro ami ñyaawọññọ ukpọñ fiin</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:8">ñnyʌñ nnam isọñ mfo adobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">mbaak awo ndomokeed adikan adʌñ ke esịd amọ.”<verse eid="JER 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan abo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">“Yak ammọ enekke ekoono ñyọhọnsʌhọ Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">enekke ekwọọk nte fain;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">yak ubọk mfo amaana atuuk mme ñkọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">nte awo atañ mme kreb.”<verse eid="JER 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10" />Anie ke ami ndiitañ ikọ nnọ ñnyʌñ ndʌt utọñ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">Anie adiikpañ utọñ innọ miin?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Utọñ ammọ asịre,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">itịppeke utọñ/inịmme mboppo ke utọñ</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">ndin ammọ ikanna ikop ñkpọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adọdiọọk ammọ esịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">ammọ ikoppo inem ndomokeed ke anye.<verse eid="JER 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11" />Ado ami ñyọhọ ye ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">ndin ami ñkanna mmʌm anye ñkama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 6:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">“Nwañña anye fʌk ntəkayịn ke efaak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">ye ñkparawa e-ebohoke keed;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">eyaemʌm ebe ye anwaan ñko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">ye mme usọñ, mbon isua ammọ awakka.<verse eid="JER 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12" />Eyaesaana ufọk ammọ eyaak enọ mbon mfen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">ye mme inwañ ammọ ye ibaan ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">ke ini ami mmaanyanna ubọk mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">mbaña mbon e-edʌññọ ke isọñ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo.<verse eid="JER 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13" />“Tọọñọ ke andisịb ñkan tutu asịm andikpon ñkan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:13">afịd ediọọk itọñ eyem udod;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:13">mme prọfed ye mme aku ukem-ukem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:13">afịd enam abiaña.<verse eid="JER 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14" />Ammọ esọbọ enyʌñ ebọp unan ikọd mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:14">nte idooho akpan ñkpọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:14">Ammọ ebo, ‘Emem, emem,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:14">ke ini emem imiibaaha.<verse eid="JER 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15" />Ado nte ammọ ekop abuud ebaña mbubiam adinam ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">Iyoo, ammọ ikoppo abuud ndomokeed;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">ammọ inieghe iso abuud ndomokeed.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Ke ntoro ammọ eyaeduọ ke atu mbon eduọhọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">eyaesuuhọ ammọ ke ini emaenọ ammọ ufen,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">“Ida ke ñwaaña usʌñ inyʌñ ise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">ibịp ibaña ñkaan usʌñ esed,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">ibịp ibaña nte eti usʌñ aba, inyʌñ isaña ke anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">ndin ndufo eyaekịt nduọkadudu enọ mme ukpọñ ndufo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">Ado ndufo emaebo, ‘Ñnyịn idiisañake ke anye.’<verse eid="JER 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17" />Ami mmaamek ideen ukpeme inọ ndufo ndin mmaabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:17">‘Ikpañ utọñ inọ uyom adukpoñ!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:17">Ado ndufo emaebo, ‘Ñnyịn idiikpañña utọñ.’<verse eid="JER 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18" />Ke ntoro ndufo mme idịd, ekop;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:18">ndufo e-edooho mme ntiense,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:18">ise se idiitịppe inọ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19" />Kop, afo ederimbod:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">Ami ñyaaben nsobo nsọk ibon ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">mfịd afịd ndudiọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:19">sia ammọ ikpañña utọñ ikop ikọ mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">enyʌñ esịn mbed mmi.<verse eid="JER 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20" />Nsoo ido ndubeghe mmi ye insensi a-atooho Seba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">me inịññe kalamus a-atooho anyan idịd?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:20">Mbọọhọ ufọfọb uwa ndufo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">ami ñkoppo inemesịd mbaña mme uwa ndufo.”<verse eid="JER 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:21">“Ami ñyaabono ubiọọñọ ke usʌñ ibon ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">Mme ete ye mme eka ye nditọ eyaeduọ ke mme ubiọọñọ ami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">mme mbọhọidʌñ ye mme ufan eyaetak.”<verse eid="JER 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">“Se, udịmekọñ asʌk ato</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">ukañ abio adoro adi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">e-edidịppe nduduai ekamba idịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">tọọñọ ke mme utịd ederimbod.<verse eid="JER 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23" />Ammọ ebana idem ye utịgha ye eduad;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">ammọ edo ibak, inyʌññọ itua mbọm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Ammọ enam uyom nte mbufịd akpainyañ adakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">naña ammọ ewat ke mme enañmbakara ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">ammọ esaña edi nte ideen ke udịmekọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">edinwana ye afo, Adiaha Saiyọn.”<verse eid="JER 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24" />Ñnyịn imikop mme etob ibaña ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">ndin ubọk ñnyịn atọ atekke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:24">Nnananyen isịm ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">ñnyịn ikop ubiak awonwaan a-abaaha ke ubiakuman.<verse eid="JER 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25" />Kuuwuọ ukaa inwañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:25">kuusaña ke mme usʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:25">sia asua akama akañkañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:25">ndin ndịk aba ke afịd itie.<verse eid="JER 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26" />Ikọd mmi, isịne afọñikpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">inyʌñ iwere ke ntọñ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">ifʌhọ ye idod-idod ntuaña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">nte efʌhọ enọ ikpọọñ ayịn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">sia ke adiwad-adiwad andisobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">ayaadisịm ñnyịn.<verse eid="JER 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27" />“Ami mmunam fiin andidomo ukwak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:27">mbon mmi enyʌñ edo adọọn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:27">a-afo anaaha nte ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:27">anyʌñ adomo mme usʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28" />Afịd ammọ edo ataa mbon nsọñiwuod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">e-esañake edot awo uyio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:28">Ammọ edo brọns ye ukwak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">afịd ammọ enam ñwo.<verse eid="JER 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 6:29" />Mme ibịdutịm esak ufiob-ufiob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29">adifọp mbio nsio ke ikañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:29">ado adidʌkkọ akaiso ikpu-ikpu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29">awo isioho afịd mbon ndoom ifep.<verse eid="JER 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 6:30" />Ekoot ammọ silfa e-emaekesịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:30">sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asịn ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7" />
  <para style="s1">Nsu-nsu Ikọ Abasi ado Ikpu-Ikpu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1" />Ikọ aketooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adisịm Yerimaiya ado ami: <verse eid="JER 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2" />“Da ke inuaatob ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin nọ etob ami:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 7:2">“ ‘Ikop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, afịd ndufo mbon Yuda e-esañake ke inuaatob ami edikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JER 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, abo: Inekke mme usʌñ ndufo ye mme adinam ndufo, ndin ami ñyaayak ndufo edʌñ ke itie ami. <verse eid="JER 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4" />Kuubuọt idem ke mme abiaña ikọ, ndin abo, “Tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado ami, tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>!” <verse eid="JER 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5" />Adieke ndufo enekkeke ekpəho edu ndufo ye mme edinam ndufo enyʌñ enam akpanikọ ye emọ-emọ, <verse eid="JER 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6" />adieke ndufo imiikuudo asenawo, ayịnakpa ye ebekpa inyʌññọ iduọk iyiib ammiidueghe ke itie ami, ñko adieke ndufo imiikeeneke mme abasi mfen iben mfịna inọ idem ndufo, <verse eid="JER 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7" />ami ñyaayaak ndufo edʌñ ke itie ami, ke isọñ a-ami ñkenọọhọ mme eteete ndufo ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi. <verse eid="JER 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8" />Ado kap se, ndufo ebuọt idem ke abiaña ikọ i-imiibaaha ufọn.<verse eid="JER 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9" />“ ‘Ndufo eyaeyịp inọ enyʌñ ewot awo, esịn efịbe enyʌñ etie ntiense nsu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido </char><char style="fq" closed="false">enyʌñ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">enwọñọ ñkpọ ke mme nsu-nsu abasi</char></note>, efọp insensi enọ Baal enyʌñ ekeene mme abasi mfen a-ndufo imiidiọọñọke, <verse eid="JER 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10" />ndin ndufo edida ke iso mmi ke ufọk ami, e-ekoodo Anyịñ mmi, ndin ebo, “Ñnyịn imibọkkọ,” imibọkkọ adinam mme mbubiam ñkpọ ami? <verse eid="JER 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11" />Ado nte ufọk ami, a-akereke Anyịñ mmi, akappa ado aba amauke inọ ndufo? Ado ami nsʌk nse! <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12" />“ ‘Ikaa itie e-ekoodo Silo idahami, ke itie a-ami ñketooho nnam itieidʌñ nnọ Anyịñ mmi, inyʌñ ise se ami ñkenam do ke ntak ibak mbon mmi Isrel. <verse eid="JER 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13" />Idaha a-ndufo ekenamma afịd mme ñkpọ ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ami mmaatañ mmaana ntañ ye ndufo, ado ndufo ikikpañña utọñ; ami mmaikoot ndufo, ado ndufo ikiñyieghe. <verse eid="JER 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14" />Ke ntoro, se ami ñkenam Silo ami ñyaanam idahami ke ufọk a-akereke Anyịñ mmi, tembịd a-ndufo enieghe mbuọdidem, itie a-ami ñkinọọhọ ndufo ye mme eteete ndufo. <verse eid="JER 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15" />Ami ñyaisio ndufo ke iso mmi, kpa naña ami ñkesio afịd mbon Isrel ndufo, mbon Ifrem.’<verse eid="JER 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16" />“Ke ntoro kuubọñ akam unọọ ibon ami me adinịm ebeeñe; me ñkpeubọk unọọ ammọ, sia ndiikpañña utọñ unọ fiin. <verse eid="JER 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17" />Ado nte afo ukịtte se ammọ enam ke mme abio Yuda ye ke mme efaak Yeruselem? <verse eid="JER 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18" />Nditọ ekaa ifia, mme ete esịn ikañ, ndin mme eka enuakka ndomuyo enam uyo adinọ Abọọñanwaan Hefịn. Ammọ eduọk mme enọ ukọd enọ mme isen abasi nọ ato do edemme iyadesịd mmi. <verse eid="JER 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19" />Ado ami ke ammọ enam esịd ayat? <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. Nte ammọ ikappa inam idem ammọ ibak, esuenne idem ammọ?<verse eid="JER 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20" />“ ‘Ke ntoro ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara abo: Eyaenwañña iyadesịd mmi ye abom mmi efʌk ke itie ami, ke awo ye unam, ke eto inwañ ye ke ñkpọ inwañ ke isọñ ndufo; ndin anye ayaasak idiinyʌññọ inịme.<verse eid="JER 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21" />“ ‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ: Ikaa iso, idian mme ufọfọb uwa ye mme uwa ndufo mfen inyʌñ ita unam ado ke idem ndufo! <verse eid="JER 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22" />Sia idaha a-ami ñkebenne mme eteete ndufo nsio ke Iyib ñnyʌñ ntañ ikọ ye ammọ, ami ñkenọọhọ ammọ item mbaña mme ufọfọb uwa ye mme uwa kpọd, <verse eid="JER 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23" />ado ami mmaanọ ammọ ewʌhọ ami: Ikop item mmi, ndin ami ñyaado Abasi ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaenyʌñ edo mbon mmi. Isaña ke ñkobitem ke afịd ewʌhọ se ami inọọ ndufo, nọ ato do afọn ye ndufo. <verse eid="JER 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24" />Ado ammọ ikikoppo, ikiinyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ; utu ke ado, ammọ emaekeene mme nsọñiwuod ye ibak esịd ammọ. Ammọ emaetịmme edem utu ke ekaa iso. <verse eid="JER 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25" />Tọọñọ ke idaha a-mme ete ndufo ekekpọññọ Iyib tutu idahami, kwa usen, ini ke ini ami mmaadọñ mme isʌñutom mmi mme prọfed edi ibịne ndufo. <verse eid="JER 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26" />Ado ammọ ikikoppo ñkpọ innọ miin, ikiinyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ. Ammọ emaesọñ aboditọñ enyʌñ enam idiọọkñkpọ ekan mme eteete ammọ.’<verse eid="JER 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27" />“Afo amaakedọkkọ ammọ afịd ami, ammọ idiikpañña utọñ unọ fiin; afo umaukoot ammọ, ammọ idiibọọrọke. <verse eid="JER 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28" />Ke ntoro bo ammọ, ‘Ami ado idịd i-imiikoppo item inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ inyʌññọ ikop ntuunọ. Akpanikọ ibaaha; akpanikọ asop ke ñkpọkinua ammọ.<verse eid="JER 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29" />“ ‘Ifat ided ndufo itop iduọk; itọọñọ asaña-asaña aseeme ke mme anyọñ abod, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-asịn anyʌñ awọññọ edem akpọñ emana ami a-abaaha ke idak ifiobesịd amọ.<verse eid="JER 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abedeñ Uwodawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30" />“ ‘Mbon Yuda enam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen mmi, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. Ammọ enịm mme abʌd-abʌd ubobodñkpọ ammọ ke ufọk a-akereke Anyịñ mmi enyʌñ esappa anye. <verse eid="JER 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31" />Ammọ ebọp mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie Tofed ke Abedeñ Ben Hinọm adifọp nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ammọ ke ikañ; ñkpọ se ami ndiikinọọhọ ewʌhọ mbaña, idiikinyʌññọ idʌk esịd mmi. <verse eid="JER 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ke ntoro ikpeme, mme usen esʌk edi, a-mme awo imiidiikoodo anye aba Tofed me Abedeñ Ben Hinọm, ado Abedeñ Uwodawo, sia ammọ eyaebuuk mme akpañkpa ke Tofed tutu itie ibaaha aba. <verse eid="JER 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33" />Ndin mme akpo ibon ami eyaekappa edo ndidia enọ mme inuen ye mme ndiọi unam, ndin idiibaaha awo se ibịne ammọ isio. <verse eid="JER 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34" />Ami ñyaatre uyom inemesịd ye idaara ye mme uyio anwaanndọ ye ebendọ ke mme abio Yuda ye ke mme efaak Yeruselem, sia isọñ ado adiina ukpọk.<verse eid="JER 7:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1" />“ ‘Ke ini ado, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, eyaesiooño akpọ mme ndidem ye mme adaaha Yuda, akpọ mme aku ye mme prọfed, akpọ mbon Yeruselem ke mme udi ammọ. <verse eid="JER 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2" />Ayio ye afiọñ ye afịd udịm mme ntantaafiọñ ke mme hefịn a-ammọ ekemaaha enyʌñ enam ñkpọ enọ, e-ekenyʌññọ ekeene enyʌñ enam nduuñọ eto enyʌñ ekpono, eyaemia ammọ. Awo idiikoonoke ammọ idiinyʌññọ ibuuk, ado ammọ ediibono nte mbio ke isọñ. <verse eid="JER 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3" />Ini keed akeedodo a-ami ndiibịne ammọ nsio, mme andisʌhọ ke idiọọk abio ami eyaema ñkpa ekan uwem, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ.’<verse eid="JER 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Idiọọkñkpọ ye Ufen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4" />“Bo ammọ, ‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:4">“ ‘Ke ini mme awo eduọhọ, ado nte ammọ isidakkake ida?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:4">Awo amaawọññọ akpọñ usʌñ, ado nte isitịmmeke idi aba?<verse eid="JER 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5" />Nsoo ndin ido nọ ibon ami ewọññọ ekpọñ usʌñ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">Nsoo ido nọ Yeruselem asʌk asiwọññọ akpọñ usʌñ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:5">Ammọ eyịre ke abiaña;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">ammọ esịn aditịmme ndi.<verse eid="JER 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6" />Ami mmenekke ñkpañ utọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">ado ammọ itañña se inen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Ibaaha awo ammọ ndomokeed a-atuaha ñkpọfiọk abaña ibak amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">abo, “Nsoo ke ami nnam?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Ammọ keedekeed edo anie afañ awaak adʌk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">nte enañmbakara a-abịmmeke akaa anwan.<verse eid="JER 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7" />Akapado ikpañinyañ ke ikpaanyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">adiọọñọ ini e-emekke enọ anye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">ñko ibiom, akadañabasi ye akpantaña</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">ekpeme ini isañ ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">Ado mbon mmi idiọọñọke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayem.<verse eid="JER 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8" />“ ‘Esaña die ebo, “Ñnyịn ido mbon aniọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:8">sia ñnyịn iminie mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:8">ke ini adooho mme nsu-nsu etoñwed mme awedñwed</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:8">ekama anye ke nsu?<verse eid="JER 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9" />Eyaesịn mbon aniọñ ke abuud;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">idem ayaabọkkọ ammọ enyʌñ emʌm ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:9">Sia ammọ esịn ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">nsoo utọ aniọñ ke ammọ enie?<verse eid="JER 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10" />Ke ntoro ñyaabọ ibaan ammọ ñyaak nnọ ideen mfen edọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">ñnyʌñ ñyaak mme inwañ ammọ nnọ mme ufa andinie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Tọọñọ ke andisịb ñkan tutu akesịm andikpon ñkan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">afịd ediọọk itọñ eyem udod;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">mme prọfed ye mme aku ukem-ukem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">afịd enam abiaña.<verse eid="JER 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11" />Ammọ esọbọ enyʌñ ebọp unan ikọd mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:11">nte idooho akpan ñkpọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:11">Ammọ ebo, “Emem, emem,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:11">ke ini emem imiibaaha.<verse eid="JER 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12" />Ado nte ammọ ekop abuud ebaña mbubiam adinam ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">Iyoo, ammọ ikoppo abuud ndomokeed;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">ammọ inieghe iso abuud ndomokeed.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Ndin ammọ eyaeduọ ke atu mbon eduọhọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">eyaesuuhọ ammọ ke ini emaenọ ammọ ufen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atan.<verse eid="JER 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13" />“ ‘Ñyaakoono idọk ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">Kreb idiinwịmme ke fain.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Ndin fik idiinwịmme ke eto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">ndin mme mfañ ammọ eyaeyeeme.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Eyaebọ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">se ami nnọ ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14" />Nsoo ido nọ ñnyịn itie mi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">Iboho itie keed!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Yak ñnyịn ifeeñe ika mme ñkpọsọñ abio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">inyʌñ itak do!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn a-abiide ate yak ñnyịn itak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">ndin inọ ñnyịn mmọọñ ñkpa yak inwọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">sia ñnyịn iminam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso amọ.<verse eid="JER 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15" />Ñnyịn ikidot anyen ke emem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:15">ado ufọn ndomokeed ibaaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:15">ikidot anyen ke ini adikọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:15">ado ñkpọ ndịk ikpọọñ aba.<verse eid="JER 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16" />Tọọñọ ke Daan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">ke ikop naña mme enañmbakara mme asua efiara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">ke naña ñyaara enañmbakara esio uyio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">ndin afịd isọñ anyeeñe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">Ammọ edi adisobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">isọñ ye afịd ñkpọ se isịne ke esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">abio ye afịd awo e-edʌñọke do.<verse eid="JER 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17" />“Se, ami ñyaadọñ mme ndiọi udʌkikọd ke atu ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">mme ibọm a-awo imiikanna isuuk ide,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">ndin ammọ eyaidom ndufo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18" />Afo a-adooho Idọñesịd mmi ke mfʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:18">idem ammem miin.<verse eid="JER 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19" />Kpañ utọñ kop ntuaña mbon mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">ke ataa anyan isọñ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“Ado nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ibaaha ke Saiyọn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">Ado nte Adidem amọ ibaaha do aba?”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 8:19" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“Nsoo ido nọ ammọ edemme iyadesịd mmi ke mme ubobodñkpọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">ye mme mbiaña isen ubobodñkpọ?”<verse eid="JER 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20" />“Idọk aboiyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:20">ndaayio akweeñe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:20">ndin ñnyịn ikịtte adinyaaña.”<verse eid="JER 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21" />Sia emaesọnnọ mbon mmi, ensọnnọ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:21">ami mmefʌhọ ndin nnananyen ammʌm miin.<verse eid="JER 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22" />Ado nte ufọfiọññọ adan ibaaha ke Kilied?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:22">Ado nte abiaibọk ibaaha do?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">Nsoo ido ndin yak ukọk imiibaaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:22">inọ unan mbon mmi?<verse eid="JER 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9" />
  <para style="q1">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">9: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mme ikpañwed Hibru Yer 9:1 ewet Yer 8:23, ñko Yer 9:2-26 ewet Yer 9:1-25.</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1" />O, akpekapado iwuod mmi akedo idịm mmọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:1">anyen mmi ñko akpekapado idịm mmọọñayịd!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">Ami ñkpaatua uweemeayio ye akonayio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:1">nnọ mbon mmi ewotto.<verse eid="JER 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2" />O, akpedo ami mmenie itie nduọkadudu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">ke akpautatan nnọ mme akaisañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">nọ ami ñkpekpọñ mbon mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">ñnyʌñ ndakka ñkpọñ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">sia afịd ammọ edo mme asịn efịbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">ye atutu mbon abiaña.<verse eid="JER 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3" />“Ammọ ebeeñe edeme ammọ enịm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">nte utịgha, aditịgha mme nsu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">idooho ke akpanikọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">ke ammọ ekan ke isọñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Ammọ ewuọ ke idiọọkñkpọ keed edʌk mfen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">ammọ indiọọñọke miin,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4" />“Ikpeme idem ye mme ufan ndufo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">ikiibuọt idem ke awo ndomokeed ke ekpək ndufo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">Sia ammọ keedekeed edo mbon abiaña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">ndin afịd ufan edo abiadawo.<verse eid="JER 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5" />Ufan abiaña ufan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">ibaaha atañ akpanikọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">Ammọ ekpeep edeme ammọ adisʌhọ nsu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">idem amem ammọ anọ adinam idiọọkñkpọ.<verse eid="JER 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6" />Ndufo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Yerimaiya (ke Hibru ado Afo)</char></note> edʌñọ ke ufọọd abiaña;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:6">ke abiaña ammọ, ammọ esịn adindiọọñọ miin.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:6">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7" />Ke ntoro ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">“Se, ami ñyaanekke nnam ammọ efọn ñnyʌñ ndomo ammọ idomo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:7">sia nsoo mfen ke ami ñkpekan nnam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:7">ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ mbon mmi?<verse eid="JER 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8" />Edeme ammọ ado idañ ñkpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">anye atañ abiaña.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Ke inua, ammọ etañ nneem ifuuro ikọ ye mme mbọhọidʌñ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">ado ke esịd ammọ, ammọ ekọọk afia enọ mbọhọidʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9" />Nte ikpinaaha ami mmia ammọ ufen ke adinam ami?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:9">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:9">Nte ikpinaaha nsio usiene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:9">ye utọ idịd ami?<verse eid="JER 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10" />Ami ñyaatua ñnyʌñ nseeme ke ntak ikpọabod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">ñnyʌñ nnam eseeme mbaña isọñ mbid ke anaan ikọd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Ammọ enaa ukpọk, awo isañake ke esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">awo inyʌñọ ikop uyio enañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Mme inuen efeeñe afịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">mme unam enyʌñ enyọñọ.<verse eid="JER 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11" />“Ami ñyaanam Yeruselem ado adiono nsobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">itie ndidia mme ewaikọd;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">ndin ami ñyaasobo mme abio Yuda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">mbaak awo ndomokeed adikan adʌñ do.”<verse eid="JER 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12" />Anie awo anie aniọñ akem se ñkpọ ami anwaña anye? Anie ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atemme anye nọ akan atañ nọ anwaña? Nsoo ido ntak i-isọñ atakka ndin esobo anye nte akpautatan ake awo ndomokeed imiikanna ikaaña?<verse eid="JER 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Ado sia ammọ ekpọñ mbed mmi, a-ami nnịmme ammọ ke iso; ammọ ikoppo ikọ mmi, inyʌññọ ikeene mbed mmi. <verse eid="JER 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14" />Utu ke ado, ammọ ekeene ntịdutọñ esịd ammọ; ammọ ekeene mme Baal, naña mme eteete ammọ ekekpeep ammọ.” <verse eid="JER 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15" />Ke ntoro ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel abo: “Se, ami ñyaanam ibon ami edia idod-idod ndidia enyʌñ enwọñ mmọọñ esịnne ibọk ñkpa. <verse eid="JER 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16" />Ami ñyaasuan ammọ ke atu mme idịd a-adooho ammọ ye mme eteete ammọ idiọọñọke, ndin ami ñyaabịne ammọ ye akañkañ tutu ami nnam utịd ammọ adi.”<verse eid="JER 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">“Ikere idahami! Ikoot ibaan utua ayịd nọ edi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:17">idọñ nọ ekoot mbon enekkeke ediọọñọ utua ayịd ke atu ammọ.<verse eid="JER 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18" />Yak ammọ esọsọp edi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:18">enyʌñ editua ke ntak ñnyịn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">tutu anyen ñnyịn ayọhọ ye mmọọñayịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:18">ndin mmọọñ adịt ato ñkpọkanyen ñnyịn.<verse eid="JER 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19" />E-ekop uyom ntuaña eto Saiyọn:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">‘Se naña isobo ñnyịn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">Se naña ndọk ñnyịn akpon!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">Ana ñnyịn ikpọñ abio ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">sia mme ufọk ñnyịn eduọ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20" />Idahami, ndufo ibaan, ikop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">itat utọñ ndufo ikop mme ikọ e-etooho inua amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Ikpeep nditọ ibaan ndufo naña etua ayịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">ikpeep emọ-emọ aseeme.<verse eid="JER 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21" />Ñkpa adọọk adʌk ato ke mme ubenafịm ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">enyʌñ edʌk ñkpọsọñ itie ñnyịn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">anye a-akoono nditọ asio ke mme efaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">anyʌñ asio mme ñkparawa ke mme afe mbono.<verse eid="JER 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22" />Bo, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">“ ‘Mme akpo awo eyaebono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:22">nte mbio ke anwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">nte abakpa e-ekpịkkeke ke edem adọkidọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:22">ibaaha awo se ikoono ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:23">“Yak mbon aniọñ ekuukpọọ inua ebaña aniọñ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:23">mme akop uko ekuukpọọ inua ebaña adudu ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:23">mme imọ awo ekuukpọọ inua ebaña imọ ammọ,<verse eid="JER 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24" />ado yak andikpọ inua akpọ abaña anyem:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">ke ammọ e-enie ikike adindiọọñọ miin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-awọttọ mfọnido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">unen ye adinenido ke ederimbod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">sia ami mmekop inem ke mme ñkpọ ami.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 9:25" />“Mme usen esʌk edi,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “a-ami ndiimia afịd mbon enịmme ikpọkidem ammọ kpọd asana ufen, <verse eid="JER 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 9:26" />Iyib, Yuda, Edọm, Amọn, Mọb ye afịd mbon se idʌñ ke anaan ke mme anyan itie. Sia afịd mme idịd ami edo mbon emmiinịmme idem ammọ asana inọ Abọọñ, ukem ado ñko, kpa afịd ufọk Isrel inịmme esịd ammọ asana inọ Abọọñ.”<verse eid="JER 9:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10" />
  <para style="s1">Abasi ye mme Ubobodñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1" />Ikop se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ibo ndufo, mbon Isrel. <verse eid="JER 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">“Ikiikpeep usʌñ mme idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">ikiinyʌñ ikop ndịk ibaña mme idiọọñọ ke mme hefịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">akpesʌkado mme idịd ekoppo ndịk eto ammọ.<verse eid="JER 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3" />Sia mme adinam mbon awo edo ikpu-ikpu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">ammọ ekpịkke eto esio ke akai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">ndin anam utomusọ akama anuun amọ akap anye.<verse eid="JER 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4" />Ammọ edat silfa ye kold ediọñ anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:4">ammọ ekama ukọññkpọ ye akpohoukwak ekọñ anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:4">mbaak adinyeeñe.<verse eid="JER 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5" />Nte ñkpọndịk ke inwañ kukumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">mme ubobodñkpọ ammọ ikanna itañ ikọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">ana ededịppe ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">sia ammọ ikanna isaña isañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Ikiibaak ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">ammọ ikanna inam ibak ndomokeed,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">ammọ inyʌññọ ikan inam ñkpọ ndomokeed se ifọn.”<verse eid="JER 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ibaaha awo ndomokeed se iba nte afo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:6">afo amekpon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:6">anyịñ mfo akpon ke adudu.<verse eid="JER 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7" />Anie imiikpubaaha fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">Adidem mme idịd?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">Udeeme mfo ado ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Ke atu afịd mme adaukara ke mme idịd se inie aniọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">ye ke afịd abioubọọñ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">ibaaha ake atie nte afo.<verse eid="JER 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8" />Afịd ammọ enana ifiọk enyʌñ edoñño ndisịme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:8">mme andikpeeb ammọ edo mme ikpu-ikpu ubobodñkpọ.<verse eid="JER 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9" />Edat umemịñ silfa eto Taasis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">enyʌñ edat kold eto Ufas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">Se anam utom ubọk ye anamusọ kold anam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">ke esịn afọn se inie bru ye iduod-iduod ñkem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">afịd edo se mbon utomusọ enam.<verse eid="JER 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado ataa Abasi akpanikọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">anye ado aduuwem Abasi, nsi-nsi Adidem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Anye amaayat esịd, ekondo anyeeñe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">mme idịd ikanna iyọ ifiobesịd amọ.<verse eid="JER 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11" />“Dọkkọ ammọ bo: ‘Mme abasi ami, i-imiikinamma mme hefịn ye isọñ, eyaetahade ke isọñ ye ke idak mme hefịn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12" />Ado Abasi akebot ederimbod ke adudu amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">anye aketọọñọ ekondo ke aniọñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">anyʌñ atat mme hefịn ke ifiọk amọ.<verse eid="JER 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13" />Anye amaatop nte aduma, mme mmọọñ ke mme hefịn ekuun;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">anye anam mme ntọñanyọñ edakka tọọñọ ke mme utịd ederimbod.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">Anye adọñ akebkeb nọ asana ye edịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">anyʌñ asio afịm ke mme ufọk ubonoñkpọ amọ.<verse eid="JER 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14" />Afịd awo enana ifiọk ye ikike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">afịd anamusọ kold abọ asuenne ato mme ubobodñkpọ amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Mme ubobodñkpọ se anye anam edo abiaña;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">ibifịk ndomokeed isịneke ammọ ke idem.<verse eid="JER 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15" />Ammọ edo ikpu-ikpu, mme ñkpọ ndọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:15">ubiomikpe ammọ amaadi, ammọ eyaetak.<verse eid="JER 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16" />Anye a-adooho Udeeme Yekọb ibaaha nte mbon ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">sia anye ado Andinam afịd ñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">kpa ye Isrel, mbon e-edooho udeeme amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ado anyịñ amọ.<verse eid="JER 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsobo A-adiighe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17" />Ikoono ñkpoduoho ndufo inyʌñ ikpọñ isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:17">ndufo e-edʌñọke ke abio e-ekannake ekʌk.<verse eid="JER 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18" />Sia ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">“Idaha ntom ami ñyaatop</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">mbon e-edʌññọ ke isọñ ami nsio;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:18">ami ñyaaben ayeemensia nsọk ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">nọ ato do emʌm ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19" />Adọdiọọk annọ miin ke ntak unan mmi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:19">Unan mmi inieghe ukọk!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Kpayeado ami mbo idem mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:19">“Udọñọ mmi ado ami, ndin ana ami ñyọ anye.”<verse eid="JER 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20" />E-esobo atayad mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">e-ekpok afịd udʌk amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Nditọ mmi eñkpọñ miin inyʌññọ iba aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">awo ndomokeed ibaaha aba se inekke atayad mmi idaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">me adibọp itieidʌñ mmi.<verse eid="JER 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21" />Mme akpemeedọñ inieghe iwuod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">inyʌññọ ibịp <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">ke ntoro ammọ iforoke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">ndin afịd ufene ammọ esuana.<verse eid="JER 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22" />Ikpañ utọñ! Etob asʌk adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">akpọsọñ aditịm ato adoro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">Ami ñyaanam mme abio Yuda enaa ukpọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">akappa itie ndidia mme ewaikọd.<verse eid="JER 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akam Yerimaiya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ami mmediọọñọ ke uwem mbon awo isịneke ammọ ke ubọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:23">idooho itie ammọ adikpeme ukodisañ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24" />Ntʌnọ miin, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado yak ado ke udomo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:24">ke ado ke iyadesịd mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:24">imiidooho afo ayaanam ami ndooho ñkpọ aba.<verse eid="JER 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25" />Duọk ifiobesịd mfo ke mme idịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">i-imuudiọọñọke fiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">ke mbon awo i-imiikoodo anyịñ mfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">Sia ammọ emaesobo Yekọb;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">ammọ emaesobo anye ataa afịd-afịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">enyʌñ esobo isọñ emana amọ.<verse eid="JER 10:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiat Edioomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 11:1" />Ikọ a-aketooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adisịm Yerimaiya ado ami: <verse eid="JER 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 11:2" />“Kpañ utọñ kop mme ikọ edioomo ami nyʌñ tañ wọt mbon Yuda ye mbon se idʌñọ ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="JER 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 11:3" />Dọkkọ ammọ bo ke se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel abo ado ami: ‘Isuuñọ anie awo i-imiinịmme mme ikọ edioomo ami; <verse eid="JER 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4" />mme ikọ a-ami ñkewuuhọ mme eteete ndufo idaha ami ñkebenne ammọ nsio ke Iyib, nsio ke ikañ utadukwak.’ Ami mmaabo, ‘Ikop item mmi inyʌñ inam afịd se ami itemme ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaedo mbon mmi, ami ñko ñyaado Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="JER 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5" />Ndin ami ñyaanam enwọñọ a-ami ñkenwọñọke nnọ mme eteete ndufo, adinọ ammọ isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk,’ isọñ a-ndufo enieghe mfịn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 11:5">Ami mmaabọọrọ, “Amen, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="JER 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Suan mme ikọ ami ke mme abio Yuda ye ke mme efaak Yeruselem: ‘Kpañ utọñ nọ mme ikọ edioomo ami nyʌñ keene ammọ. <verse eid="JER 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7" />Tọọñọ ke idaha a-ami ñkesioho mme eteete ndufo ke Iyib tutu asịm mfịn ami, ami mmaadʌt ammọ utọñ, mmaana ndʌt, nte, “Ikop uyio mmi.” <verse eid="JER 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8" />Ado ammọ ikikoppo, inyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ; utu ke ado, ammọ ekekeene nsọñiwuod ibak esịd ammọ. Ke ntoro ami mmaaben afịd mme isuuñọ edioomo a-ami ñkewuuhọ ammọ nọ ekeene ado ammọ ikinamma.’ ”<verse eid="JER 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9" />Akem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Idiọọk edioomo aba ke atu mbon Yuda ye mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="JER 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10" />Ammọ etịmme ebịne mme idiọọkñkpọ mme eteete ammọ, e-ekesịnne edikop mme ikọ mmi. Ammọ ekeene mme abasi mfen adinam ñkpọ nnọọ ammọ. Isrel ye Yuda ebiat edioomo ami ñkenamma ye mme eteete ammọ. <verse eid="JER 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11" />Ke ntoro ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: ‘Ami ñyaaben afanekọñ a-ammọ imiidiikanna ibọkkọ mbịne ammọ. Akpesʌkado ammọ etuaha ennọọ miin, ami ndiikpañña utọñ nnọ ammọ. <verse eid="JER 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12" />Mme abio Yuda ye mbon Yeruselem eyaekaa eketua enọ mme abasi a-ammọ efọppọ insensi enọ, ado ammọ idiinwamma ammọ ke ini nnananyen asịmme ammọ. <verse eid="JER 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13" />Afo, Yuda, amenie uwak mme abasi ukem naña mme abio mfo ewak; ndin mme akpokoro uwa a-ndufo enịmme edifọp insensi nnọọ abʌd-abʌd abasi ado Baal ewak nte mme efaak ke Yeruselem.’<verse eid="JER 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14" />“Kuubọñ akam unọọ ibon ami, kuunyʌñ unam ñkpeubọk me ebeeñe unọọ ammọ, sia ami ndiikoppo idaha se ammọ ediñkoot ke ini nnananyen ammọ.<verse eid="JER 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15" />“Nsoo ke edima mmi anam ke tembịd mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">naña anye, ye uwak mbon mfen, anam ndiọi uduak amọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">Nte adisana unam akpa akan aben ufen mfo esio?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:15">Idaha afo anamma ibak mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">afo adaara.”<verse eid="JER 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akukoot fiin nseghe eto ọlif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">ye nti mfịd eyaiyake idem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:16">Ado ye uyom ekamba ayobio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">anye ayaakịm ikañ ke esịd amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">ndin mme ñkọk amọ eyaebʌñọ.<verse eid="JER 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, a-akutọọhọ fiin, a-abiide nsobo unọ fiin, sia mbon Isrel ye Yuda e-enam idiọọkñkpọ enyʌñ edemme iyadesịd mmi ke adifọp insensi nnọọ Baal.<verse eid="JER 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Idiọọk Edioomo ke Abaña Yerimaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaara idiọọk edioomo ammọ annọ miin, ami mmaadiọọñọ, sia ke ini ado anye amañwọt miin se ammọ ekenam. <verse eid="JER 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19" />Ami ñkeba nte usʌk-usʌk ñyịn edọñ ebenne eka adiwot; ami ñkidiọọñọke ke ammọ emaeduak idiọọk uduak embaña miin, ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">“Yak ñnyịn isobo eto ye mfịd amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">yak ñnyịn ikpịkke anye isio ke isọñ mme aduuwem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">mbaak editoiyo anyịñ amọ aba.”<verse eid="JER 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20" />Ado afo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan a-akpeeghe unen ikpe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">anyʌñ adomo esịd ye akikere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">yak ami ñkịt naña afo asio usiene ke idem ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">sia ami mmeyaak mfịna mmi usịn fiin ke ubọk.<verse eid="JER 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21" />Ke ntoro ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ abaña mbon Anatod e-eduakka aduwot fiin, ate, “Kuutañ ñkukịd ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> imiidooho ñnyịn iyauwot fiin”; <verse eid="JER 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22" />ke ntoro ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan abo: “Ami ñyaamia ammọ ufen. Ñkparawa ammọ eyaekpa ke akañkañ, nditọ ideen ammọ ye nditọ ibaan ammọ ke akañ. <verse eid="JER 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23" />Nsʌhọ ndomokeed idiisʌhọke inọ ammọ, sia ami ñyaadat nsobo nsọk mbon Anatod ke isua ufen ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12" />
  <para style="s1">Aseeme Yerimaiya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Afịd ini afo ado adinen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">ke ini ami mbenne ikpe ndi iso mfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Kpayeado ami ñyem aditañ ikọ mbana unen mfo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Nsoo ido nọ usʌñ idiọọk awo aseghe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Nsoo ido nọ mbon abiaña eba ke ifuuro?<verse eid="JER 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2" />Afo ametọ ammọ, ndin ammọ enie ñkam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">ammọ ekọt enyʌñ enwịm mfịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Afo aba ke inua ammọ afịd ini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">ado anyọọñ usʌñ akpọñ esịd ammọ.<verse eid="JER 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3" />Kpayeado, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, afo amendiọọñọ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">afo ameñkịt miin anyʌñ adomo mme akikere mmi u-ubañake fiin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Dʌt ammọ sio nte edọñ eyemme edikiwot!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">Sio ammọ nịm nọ usen ediwot ammọ!<verse eid="JER 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4" />Isọñ adiina nsaad ikpeene die,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">ñko mbid ke afịd inwañ adiiyeeme ikpeene die?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Sia mbon se idʌñ ke esịd edo mbon ibak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">mme unam ye mme inuen etak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Ñko, mbon awo ebo ete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">“Anye idiikịtte se itịppe inọọ ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JER 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibọọrọ Abasi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5" />“Adieke adooho afo amefeghe ke ukod ye mme awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">ndin ammọ enam afo akpa mba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">die ke afo uduukan udomo idem ye mme enañmbakara?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">Adieke afo afʌmmọke ke ifuuro isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">uduunam die ke ñkpukọọmọ mben Yọdan?<verse eid="JER 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6" />Ubon mfo, mbon esịdufọk mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">ammọ ñko u-ubiaña fiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">ammọ ekap esio ñkpo ubaña fiin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">Kuunie mbuọdidem ke idem ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">akpekọm a-adooho ammọ etañ eti ikọ ubaña fiin.<verse eid="JER 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7" />“Ami ñyaakpọñ ufọk mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">nsịn udeeme mmi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">ami ñyaayaak anye a-ami mmaaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">nsịn ke ubọk mme asua amọ.<verse eid="JER 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8" />Udeeme mmi aba annọ miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">nte ekpe ke akai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">Anye añkuun miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">ke ntoro ami mmesua anye.<verse eid="JER 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9" />Ñkọ udeeme mmi ikappake iba innọ miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">nte ekpaekpañ inuen akịm inuen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">a-mme inuen mfen ekannake ekʌk enyʌñ enwana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Ikaa ikikoono afịd mme ndiọi unam ikọd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">iben ammọ idi yak edita.<verse eid="JER 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10" />Uwak mme akpemeedọñ eyaesobo inwañ fain mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">enyʌñ esọnnọ inwañ mmi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">ammọ eyaekappa inwañ inemesịd mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">esịn ke mbiadaisọñ nsobo.<verse eid="JER 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11" />Eyaenam anye akappa ado mbiadaisọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:11">asaat, anyʌñ anaa ukpọk ke iso mmi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">afịd isọñ ayaabiaña</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:11">sia ibaaha awo se ise anyen.<verse eid="JER 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12" />Ke afịd ukpọk abod ke akpautatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">mme andisobo eyaeyọhọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">sia akañkañ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaasobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">tọọñọ ke mbeñ isọñ keed tutu awuọ mbeñ uko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">ibaaha awo a-adiibọkkọ.<verse eid="JER 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13" />Ammọ eyaetọ abakpa ado edọk mbaraekpe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">ammọ eyaewa idem ado ikịtte udod ndomokeed.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Ammọ eyaekop abuud ebaña mbunwịm ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">ke ntak akpọsọñ iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="JER 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ: “Amaado afịd mme ibak mbọhọidʌñ mmi e-ekoonoke udeeme a-ami ñkenọọhọ mbon mmi Isrel ke ñkanubọk, ami ñyaawịppe ammọ nsio ke isọñ ammọ ñnyʌñ ñwịppe mbon Yuda nsio ke atu ammọ. <verse eid="JER 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15" />Ado ke ami mmaawịppe ammọ mma, ami ñyaamaana ñkop mbọm mbaña ammọ, ñnyʌñ mmaana mben ammọ ntịmme ndinọ udeeme ammọ ye idịd ammọ. <verse eid="JER 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16" />Ndin adieke ammọ enekkeke ekpeep mme usʌñ mbon mmi enyʌñ enwọñọ ke anyịñ mmi, ete, ‘Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem’ kpa naña ammọ ekekpeep mbon mmi edinwọñọ ke Baal; ammọ eyaenie iwuuk ke atu mbon mmi. <verse eid="JER 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17" />Ado adieke idịd ndomokeed imiikpañña utọñ, ami ñyaawịppe anye ataa afịd-afịd ñnyʌñ nsobo,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpaha Linen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ annọọ miin ado ami: “Kaa kedep ñkpaha linen nyʌñ kpaha anye ke isịn mfo, ado kuuyak anye atuuk mmọọñ.” <verse eid="JER 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2" />Ndin ami mmaadep ñkpaha, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akentemme, ñnyʌñ ñkpaha ñkanna isịn mmi.<verse eid="JER 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3" />Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaamaana adinsịm idem ayọhọ akañ iba: <verse eid="JER 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4" />“Dat ñkpaha a-afo akedeppe anyʌñ akpaha akanna isịn mfo, ndin kaa Perad idahami nyʌñ dịp anye ke mme mfafaha abaitiad.” <verse eid="JER 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5" />Ndin ami mmaaben anye ñkaa ñkedịp ke Perad, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akembo miin.<verse eid="JER 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6" />Ke uwak usen emaekeboiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Kaa Perad idahami nyʌñ ke ben ñkpaha a-ami ñkebooho yak aben akedịp do.” <verse eid="JER 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7" />Ndin ami mmaakaa Perad ñnyʌñ ñkedọk ñkpaha nsio ndin mmaaben anye nsio ke itie a-ami ñkedịppe anye, ado idahami anye amaabiara inyʌññọ iba ufọn aba.<verse eid="JER 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8" />Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadinsịm miin ate: <verse eid="JER 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9" />“Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: ‘Ke ukem usʌñ ami ñyaasobo uku Yuda ye ekamba uku Yeruselem. <verse eid="JER 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10" />Mbon ibak ami, e-esịnne edikpañ utọñ ñkop mme ikọ mmi, e-ekeeneke nsọñiwuod esịd ammọ enyʌñ ekeene mme abasi mfen edinam ñkpọ ñnyʌñ ñkpono ammọ, ediiba nte ñkpaha ami, ibaaha ufọn ndomokeed! <verse eid="JER 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11" />Sia kpa naña ekpaha ñkpaha ekanna isịn, ntoro ke ami ñkpaha mbon Isrel ye afịd mbon Yuda ndian ke idem mmi,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ‘adido ñwuọnda mbon mmi ke itooro ye ukpono. Ado ammọ ikpañña utọñ.’<verse eid="JER 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ekpadukọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12" />“Bo ammọ: ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Akpena edọñ ukọd yak ayọhọ afịd ikịmukọd.’ Ndin adieke ammọ ubooho fiin, ‘Ado nte ñnyịn idiọọñọke ke akpena edọñ ukọd yak ayọhọ afịd ikịmukọd?’ <verse eid="JER 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13" />dọkkọ ammọ, ‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: Ami ñyaanam afịd awo se idʌñ ke isọñ ami eyọhọ ye inaam ukọd, tutu asịm mme ndidem e-etieghe ke ebekpo Defid, mme aku, mme prọfed ye afịd mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="JER 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14" />Ami ñyaaben ammọ ntọ ye emọ-emọ, mme ete ye mme eka ye nditọ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. Ami ndiiyakka udʌk me mbọm me ima añkpan miin adisobo ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndịk Usịnukad</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15" />Kpañ utọñ nyʌñ kop,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">kuukokko idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16" />Nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo ubọọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">mbemiso anye adat ekịm adi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">mbemiso afo atuak ukod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">ke mme ñkịm-ñkịm abod.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">Afo adot anyen ke unwana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">ado Abasi ayaakappa anye asịn ke ataa ekịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">anyʌñ awọññọ anye asịn ke ndobo ekịm.<verse eid="JER 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17" />Adieke ndufo imiikpañña utọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">ami ñyaatua ke ndịbe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">ke ntak ntañidem ndufo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">anyen mmi ayaatua idod-idod ayịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">mmọọñayịd a-ayọhọ aduọi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">sia eyaekoono udịmedọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ekesịn ke ukad.<verse eid="JER 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18" />Bo adidem ye abọọñanwaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">“Isọiyọ ito mme ebekpo ndufo idi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">sia mme uyaiya anyanya ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">eyaedooño ke iwuod ndufo eduọññọ.”<verse eid="JER 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19" />Eyaekuuk mme abio ke Nekef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">ndin idiibaaha awo ndomokeed se ikʌkkọ ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:19">Eyaekoono afịd Yuda esio ekaa asen idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">ekoono ataa afịd-afịd.<verse eid="JER 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20" />Dịppe anyen ke anyọñ nyʌñ kịt</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">mbon e-etooho adoro edi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:20">Mmọ udịmedọñ e-ekeyaaha usịn fiin ke ubọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">mme edọñ a-afo akekpọọhọ inua abaña?<verse eid="JER 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21" />Nsoo ke afo uduutañ idaha <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> aduunọ ufen ke adinam nọ mbon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">a-afo akedatta nte mme akpan nsaña mfo edukara fiin?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:21">Nte ubiak iduumʌmmọ fiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">nte awonwaan a-abaaha ke ubiakuman?<verse eid="JER 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22" />Ndin adieke afo abịppe idem mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">“Nsoo ido nọ ñkpọ ami atịppe annọ miin?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">Ato ke ntak mme uwak idiọọkñkpọ mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">ke ewaak mme ñkpịn mfo esio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">enyʌñ esappa idem mfo.<verse eid="JER 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23" />Nte awo Etiopia akeme adikpəho ikpọkidem amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:23">me ekpeñkem akeme adikpəho ñkem amọ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">Kpa ntoro afo ukanna unam eti ñkpọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:23">ke ini unam idiọọkñkpọ amaakumeghe.<verse eid="JER 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24" />“Ami ñyaisuan ndufo nte mbio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:24">a-afịm akpautatan asuanna.<verse eid="JER 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25" />Udeeme ndufo ado ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">udeeme a-ami mbiereke inọọ ndufo,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:25">“sia ndufo ememfre miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">enyʌñ ebuọt idem ke mme nsu-nsu abasi.<verse eid="JER 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26" />Ami ñyaadịppe mme ñkpịn ndufo ifʌk ndufo iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:26">nọ ekịt ndọk ndufo;<verse eid="JER 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27" />mme uyom efịbe ye akpọsọñ idiọọk udọñ ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">unana iso abuud akpara ndufo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Ami mmekịt mme mbubiam ido ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">ke mme abod ye ke mme inwañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Adọdiọọk inọ ndufo, Yeruselem!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">Adiikpeene die ndufo editre adisana?”<verse eid="JER 13:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14" />
  <para style="s1">Unana Mmọọñ, Akañ, ye Akañkañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1" />Ami ado ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedisịmme Yerimaiya ke abaña unana mmọọñ:<verse eid="JER 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2" />“Yuda afʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">mme abio amọ eyeeme;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">ammọ etua enọ isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">ntuaña adọọk ato Yeruselem.<verse eid="JER 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3" />Mme ñkpisọñ edọñ nditọufọk ammọ ekeyem mmọọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">ammọ ekaa ube mmọọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">ado ikịtte mmọọñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Enyọñ edi ye ukpọk abañ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">ke mfʌhọ ye ayeemensia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">ammọ efʌk iwuod ammọ.<verse eid="JER 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4" />Isọñ asaiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:4">sia edịm ideppe ke isọñ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:4">mme atọinwañ eyeeme nsia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:4">enyʌñ efʌk iwuod ammọ.<verse eid="JER 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5" />Kpa edob ke inwañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:5">adakka akpọñ ñyịn amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:5">sia mbid se ata ibaaha.<verse eid="JER 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6" />Mme dọñki ikọd eda ke ukpọk abod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:6">enweek nte mme ewaikọd;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">anyen akịm ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:6">ato unana ndidia.”<verse eid="JER 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7" />Akpesʌkado ndiọiñkpọ ñnyịn etieghe ntiense ibaña ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke ntak anyịñ mfo, nam ñkpọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Sia ñnyịn imisọñ iwuod uwak ini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">ñnyịn imudue fiin.<verse eid="JER 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8" />Afo a-adooho idodanyen Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">andinyaaña amọ ke ini afanekọñ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">nsoo ido ntak a-afo abaaha nte asenawo ke isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">nte akaisañ a-anaaha akonayio keed kpọd?<verse eid="JER 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9" />Nsoo ido ntak a-afo abaaha nte awodeen ebenne adiwad-adiwad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">nte awo ekọñ i-imiinieghe ukeme adinyaaña?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, afo mmọdo ke atu ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">ñnyịn inyʌñ ikere anyịñ mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">kuusịn ñnyịn!<verse eid="JER 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ abaña ibon ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">“Ammọ enekke ema adiyooñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">ukod ammọ inaaha itie keed.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> iyemme ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">idahami anye ayaatoiyo mme ndoom ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">anyʌñ amia ammọ ufen ke mme idiọọkñkpọ ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Kuubọñ akam uyem ufọn ibon ami. <verse eid="JER 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12" />Akpesʌkado a-ammọ etieghe utreudia, ami ndiikoppo ntuaayịd ammọ; akpekọm enọ ufọfọb uwa ye enọ abakpa, ami ndiibọọhọ ammọ. Utu ke ado, ami ñyaasobo ammọ ke akañkañ, akañ ye udọñọ nsobo.”<verse eid="JER 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13" />Ado mmaabo, “Sai, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara! Mme prọfed esʌk edọkkọ ammọ, ‘Ndufo idiikịtte akañkañ me akañ. Ke akpanikọ ñyainọ ndufo anyan emem ke itie ami.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Mme prọfed etañ nsu-nsu ñkukịd ke anyịñ mmi. Ami ndọññọ ammọ, ñnyʌññọ mmek ammọ, ñnyʌññọ ntañ ikọ ye ammọ. Ammọ etañ abiaña ñkukịd, ebre idiọñ, ekpono ubobodñkpọ ye abiaña esịd ammọ. <verse eid="JER 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15" />Ke ntoro ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ abaña mme prọfed e-etañña ñkukịd ke anyịñ mmi: Ami ñkidọññọ ammọ, ado ammọ esʌk ebo, ‘Akañkañ ndomokeed me akañ idiisịmme isọñ ami.’ Kpa mme prọfed ado ediikpañña ke akañkañ ye akañ. <verse eid="JER 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16" />Ndin eyaetop mbon se ammọ etañ prọfesi enọ esio ke mme efaak Yeruselem ke ntak akañ ye akañkañ. Idiibaaha awo se ibuuk ammọ, ibaan ammọ, nditọ ideen ammọ ye nditọ ibaan ammọ. Ami ñyaanwañña nnananyen a-adotto ye ammọ mfʌk ammọ.<verse eid="JER 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17" />“Tañ ikọ ami nọ ammọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">“ ‘Yak anyen mmi ayọhọ ye mmọọñayịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">akonayio ye uweemeayio, utịd ibaaha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">sia Abọikpa, mbon mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">anie ekamba unan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">akpọsọñ umia.<verse eid="JER 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18" />Adieke ami ñkaaha esịd idʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">ami ñkịt mbon ewotto ke akañkañ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">adieke ami ñkaaha abio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">ami ñkịt ndutịme se akañ asịn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Prọfed ye aku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">eka isọñ a-ammọ imiidiọọñọke.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19" />Ado nte afo amesịn Yuda afịd-afịd?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">Nte afo amesọọn Saiyọn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Nsoo ido nọ afo ikuut ñnyịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">nọ ñnyịn imiikanna inie ukọk?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Ñnyịn ikinie idodanyen ke emem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">ado ufọn ndomokeed ibaaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">idodanyen ke ini ukọk udọñọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">ado ekamba ndịk ikpọọñ aba.<verse eid="JER 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20" />Ñnyịn imikịt ndoom ñnyịn, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:20">ye ndudue mme eteete ñnyịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:20">ke akpanikọ ñnyịn imudue fiin.<verse eid="JER 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21" />Ke ntak anyịñ mfo kuusọọn ñnyịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">kuusuenne ebekpo ubọọñ mfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">Toiyo edioomo mfo ye ñnyịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">ndin kuubiat anye.<verse eid="JER 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22" />Nte ndisịme ubobodñkpọ mme idịd ndomokeed ke ekondo akeme inam edịm adep?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">Nte mme ikpaanyọñ ke idem ammọ ekeme inọ mbara?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Iyoo, ado afo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">Ke ntoro idodanyen ñnyịn ado ke afo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">sia afo ado andinam afịd ami.<verse eid="JER 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin: “Akpekọm Moses ye Samwel ekpeda ke iso mmi, esịd mmi awuọ akpọñ ibon ami. Bịne ammọ sio ke iso mmi! Yak ammọ eka! <verse eid="JER 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2" />Ndin adieke ammọ ubịppe fiin, ‘Ñnyịn idiika uke?’ bo ammọ, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">“ ‘Mbon enịmme enọ ñkpa, ekaa ñkpa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">mbon enịmme enọ akañkañ, ekaa akañkañ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">mbon enịmme enọ akañ, ekaa akañ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">mbon enịmme enọ ñkọbntem, ekaa ñkọbntem.’<verse eid="JER 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3" />“Ami ñyaadọñ utọ aduuk nsobo inaañ nnọ ammọ,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “akañkañ adiwot ammọ, mme ewa adidʌt ammọ nsioño, ndin mme inuen ye ndiọi unam adita ñnyʌñ nsobo ammọ. <verse eid="JER 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4" />Ami ñyaanam ammọ edo ñkpọ itekesịd enọ afịd mme idịd ke ederimbod ke ntak se Manase ayịn Hesikaiya adidem Yuda akenam ke Yeruselem.<verse eid="JER 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5" />“Yeruselem, anie adiinie mbọm ubaña fiin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Anie adiifʌhọ unọ fiin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Anie adiituak ida ibịp me abadie ye afo?<verse eid="JER 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6" />Afo amensịn miin,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">“Afo asʌk akaaka iso ke mfiakedem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">Ke ntoro ami ñyaawuọ ubịne, ñnyʌñ usobo fiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">Ami mmekpa mba ke adukop udʌk.<verse eid="JER 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7" />Ami ñyaakeñ ammọ ke ukwak ukeñ ñkpọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">ke mme inuaatob isọñ ado.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">Ami ñyaadat ñkpa ye nsobo nsọk mbon mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">sia ammọ ikpəhoke mme eduuwem ammọ.<verse eid="JER 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8" />Ami ñyaanam mme ebekpa ammọ enekke ewak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">ekan ntan ke akpainyañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Ke ufọọd uweemeayio ami ñyaadat andisobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">ñkeene mme eka ñkparawa ideen ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">ke adiwad-adiwad ami ñyaadat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">ayeemensia ye akpọsọñ ndịk nsọk ammọ.<verse eid="JER 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9" />Eka aman itiaba ayaakop mmemidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">anyʌñ anweek akpatre ibifịk amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Utịn amọ ayaasop ke ini asʌkkọ ado uweemeayio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">eyaesuenne enyʌñ esuuhọ anye itie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Ami ñyaawot mbon se isʌhọ ke akañkañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">ke iso mme asua ammọ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10" />Sai, eka mmi, afo a-akemmanna miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:10">awodeen a-afịd isọñ enwanake enyʌñ enie utọk!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:10">Akenaanam ami ñwuọdọ awo ewuọd ñnyʌññọ mbọbọ awo isọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:10">kpayeado afịd awo ensueñ miin.<verse eid="JER 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:11">“Ke akpanikọ ami ñyaunyaaña fiin ke eti ntak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:11">ke akpanikọ ami ñyaanam mme asua mfo ukpeiye fiin ubọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:11">ke ini afanekọñ ye ini nnananyen.<verse eid="JER 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12" />“Nte awo akeme adibuuñ ukwak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:12">ukwak a-atooho adoro, me brọns?<verse eid="JER 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13" />“Imọ mfo ye mme ñkpọuto mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:13">ami ñyaaben nnọ nte mbịme, ke mfọn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:13">ke ntak afịd ndiọiñkpọ mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:13">ke afịd idịd ndufo.<verse eid="JER 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14" />Ami ñyaisịn ndufo ufʌn nnọ mme asua ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:14">ke isọñ a-ndufo imiidiọọñọke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:14">sia iyadesịd mmi ayaabịppe ikañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:14">a-adiita ndufo.”<verse eid="JER 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, u-unwaña fiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">ntoiyo miin nyʌñ se ñkpọ mbaña miin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">Sio mbon se iñkọbọ miin usiene nnọ miin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Afo ado anyanime, kumben miin usio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">kere naña ami ndia ndọk ke ntak mfo.<verse eid="JER 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16" />Ke ini ikọ mfo akediighe, ami mmaadia ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">ammọ ekedo inemesịd mmi ye idadesịd mmi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">sia ami ñkere anyịñ mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan.<verse eid="JER 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17" />Kpaanam ami ntieghe ke atu mbon nsaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">kpaanam mbuuroke mbuuro ye ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">Ami ñketie ikpọọñ sia ubọk mfo amandoro miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">ndin afo amañyọhọ miin ye iyadesịd<verse eid="JER 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18" />Nsoo ido ntak u-ubiak mmi imiitreke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">ndin unan mmi anyʌñ akpon inieghe ukọk?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">Afo atie nte idịm abiaña annọ miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">nte idịm a-asatta.<verse eid="JER 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">“Adieke afo akappake esịd, ami ñyaamaana udịppe fiin ndot</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">nọ afo anam ñkpọ annọ miin;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">adieke afo atañña nti ikọ, idooho ndiọi ikọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">afo adiido atañikọ innọ miin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Yak ibon ami ekanna ubịne fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">ado inaaha afo akanna abịne ammọ.<verse eid="JER 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20" />Ami ñyaunam fiin ado ndibene anọ ibon ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">akpọsọñ ndibene brọns;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">ammọ eyaenwana ye afo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">ado iduukanna fiin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">sia ami mmọdo ye afo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">adufak ñnyʌñ unyaaña fiin,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21" />“Ami ñyaunyaaña fiin nsio ke ubọk mbon ibak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:21">ñnyʌñ ufak fiin nsio ke ubọk mbon ndoom.”<verse eid="JER 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16" />
  <para style="s1">Usen Nnananyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1" />Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadinsịm miin idem ate: <verse eid="JER 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2" />“Inaaha ndufo edọ ndọ enyʌñ enie nditọ ideen me nditọ ibaan ke itie ami.” <verse eid="JER 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 16:3" />Sia se Abọọñ atañ abaña nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan e-emanna ke isọñ ami ye mme eka ye mme ete ammọ ado ami: <verse eid="JER 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 16:4" />“Ammọ ediikpa ito ndiọi udọñọ. Awo idiifʌhọke ñkpa ammọ, idiinyʌññọ ibuuk ammọ, ado ediitie nte uduañ ke isọñ. Ediisobo ammọ ke akañkañ ye akañ, ndin akpo ammọ ediido ndidia inọ mme inuen ye mme ndiọi unam.”<verse eid="JER 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5" />Sia se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: “Kuudʌk ufọk se ndidia ufọkikpo aba; kuukaa ukufʌhọ me adikiseeme, sia ami mmaaben adidiọñ mmi, ima mmi ye mbọm mmi nsio ñkpọñ ibon ami,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="JER 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6" />“Ñkpoon ye ntək eyaekpañña ke isọñ ami. Awo idiibuuho ammọ, idiinyʌññọ ifʌhọ ammọ, ndin awo ndomokeed idiikpịkkeke idem ammọ me adifat ided ammọ ke ntak mme akpañkpa. <verse eid="JER 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7" />Awo ndomokeed idiinọọhọ ndidia adidọñ mbon se ifʌhọ mme akpañkpa esịd; akpọkọm ado ete me eka, awo ndomokeed idiinyʌññọ inọ ammọ ukọd adidọñ ammọ esịd.<verse eid="JER 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8" />“Kuunyʌñ udʌk ufọk e-enamma usọrọ usuuk utie udia unyʌñ unwọñ. <verse eid="JER 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9" />Sia se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Ke iso mfo ye ke ayio uwem mfo, ami ñyaatre mme uyom inemesịd ye idaara ye mme uyio anwaanndọ ye ebendọ ke itie ami.<verse eid="JER 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10" />“Ke ini afo adọkkọke ibon ami afịd ñkpọ ami ndin ammọ ubịp fiin, ‘Nsoo ido ntak yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abiide utọ ekamba afanekọñ ami inọọ ñnyịn? Nsoo ke ñnyịn idue? Nsoo idiọọkñkpọ ke ñnyịn inam ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn?’ <verse eid="JER 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11" />bo ammọ, ‘Ado sia mme eteete ndufo emaeñkpọñ miin,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ‘enyʌñ ekeene mme abasi mfen enyʌñ enam ñkpọ enọ ammọ enyʌñ ekpono ammọ. Ammọ emaeñkpọñ miin inyʌññọ inịm mbed mmi. <verse eid="JER 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12" />Ado ndufo emenam ibak ekan mme eteete ndufo. Se naña afịd ndufo ekeene nsọñiwuod ibak esịd ndufo utu ke ndufo ekop item mmi. <verse eid="JER 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13" />Ke ntoro ami ñyaitop ndufo nsio ke isọñ ami ñkesịn ke isọñ a-adooho ndufo me mme eteete ndufo idiọọñọke, ndin do ke ndufo ediinam ñkpọ inọ mme abasi mfen uweemeayio ye akonayio, sia ami ndiifọnnọ mfọn ye ndufo.’<verse eid="JER 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14" />“Kpayeado, mme usen esʌk edi,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “a-awo imiidibooho aba, ‘Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem, a-akesioho mbon Isrel ke Iyib,’ <verse eid="JER 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15" />ado ediibo, ‘Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem, a-akesioho nditọ Isrel ato ke isọñ adoro ye ke mme afịd idịd a-anye akesuanna ammọ akebon.’ Sia ami ñyaamaana nnọ ammọ isọñ añkenọọhọ mme eteete ammọ.<verse eid="JER 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16" />“Ado idahami ami ñyaadọñ ekoot uwak mme akọiyak,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “ndin ammọ eyaemʌm ammọ. Ke ado amaaboiyo, ami ñyaadọñ ekoot mme uwak atautob, ndin ammọ eyaefịt ammọ esio ke afịd ikpọabod ye ntək abod ye ke mme abaitiad. <verse eid="JER 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17" />Anyen mmi asʌk ase afịd usʌñ ammọ; ammọ idịbeke ke anyen mmi, idiọọkñkpọ ammọ ñko idịbeke ke anyen mmi. <verse eid="JER 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18" />Ami ñyaasio ammọ usiene akañ iba ke mme ibak ye ndiọiñkpọ ammọ, sia ammọ esappa isọñ mmi ye mme ubobodñkpọ ammọ i-imiinieghe uwem enyʌñ eyọhọ udeeme mmi ye mme mbubiam ubobodñkpọ ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, adudu mmi ye akpọsọñ itie mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">itie udịbe mmi ke ini ukuud,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">mme idịd eyaedi ubịne fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">eto ke mme utịd ederimbod enyʌñ ebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">“Mme eteete ñnyịn ikinieghe ñkpọ ndomokeed ikan mme nsu-nsu abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">mme ukpọk ubobodñkpọ i-imiikinamma ufọn ndomokeed inọ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20" />Ado nte mme awo enam mme abasi ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:20">Ii, ado ammọ idooho mme abasi!”<verse eid="JER 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21" />“Ke ntoro ami ñyaakpeep ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">ke ini anyem ami ñyaakpeep ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">adudu ye ukeme mmi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:21">Ndin ammọ eyaediọọñọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">ke anyịñ mmi ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="JER 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JER 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1" />“Edat etoñwed ukwak emịñ idiọọkñkpọ Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:1">ewet ke itiad,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:1">ke itiadñwed esịd ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:1">ye ke mme nnʌk akpokoro uwa ammọ.<verse eid="JER 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2" />Nditọ ammọ ñko etoiyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:2">mme akpokoro uwa ammọ ye mme abai Asera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:2">ke mben mme awawa eto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:2">ye ke mme anyọñ abod.<verse eid="JER 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3" />Ami ñyaayaak mme ikpọabod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">ye mme inie ndufo ye mme ñkpọuto ndufo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:3">nnọ nte ñkpọ mbịme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">ye mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ ke afịd abio ndufo.<verse eid="JER 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4" />Ato ke ntak ndudue mfo afo ayaataba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">udeeme ami ñkunọọhọ fiin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">Ami ñyaanam afo adʌk ifʌn anọ mme asua mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">ke isọñ a-afo umuudiọọñọke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">sia afo amebịppe ikañ iyadesịd mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">ndin anye ayaasak ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="JER 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-abuọttọ idem ke awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:5">a-akoppo uko ato ñkaña abʌkidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:5">e-esịd amọ awọññọke akpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6" />Awo ado adiiba nte ikọd ke mme anaan isọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:6">uforo amaadi anye idiikịtte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">Ammọ ediidʌñọ ke mme nsaad itie ke akpautatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:6">ke isọñ inʌñ a-awo ndomokeed imiidʌññọ.<verse eid="JER 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7" />“Ado afọfọn anọ awo a-abuọttọ idem ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:7">i-ibededem amọ adooho ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8" />Anye adiiba nte eto etọọhọ ke mben mmọọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">a-asioho adʌñ amọ ke mben idịm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Anye idiikoppo ndịk ke ufiob amaadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">mfañ amọ ado awawa afịd ini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Anye inieghe ayeemensia ke ini unana mmọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">inyʌññọ itre adinwịm mfịd.”<verse eid="JER 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9" />Esịd awo abiaña-abiaña akan afịd ñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:9">inieghe ukọk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:9">Anie akan adiọọñọ anye?<verse eid="JER 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10" />“Ami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nduuñọ esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:10">ñnyʌñ ndomo se ido akikere awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">adinọ awo keedekeed utịb akeene adinam ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:10">akeene naña adinam ammọ adot.”<verse eid="JER 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11" />Mbon e-eforoke ke idiọọk usʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">eba nte asasa a-akʌbọke ke mme ñkwa a-anye imiikisịnne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">Ke ufọọd uwem ammọ, inie ammọ ayaafeghe akpọñ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">ndin ke akpatre ammọ eyaeforo ndisịme.<verse eid="JER 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12" />Ebekpo ubọọñ, e-edịppeke tọọñọ ke editọọñọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:12">ado itie ubọkkọ ñnyịn.<verse eid="JER 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, afo ado idodanyen Isrel;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">eyaesịn afịd mbon se ifeghe ukpọñ fiin ke abuud.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">Ediiwet anyịñ mbon se iwọññọ ukpọñ fiin ke abu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">sia ammọ efeghe ekpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">idịm mmọọñ uwem.<verse eid="JER 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ñkọk miin, ndin ami ñyaabọ ukọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:14">ñnyaaña miin ndin ami ñyaabọ adinyaaña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:14">sia afo ado anye a-ami ntooroke.<verse eid="JER 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15" />Ammọ esʌk ekaiso embo miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:15">“Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aba ke mmọọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:15">Yak anye awuọ asu idahami!”<verse eid="JER 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16" />Ami mfegheke ñkpọñ adido akpemeedọñ mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:16">afo amediọọñọ ke ami ñyemme usen nnananyen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:16">Se iwuọ ke inua mmi ana inwañ ke iso mfo.<verse eid="JER 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17" />Kuudo ñkpọ ndịk unnọọ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:17">afo ado itieudịbe mmi ke usen nsobo.<verse eid="JER 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18" />Yak abuud amʌm mme asua mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">ado kuuyak ami ndia ndọk;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">yak ammọ ekop ndịk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">ado kuuyak ñkpọ ndịk ansịm miin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Dat usen nsobo sọk ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">sobo ammọ ye ataa ekamba nsobo.<verse eid="JER 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adinịm Usen Sabad Asana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akendokkọ miin ado ami: “Kaa keda ke Inuaatob Mbon Awo, a-mme ndidem Yuda esitooho edʌk enyʌñ ewuọ; nyʌñ da ke mme inuaatob mfen ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="JER 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20" />Bo ammọ, ‘Ikop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndufo mme ndidem Yuda ye afịd mbon Yuda ye afịd awo se idʌñ ke Yeruselem e-esañake eboiyo ke mme inuaatob ami. <verse eid="JER 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ami: Ikpeme mbaak idibiom mbiomo ke usen Sabad me adiben mbiomo mboiyo ke mme inuaatob Yeruselem. <verse eid="JER 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22" />Ikiiben mbiomo ndomokeed isio ke mme ufọk ndufo, ikiinyʌñ inam utom ndomokeed ke Sabad, ado inịm usen Sabad asana, kpa naña ami ñketemme mme eteete ndufo. <verse eid="JER 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23" />Ado ammọ ikikpañña utọñ, inyʌññọ ikop; ammọ emaesọñ aboditọñ, inyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ inyʌññọ ibọ ntuunọ. <verse eid="JER 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24" />Ado adieke ndufo ekpemeke adinịm item mmi, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, inyʌññọ iben mbiomo ndomokeed iboiyo ke inuaatob abio ami ke Sabad, ado enịm usen Sabad asana ke aditre adinam utom ndomokeed ke esịd, <verse eid="JER 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25" />mme ndidem e-etieghe ke ebekpo Defid eyaesaña eboiyo ke mme inuaatob abio ami ye mme adaaha ammọ. Ammọ ye mme adaaha ammọ eyaewat ke mme sariọd ye mme enañmbakara, esaña ye ideen Yuda ye mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem, ndin eyaedʌñ ke abio ami ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="JER 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26" />Mme awo eyaeto ke mme abio Yuda ye mme esịdidʌñ e-ekannake Yeruselem, tọọñọ ke efaak Benyamin ye mme unaisọñ usobutịn, tọọñọ ke mme abio abod ye Nekef, edat mme ufọfọb uwa ye mme uwa, mme uwa abakpa ye insensi, ndin edat uwa ekọọm edi ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JER 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27" />Ado adieke ndufo imiinịmme mbed mmi ke adinam usen Sabad asana ke aditre adiben mbiomo ndʌk inuaatob Yeruselem ke usen Sabad, ami ñyaasịn ikañ i-imiidiinịmeke ke inuaatob Yeruselem se adiifọp mme ñkpọsọñ ufọk amọ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ke Ufọk Abodabañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1" />Ikọ a-aketooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adisịm Yerimaiya ado ami: <verse eid="JER 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2" />“Dakka kaa ufọk abodabañ, ndin ami ñyaunọ etob mmi ke udo.” <verse eid="JER 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3" />Ndin ami mmaasaña ñkaa ufọk abodabañ, ñnyʌñ ñkekịt naña anye anam utom ke ekara ukwak unuakka aduañ amọ. <verse eid="JER 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4" />Ado abañ a-anye akebotto ato aduañ amaabiara anye ke ubọk; ndin abodabañ amaakappa anam anye asịn ke abañ mfen, abot anye naña anye akekịt ke afọn ye anye.<verse eid="JER 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5" />Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadinsịm miin. <verse eid="JER 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6" />Anye amaabo, “Ado nte ami ñkanna nnam ye ndufo, Isrel, kpa naña abodabañ ami anam?” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. “Isrel, kpa naña aduañ aba ke ubọk abodabañ, kpa ntoro ke ndufo eba ke ubọk mmi. <verse eid="JER 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 18:7" />Adieke ami ntañña ke ini akeedodo ke eyaewịppe, ewuut enyʌñ esobo idịd me abioubọọñ, <verse eid="JER 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 18:8" />ndin adieke idịd ado a-ami ñkedʌttọ utọñ akappake esịd akpọñ idiọọkñkpọ amọ, ami ñyaateek ubọk, ñnyʌññọ mben nsobo a-ami ñkeduakka nsọk anye. <verse eid="JER 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 18:9" />Ñko adieke ami ntañña ke ini mfen mbo ke eyaebọp enyʌñ esọọñọ idịd me abioubọọñ, <verse eid="JER 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 18:10" />ndin adieke anye anamma idiọọkñkpọ ke iso mmi inyʌññọ ikop item mmi, ami ñyaamaana ñkere mbaña eti ñkpọ a-ami ñkeyemme adinam nnọọ anye.<verse eid="JER 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11" />“Ke ntoro dọkkọ mbon Yuda ye mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem idahami, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Se! Ami mmebeeñe nsobo inọ ndufo ñnyʌñ nduak idiọọk ibaña ndufo. Ke ntoro iwọññọ ikpọñ mme ndiọi usʌñ ndufo, ndufo keedekeed, inyʌñ ineeñe usʌñ ndufo ye mme adinam ndufo.’ <verse eid="JER 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12" />Ado ammọ eyaebọọrọ, ‘Ufọn ibaaha. Ñnyịn iyaikaa iso ke se ñnyịn ikiduak; afịd ñnyịn iyaikeene nsọñiwuod idiọọk esịd ñnyịn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">“Ibịp ke atu mme idịd:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:13">Anie akenam akop utọ ñkpọ ntom?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">Ayịn mboppo Isrel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:13">anam ataa mbubiam ñkpọ.<verse eid="JER 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14" />Me sino Lebanọn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:14">akeme adisop ke mme itiad-itiad itịkke amọ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">Me ndedeñ mmọọñ amọ a-atooho nsio-nsio ñnyan usʌñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:14">akeme itre adifiọọrọ?<verse eid="JER 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15" />Ado mbon mmi emfre miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">ammọ efọp insensi enọ mme ubobodñkpọ i-imiibaaha ufọn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">a-anamma ammọ etuak ukod ke usʌñ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">ke mme usʌñ esed.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Enam ammọ esaña ke mme afañusʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">ke usʌñ a-awo imiidiọññọ.<verse eid="JER 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16" />Isọñ ammọ adiido ñkpọ akpọsọñ ndịk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">ye ñkpọ ndọk ke nsi-nsi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">afịd awo se iboiyo eyaekpaaña nsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">ndin eyaefuuñ iwuod ammọ.<verse eid="JER 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17" />Kpa nte afịm a-atooho usakkautịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:17">ami ñyaasuan ammọ ke iso mme asua ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">ami ñyaakpa edem ñwọt ammọ, ñwọttọ ammọ iso mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:17">ke usen nsobo ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18" />Ammọ emaebo, “Idi, yak ñnyịn idʌk idiọọk edioomo ibaña Yerimaiya; sia ukpeeb mbed aku idiitreke, awo aniọñ idiinyʌññọ itre adinọ item, me ikọ item se ito mme prọfed. Ke ntoro idi, yak inwana ye anye ke edeme ñnyịn inyʌñ itre adikpañ utọñ nnọọ se anye atañ.”<verse eid="JER 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19" />Kpañ utọñ nnọ miin, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:19">kop se mbon se itañ ikọ imbaaña miin ebo!<verse eid="JER 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20" />Me ado se edat idiọọk esio usiene eti ñkpọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">Kpayeado ammọ edọk ube enịm ennọ miin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">Toiyo ke ami mmaada ke iso mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">ñnyʌñ ntañ ikọ ke ufọn ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">nọ awọññọ iyadesịd mfo asio akpọñ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21" />Ke ntoro yak akañ amʌm nditọ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">saana ammọ yaak nọ adudu akañkañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">Yak enam ibaan ammọ edo mme ada ye mme ebekpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">yak ewot mme ideen ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">ewot ñkparawa ammọ ke akañkañ ke ekọñ.<verse eid="JER 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22" />Yak ekop uyio ayịd ke mme ufọk ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">ke afo umauben mbon ekọñ ubịne ammọ adiwad-adiwad,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">sia ammọ etịppe ube enịm edimmʌm miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">enyʌñ ekọọk ndịbe afia enọ ukod mmi.<verse eid="JER 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23" />Ado afo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, amediọọñọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">afịd uduak ammọ adiñwot miin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Kuufeen ndiọiñkpọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">kuunyʌñ ukwokko ndiọiñkpọ ammọ usio ke anyen mfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Yak ekan ammọ ke iso mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">nam ammọ ñkpọ ke ini iyadesịd mfo.<verse eid="JER 18:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: “Kaa ke dep atu mbad to abodabañ. Saña ye mme ñkpisọñ ye mme aku <verse eid="JER 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2" />ndin iwuọ ikaa Abedeñ Ben Hinọm, a-akpereke Inuaatob Usiọñ. Ke ndo tañ mme ikọ se udọkkọ fiin, <verse eid="JER 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3" />ndin bo, ‘Kop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndufo mme ndidem Yuda ye mbon Yeruselem. Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel abo: Ikpañ utọñ! Ami ñyaadat nsobo nsịn ke itie ami a-adooho ayaanam utọñ afịd awo e-ekoppo ebaña anye aduat. <verse eid="JER 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4" />Sia ammọ eñkpọñ miin ndin enam itie ami ado itie mme isen abasi; ammọ efọp insensi enọ mme abasi a-adooho ammọ me mme eteete ammọ me mme ndidem Yuda ikidiọọñọke, ndin ammọ e-enam itie ami ayọhọ ye iyiib mbon i-imiidueghe. <verse eid="JER 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5" />Ammọ e-ebọp mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie Baal adifọp nditọ ammọ ke ikañ nte uwa nnọọ Baal, ñkpọ a-ami mmeñkewuuhọ, ñnyʌññọ ntatañ, i-imiikinyʌññọ indọdʌk akikere. <verse eid="JER 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6" />Ndin ikpeme, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, ini asʌk adi, a-adooho mme awo idiikoodo itie ami aba Tofed me Abedeñ Ben Hinọm, ado Abedeñ Uwodawo.<verse eid="JER 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7" />“ ‘Ke itie ami ñyaabiat mme uduak Yuda ye Yeruselem. Ñyaanam ammọ eduọ ke akañkañ ke iso mme asua ammọ, ke ubọk mbon eyemme adiwot ammọ, ndin ami ñyaanọ mme inuen ye ndiọi unamikọd akpo ammọ nte ndidia. <verse eid="JER 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8" />Ami ñyaasobo abio ami ñnyʌñ nnam anye ado ñkpọ ndịk ye ñnyọọ; afịd mbon se iboiyo eyaekop ñkpaidem eyaenyʌñ esaha eduọi ato ke afịd mme unan amọ. <verse eid="JER 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9" />Ami ñyaanam ammọ eta abʌkidem nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ammọ, enyʌñ eta abʌkidem emọ-emọ sia mme asua ammọ eyaekanna ammọ ekʌk enyʌñ esobo ammọ.’<verse eid="JER 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 19:10" />“Ndin bom atu ado idaha a-mbon e-esañake ye afo esʌkkọ ese, <verse eid="JER 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 19:11" />ndin bo ammọ, ‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan abo: Ami ñyaabom idịd ami ye abio ami kpa naña atu abodabañ ami abomo ndin awo idiikanna itañ ibok aba. Eyaebuuk mme akpañkpa ke Tofed tutu ufañ ibaaha aba. <verse eid="JER 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12" />Ntom ke ami ndiinam ke itie ami ye mbon se idʌñ mi, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. Ñyaanam abio ami atie nte Tofed. <verse eid="JER 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13" />Eyaesappa mme ufọk ke Yeruselem ye ake mme ndidem Yuda nte itie ami, Tofed, ye afịd mme ufọk a-ammọ ekefọppọ insensi ke anyọñ akọm enọ mme udịm anyọñ enyʌñ eduọk mme enọ ukọd enọ mme abasi mfen.’ ”<verse eid="JER 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14" />Yerimaiya amaanyọñ ke Tofed, <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akedọññọ anye nọ akesiak ikọ, ndin anye amaadida ke akwere tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ abo afịd awo, <verse eid="JER 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15" />“Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ: ‘Ikpañ utọñ! Ami ñyaadat nsobo a-ami ñketañña mbaña nsịn ke abio ami ye ke afịd esịdidʌñ e-ekannake anye ekʌk, sia ammọ esọñ aboditọñ inyʌññọ ikop mme ikọ mmi.’ ”<verse eid="JER 19:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yerimaiya ye Pasọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1" />Ke ini aku Pasọ ayịn Imaa, adaaha a-akeseeghe ñkpọ abaña tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akekoppo naña Yerimaiya atañ mme prọfesi ami, <verse eid="JER 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2" />Pasọ amaanam emia prọfed Yerimaiya enyʌñ esịn anye ke ñkpakọb ke Anyọñ Inuaatob Benyamin ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JER 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3" />Edem usen, ke Pasọ amaakesio anye ke ñkpakọb, Yerimaiya amaabo anye, “Anyịñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> unọọhọ fiin idooho Pasọ, ado Akpọsọñ Ndịk ke Afịd Itie. <verse eid="JER 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4" />Sia se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ntom: ‘Ami ñyaanam afo ado ñkpọ ndịk anọ idem mfo ye afịd mme ufan mfo; afo ayaakịt ke anyen mfo naña ammọ ekpañña ke akañkañ mme asua ammọ. Ami ñyaayaak afịd Yuda nsịn ke ubọk adidem Babilọn, anye ayaakoono ammọ anyọñ Babilọn me idooho awoot ammọ ke akañkañ. <verse eid="JER 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5" />Ami ñyaayaak afịd inie abio ami nsịn ke ubọk mme asua ammọ, afịd ñkpọ ammọ, afịd mme nti ñkpọ ye mme ñkpọuto mme ndidem Yuda. Ammọ eyaekoono enyọñ Babilọn nte mbịme. <verse eid="JER 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6" />Ndin afo, Pasọ, ye afịd awo se idʌñ ke ufọk mfo eyaekaa isañufʌn ke Babilọn. Do ke afo uduukukpa enyʌñ ubuuk do, afo ye afịd mme ufan mfo a-afo aketañña mme nsu-nsu prọfesi anọọ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utọk Yerimaiya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7" />Afo amambiaña miin, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin emaembiaña miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">afo amañkan ubọk anyʌñ akan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">Ennọ miin ndọk afịd usen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">afịd awo enduọi miin.<verse eid="JER 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8" />Ini akeedodo a-ami ntañña ikọ, ami ntua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">ntañ afai ye nsobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">usọñanyen ye emiom ansọk miin afịd ini.<verse eid="JER 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9" />Ado ñkpebo, “Ami ndiisiaha ikọ amọ aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">ndiinyʌññọ ntañ ikọ ke anyịñ amọ aba,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">ikọ amọ asịne ke esịd mmi nte ikañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">ikañ e-efʌttọ esịn ke mme akpọ mmi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">Añkak miin adimʌm anye ñkama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">ke akpanikọ ñkanna.<verse eid="JER 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10" />Ami mmekop naña mbon awo edọñọ adu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">“Ndịk ke afịd itie!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">Isua inọ anye! Yak ñnyịn isua inọ anye!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Afịd mme ufan mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">eda ebet nọ ami mfiọnnọ, ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">“Akemeido eyaebiaña anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">ndin ñnyịn iyaikan anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">inyʌñ isio anye usiene.”<verse eid="JER 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmọdo aba ye ami nte ekamba awo ekọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">ke ntoro mbon eñkọbọke miin eyaefiọnnọ inyʌññọ inie adikan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Ammọ eyaekpu enyʌñ ekịt asuenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">awo idiifreke ndọk ammọ.<verse eid="JER 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, afo a-aduuñọke adinen awo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">anyʌñ akịt esịd ye akikere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">yak ami ñkịt usiene mfo ke idem ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">sia ami mmeyaak mfịna mmi usịn fiin ke ubọk.<verse eid="JER 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13" />Kwọ nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:13">Nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> itooro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">Anye a-afak uwem awo unana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:13">asio ke ubọk mbon ibak.<verse eid="JER 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14" />Adọdiọọk anọ usen ami ñkemanake!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:14">Yak usen se eka mmi akemman miin akuufọn!<verse eid="JER 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15" />Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-akedatta etob ado asọk ete mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:15">a-akenamma esịd amọ anekke anem, ate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:15">“Ayịn amana unọ fiin, ayịn awodeen!”<verse eid="JER 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16" />Yak awodeen ado aba nte mme abio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">
    <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akesoboke ikoppo mbọm ibaña.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">Yak anye akop ntuaña ke ubakusen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">ñkpoyo ekọñ ke ufọọd uweemeayio.<verse eid="JER 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17" />Sia anye ikiñwotto miin ke ntʌñidịb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:17">inyʌñ inam eka mmi nte udi mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:17">idịb amọ atịd ke nsi-nsi.<verse eid="JER 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18" />Nsoo ido ntak a-ami ñkewuọhọ ke idịb</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">ndikịt mfịna ye ukuud,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">nọ mme usen uwem mmi anyʌñ aditre ke abuud?<verse eid="JER 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21" />
  <para style="s1">Abasi Asịn Ebeeñe Sedekaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1" />Ikọ amaato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asịm Yerimaiya idaha Adidem Sedekaiya akedọññọ anye aka abịne Pasọ ayịn Malkiya ye aku Sefanaiya ayịn Maaseiya. Ammọ emaebo: <verse eid="JER 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2" />“Bịp to <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idahami inọ ñnyịn sia Nebukadnesa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru ado </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nebukadnesa, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a-adooho kpasʌk </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nebukadnesa;</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ke ufañ ami ye uwak ini ke ñwed Yerimaiya ye Esikeel</char></note> adidem Babilọn asʌk anwana ye ñnyịn. Akemeido <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam utịppeñkpọ inọ ñnyịn kpa naña akenam ke mme usen edem nọ anye atịmme edem ikpọñ ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JER 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3" />Ado Yerimaiya amaabọọrọ ammọ, “Idọkkọ Sedekaiya, <verse eid="JER 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4" />‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, abo ado ami: Ami mmeyem adinam mme ñkpọ ekọñ e-ebaaha ke ubọk ndufo, a-ndufo edatta enwana adidem Babilọn ye mbon Babilọn e-ekannake ndibene ndufo ekʌk ekappa edo ñkpọ nsobo ndufo. Ami ñyaanyʌñ ñkoono ammọ nsịn ke esịd abio ami. <verse eid="JER 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5" />Ami ke idem mmi ñyaanwana ye ndufo ye ubọk a-ñnyanna ye akpọsọñ ubọk mmi ke ufiob iyadesịd ye ekamba ifiobesịd. <verse eid="JER 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6" />Ami ñyaawot mbon se idʌñ ke abio ami, awo ye ndiọi unam; ndin ammọ eyaekpa eto idiọọk udọñọ nsobo. <verse eid="JER 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7" />Ke ado amaaboiyo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, ami ñyaayaak Sedekaiya adidem Yuda, mme adaaha amọ ye mbon abio ami se idiibọkkọ udọñọ nsobo, akañkañ ye akañ, nsịn ke ubọk Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn ye mme asua ammọ e-eyemme ediwot ammọ. Anye ayaawot ammọ ke akañkañ; anye idiituaha ammọ mbọm inyʌññọ ikop udʌk.’<verse eid="JER 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8" />“Ñko, dọkkọ mbon awo, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ami: Se, ami mmenịm usʌñ uwem ye usʌñ ñkpa ke iso ndufo. <verse eid="JER 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9" />Awo akeedodo a-abaaha ke abio ami ayaakpa ke akañkañ, akañ me udọñọ nsobo. Ado awo akeedodo a-awuọhọ akeyaak idem amọ anọ mbon Babilọn i-ikannake ndufo ekʌk ayaadu uwem; ammọ eyaebọkkọ ye uwem ammọ. <verse eid="JER 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10" />Ami mmebiere adinam abio ami idiọọk, nnamma eti, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo. Eyaeyaak anye esịn adidem Babilọn ke ubọk, ndin anye ayaasobo anye ke ikañ.’<verse eid="JER 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11" />“Ñko, bo ufọk ubọọñ Yuda, ‘Kop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JER 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ubo fiin ado ami, ufọk Defid:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">“ ‘Inam unen kwa ubakusen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">inyaaña awo eyịppe ñkpọ amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">isio ke ubọk afiikawo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">imiidooho ntoro ifiobesịd mmi ayaabịppe anyʌñ asak nte ikañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">ato ke idiọọkñkpọ a-ndufo enamma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">asak ndin ibaaha awo se inịme anye.<verse eid="JER 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13" />Yeruselem, ami mmenie ikọ ye afo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">ndufo e-edʌññọ ke anyọñ abedeñ ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">ke anyọñ abod itiad, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">ndufo mbon e-ebooho, “Anie akan adi ikọ ye ñnyịn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">Anie akan adʌk itie udịbe ñnyịn?”<verse eid="JER 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14" />Ami ñyaimia ndufo ufen akeene naña adinam ndufo adot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:14">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:14">Ami ñyaasịn ikañ ke mme akai ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:14">a-adiita afịd ñkpọ se ikanna ndufo ikʌk.’ ”<verse eid="JER 21:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ubiomikpe Mme Ndidem Ibak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: “Kaa ke ufọk adidem Yuda nyʌñ kenọ etob ami do: <verse eid="JER 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2" />‘Kop ikọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adọñ unọọ fiin, adidem Yuda, afo a-atieghe ke ebekpo Defid, afo mme adaaha mfo ye mbon mfo e-esañake edʌk ke mme inuaatob ami. <verse eid="JER 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Nam se inen inyʌñ ifọn. Nyaaña awo eyịppe ñkpọ amọ sio ke ubọk awo ufiik. Kuunam idiọọk, kuunyʌñ unam afai ye asenawo, ayịnakpa me ebekpa, ndin kuuduọk iyiib awo imiidueghe isop ke itie ami. <verse eid="JER 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4" />Adieke afo akpemeke adinam mme mbed mmi, mme ndidem e-etieghe ke ebekpo Defid eyaesaña eto ke mme inuaatob ufọk adidem ami edʌk, ewat ke mme sariọd ye ke mme enañmbakara, esaña ye mme adaaha ammọ ye mbon ammọ. <verse eid="JER 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5" />Ado adieke afo umuunịmme mme item ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ami mmenwọñọ ke idem mmi ke itie ami adiido ndoon.’ ”<verse eid="JER 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6" />Sia se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ abaña ufọk adidem Yuda ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">“Akpesʌkado a-ndufo ebaaha nte Kilied ennọ miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:6">nte atịñe Lebanọn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">ke akpanikọ ami ñyaanam ndufo eba nte isọñ nsobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:6">nte mme abio a-awo imiidʌññọ.<verse eid="JER 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7" />Ami ñyaadọñ mbon nsobo inọ ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:7">anie mme ñkpọ ekọñ amọ anie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">ndin ammọ eyaekpook mme mfọọn asaña-asaña eto abom sida ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:7">enyʌñ etoomo ammọ edọñ ke ikañ.<verse eid="JER 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8" />“Mbon awo eyaeto uwak idịd eboiyo ke abio ami enyʌñ ebịp emọ-emọ ebo, ‘Nsoo ido nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam utọ ñkpọ ami ke ekamba abio ami?’ <verse eid="JER 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9" />Ndin ibọọrọ adiido: ‘Sia ammọ emaewọññọ edem ekpọñ edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ ndin ekpono enyʌñ enam ñkpọ enọ mme abasi mfen.’ ”<verse eid="JER 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10" />Ikiitua inọọ adidem a-akpaaha, ikiinyʌñ ifʌhọ ntakudua amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">ado, ikap itua idod-idod ayịd inọ anye e-ebenne esio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">sia tutu amama anye idiinyọññọ idi aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">idiinyʌññọ ikịt isọñ emana amọ aba.<verse eid="JER 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11" />Sia ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ abaña Salum ayịn Yosaiya, a-akedatta itie ete amọ nte adidem Yuda ado akpọñ itie ami: “Anye idiinyọññọ idi aba. <verse eid="JER 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12" />Anye adiikpa ke itie ebenne anye esio ekesịn ukad; anye idiikịtte isọñ ami aba.”<verse eid="JER 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-abọppọ ufọk adidem ke ukwañido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">mme ubeed anyọñ amọ ke ukwañ ikpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">anam mbon amọ enam utom ñkaña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">ikpeeghe ammọ akʌk ke utom a-ammọ enamma.<verse eid="JER 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14" />Anye ate, ‘Ami ñyaabọp ekamba ufọk adidem nnọ idem mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">ye mme ñnwaña ubeed anyọñ.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Ke ntoro anye anam ñkpoon ubenafịm ke esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">akama sida akọñ mben ado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">akama ndad-ndad adeppe anye.<verse eid="JER 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15" />“Ado nte idiọọñọ udo adidem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">ado adinie uwak sida?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Ado nte ete mfo ikinieghe ndidia ye ukọd?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">Anye amaanam se inen ye se ifọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">ndin afịd ñkpọ amaafọn ye anye.<verse eid="JER 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16" />Anye amaanwana anwan iwuod mbon uweene ye mbon unana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">ndin afịd ñkpọ amaafọn ama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:16">Nte idooho se adindiọọñọ miin awuọñọ adodo?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17" />“Ado anyen mfo ye esịd mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">ewʌhọ ke idiọọk udod ikpọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">ke adiduọk iyiib awo i-imiidueghe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">ye ke adifiik ñnyʌñ ndat ke ñkanubọk.”<verse eid="JER 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ abaña</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Yehoiyakịm ayịn Yosaiya adidem Yuda ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">“Ammọ idiifʌhọke ibaña anye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">‘Sai, ayịneka mmi awodeen! Sai ayịneka mmi awonwaan!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">Ammọ idiifʌhọke ibaña anye:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">‘Sai, eteufọk mmi! Sai, uku amọ!’<verse eid="JER 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19" />Ediibuuk anye nte ebuuk dọñki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:19">edʌt anye esio etop eduọọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:19">ke mme anwa inuaatob Yeruselem.”<verse eid="JER 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20" />“Dọọk kaa Lebanọn nyʌñ tua uyio asọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:20">yak ekop uyio mfo ke Basan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">tua sọñ uyio ke Abarim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:20">sia esobo afịd mbon nsaña mfo.<verse eid="JER 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21" />Ami mmaudʌt fiin utọñ idaha a-afo akebaaha ke ifuuro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:21">ado afo amaabo, ‘Ami ndiikpañña utọñ!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">Eduuwem mfo ado ami tọọñọ ke uyịn mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:21">afo ukoppo ikọ unnọ miin.<verse eid="JER 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22" />Afịm ayaaben afịd mme akpemeedọñ mfo asio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">eyaekoono mbon nsaña mfo esio ekaa idịd mfen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">Ndin afo ayaadia ndọk anyʌñ abọ asuenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">ke ntak afịd ibak mfo.<verse eid="JER 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23" />Afo a-adʌññọ ke ‘Lebanọn,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:23">a-adʌññọ ke inem ke mme ufọk e-edatta sida ebọp,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">ayaamịm mmịm ke ini ubiak amausịm fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:23">ubiak nte ake awonwaan a-abaaha ke ubiakuman!<verse eid="JER 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24" />“Adaña nte ami nduuho uwem,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ asọọñọ ate, “akpọkọm ado afo, Yehoiyakịn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Konia, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">asʌk ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yehoiyakịn;</char><char style="ft" closed="false">se ñko ke Yer 22:28</char></note> ayịn Yehoiyakịm adidem Yuda, akedo ñkpannuun idiọọñọ ke ubọk nnasia mmi, ami ñkpesʌk usosio fiin mfep. <verse eid="JER 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25" />Ami ñyauyaak fiin nsịn ke ubọk mbon e-eyemme aduwot fiin, mbon a-afo abaaha, kpa Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn ye mbon Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26" />Ami ñyautop fiin ye eka a-akumanna fiin nsịn ke idịd mfen, a-adooho ndufo ndomokeed ikimanake do, ndin ndufo awo iba ediikpa do. <verse eid="JER 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27" />Ndufo idiitịmmeke idi isọñ a-ndufo enyieghe udọñ adinyọñ ndi aba.”<verse eid="JER 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28" />Ado nte awo ami, Yehoiyakịn, ado awo ndọk, usiọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">ñkpọ se awo ndomokeed imiiyemme?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">Nsoo ido nọ ediitop anye ye nditọ amọ iduọọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">edọñ ke isọñ a-ammọ imiidiọọñọke?<verse eid="JER 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29" />O isọñ, isọñ, isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:29">kop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>!<verse eid="JER 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">“Wet baña awodeen ami nte anana ayịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">awodeen i-imiidiiforoke ke ayio uwem amọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">sia ayịn amọ ndomokeed idiiforoke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">ndomokeed idiitieghe ke ebekpo Defid,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">inyʌññọ ikara aba ke Yuda.”<verse eid="JER 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23" />
  <para style="s1">Adinen Ñkọk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1" />“Adọdiọọk anọ mme akpemeedọñ e-esoboke enyʌñ esuan mme atu edọñ mmi!” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="JER 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, abo mme akpemeedọñ e-ekpemeke mbon mmi ado ami: “Sia ndufo emesuan udịmedọñ mmi enyʌñ ebịn ammọ esio, inyʌññọ ise ñkpọ ibaña ammọ, ami ñyainọ ndufo ufen ke idiọọkñkpọ a-ndufo enamma,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="JER 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3" />“Ami ke idem mmi ñyaakoono ñyọhọnsʌhọ udịmedọñ mmi ke afịd mme idịd a-ami ñkebịnne ammọ ñkedọñ ñnyʌñ ñkoono ammọ ñnyọñ ndi itie nnaa ammọ, itie se ammọ ediiseghe enyʌñ etọt ke ibad. <verse eid="JER 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4" />Ami ñyaanịm mme akpemeedọñ se idiinekke ise ammọ, ndin ammọ idiikoppo ndịk, idiinyʌññọ idịkke ñkpọ; ndomokeed ke atu edọñ mmi idiisoppo,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, “Mme usen esʌk edi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:5">a-ami ndiisio adinen Ñkọk nnọ Defid,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ndiisio </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nto ubon Defid</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:5">Adidem se idiikara ye aniọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:5">anyʌñ anam se inen inyʌñ ifọn ke isọñ.<verse eid="JER 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6" />Ke ukara amọ Yuda ayaabọkkọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:6">ndin Isrel ayaadʌñ ke ifuuro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:6">Anyịñ ami ke ediikoot anye:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:6">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Adinen Andinyaaña Ñnyịn.<verse eid="JER 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7" />“Ke ntoro, mme ini esʌk edi,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “a-mbon awo imiidibooho aba, ‘Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem, a-akesioho nditọ Isrel ke Iyib,’ <verse eid="JER 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8" />ado ammọ ediibo, ‘Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem, a-akesioho ubon Isrel ke isọñ adoro ye ke afịd mme idịd a-anye akebịnne ammọ akesịn.’ Ndin ammọ eyaedʌñ ke isọñ ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Prọfed Abiaña</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9" />Ke abaña mme prọfed:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Esịd ambʌññọ miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">afịd mme akpọ mmi enyʌñ enyeñ ke abaña mme prọfed.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Ami ntie nte awo inaam ukọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">nte akpọsọñ awo u-ukọd akanna ubọk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">ke ntak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">ye mme ndisana ikọ amọ.<verse eid="JER 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10" />Isọñ ayọhọ ye mme asịn efịbe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">ke ntak isuuñọ isọñ asaat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">ndin mme mbid ke anaan ikọd eyeeme.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">Mme prọfed ekeene idiọọk usʌñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">enyʌñ ekama adudu ammọ ke ukwañ usʌñ.<verse eid="JER 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11" />“Mme prọfed ye mme aku idiọọñọke abasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:11">kpa ke esịd tembịd mmi ami mmekịt ibak ammọ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:11">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12" />“Ke ntoro usʌñ ammọ ayaadọrọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">eyaebịn ammọ esịn ke ekịm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">ndin ammọ eyaeduọ edọñọ do.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">Ami ñyaadat nsobo nsọk ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">ke isua se ediimia ammọ ufen,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13" />“Ke atu mme prọfed Sameria,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:13">ami mmaakịt abʌd-abʌd ñkpọ ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">Ammọ etañ ñkukịd eto Baal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:13">enyʌñ etịn mbon mmi Isrel usʌñ.<verse eid="JER 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14" />Ñko ke atu mme prọfed ke Yeruselem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">ami mmekịt aniendịk ñkpọ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">Ammọ esịn efịbe enyʌñ edu uwem nsu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Ammọ esọọñọ mme anamidiọọk ubọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">ndin ibaaha awo ammọ ndomokeed se ikappa esịd ikpọñ ibak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Afịd ammọ etie nte Sọdọm ke iso mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">mbon Yeruselem etie nte Komora.”<verse eid="JER 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami abaña mme prọfed:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">“Ami ñyaanam ammọ edia idod-idod ndidia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">enyʌñ enwọñ mmọọñ ñkpa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">sia ato ke mme prọfed Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">unana adidiọñọ Abasi atara ayọhọ afịd isọñ.”<verse eid="JER 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">“Ikiikpañ utọñ ikop se mme prọfed etañ inọọ ndufo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:16">ammọ enam esịd ndufo eyọhọ ye mme nsu-nsu idodanyen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">Ammọ etañ ñkukịd a-atooho akikere ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:16">itooho inua <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17" />Ammọ ekaa iso edọkkọ mbon i-imiimbatta miin ke ñkpọ ete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:17">‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ: Ndufo eyaenie emem.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:17">Ndin edọkkọ afịd mbon se ikeene nsọñiwuod esịd ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:17">ete, ‘unọmọ ndomokeed idiisịmme ndufo.’<verse eid="JER 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18" />Ado anie ke atu ammọ akeda ke esob <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:18">adikịt me adikop ikọ amọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:18">Anie akpañ utọñ anyʌñ akop ikọ amọ?<verse eid="JER 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19" />Se, ayobio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:19">ayaatop ke ifiobesịd,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:19">afịm idọmbi afịme asọiyọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:19">ke iwuod mbon ibak.<verse eid="JER 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20" />Iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idiitịmmeke edem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">tutu anye anam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">uduak esịd amọ ayọhọ-ayọhọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:20">Ke mme usen se idi ke iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">ayaanekke unwaña fiin.<verse eid="JER 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21" />Ami ñkidọññọ mme prọfed ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">ado ammọ efeghe ye etob ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:21">ami ñkitañña ikọ nnọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">ado ammọ etañ prọfesi.<verse eid="JER 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22" />Akpedo ammọ emaeda ke esob mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:22">ammọ ekpaeketañ mme ikọ mmi enọ mbon mmi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:22">ekpaekenyʌñ ewọññọ ammọ esio ke mme ndiọi usʌñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:22">ye mme ndiọi adinam ammọ.<verse eid="JER 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23" />“Ado nte ami ndo Abasi a-akpereke kpọd, ndooho Abasi anyọọñọ usʌñ?” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24" />Anie akan adịbe ke mme ndedịbe itie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">mbaak ami ndikịt ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:24">“Idooho ami ñyọhọ hefịn ye isọñ?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25" />“Ami mmekop se mme prọfed e-etañña nsu-nsu prọfesi etañ ke anyịñ mmi. Ammọ ete, ‘Ami mmaadappa ndab! Ami mmaadappa ndab!’ <verse eid="JER 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26" />Utọ ñkpọ ami adiika iso ikpeene die ke esịd mme nsu-nsu prọfed ami, e-etañña ñkukịd abiaña eto akikere ammọ? <verse eid="JER 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27" />Ammọ ekere ke mme ndab ammọ edọkkọke emọ-emọ eyaenam mbon mmi efre anyịñ mmi, kpa naña mme eteete ammọ ekefre anyịñ mmi eto ke edikpono Baal. <verse eid="JER 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28" />Yak prọfed a-anieghe ndab amaana atañ ndab ado, ado yak anye a-anieghe ikọ mmi atañ anye ke akpanikọ. Nsoo ewuana ke mbid anie ye abakpa?” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo. <verse eid="JER 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29" />“Nte ikọ mmi ibaaha nte ikañ,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “ye nte ukọññkpọ a-abommo itiad asuan mbai-mbai?<verse eid="JER 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30" />“Ke ntoro,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “ami mmenie ikọ ye mme prọfed e-eyịppe ikọ eto emọ-emọ ebo ke anto miin. <verse eid="JER 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31" />Ii,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “Ami mmenie ikọ ye mme prọfed ekeññe inua ammọ ndin ebo, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.’ <verse eid="JER 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32" />Ke akpanikọ, ami mmenie ikọ ye mbon se itañ nsu-nsu ndab,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. “Ammọ edọkkọ ammọ enyʌñ edat mbon mmi etịn usʌñ ye atịme-atịme nsu ammọ, ado ami ñkidọññọ ammọ ñnyʌññọ mmek ammọ. Ammọ ibaaha ufọn inọ mbon ami ndomokeed,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsu-nsu Prọfesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33" />“Ibon ami, me prọfed me aku, emaubịp fiin, ‘Nsoo etob ito <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?’ bo ammọ, ‘Nsoo etob? Ami ñyaikpọñ ndufo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.’ <verse eid="JER 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34" />Adieke prọfed me aku me awo mfen ndomokeed abooho, ‘Etob ami ato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,’ ami ñyaamia ammọ ye ufọk ammọ ufen. <verse eid="JER 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35" />Se ndufo keedekeed ekaa iso edọkkọ mme ufan ndufo ye mbon Isrel mfen ado ami: ‘Nsoo ido ibọọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?’ me ‘Nsoo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ?’ <verse eid="JER 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36" />Ado inaaha ndufo esiak ‘etob a-atooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>’ aba, sia ikọ awo keedekeed ado etob ammọ. Ndin ndufo eyʌt ikọ aduuwem Abasi ekanna, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi ñnyịn. <verse eid="JER 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37" />Se ndufo ekaa iso ebo prọfed ado ami: ‘Nsoo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ubọọrọ fiin?’ me ‘Nsoo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ?’ <verse eid="JER 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38" />Akpesʌkado a-ndufo ebooho, ‘Etob ami ato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,’ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Afo akekama mme ikọ ami, ‘Etob ami ato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,’ akpesʌkado ami mmaakidọkkọ ndufo mbo ke inaaha ebo, ‘Etob ami ato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ <verse eid="JER 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39" />Ke ntoro, ke akpanikọ ami ñyaifre ndufo ñnyʌñ isio ndufo ke iso mmi ye abio a-ami ñkinọọhọ ndufo ye mme eteete ndufo. <verse eid="JER 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40" />Ami ñyaadat nsi-nsi asuenne isọk ndufo, nsi-nsi abuud a-awo imiidiifreke.”<verse eid="JER 23:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Akpasa Fik Iba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1" />Ke Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn amaakekoono Yehoiyakịn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yekonaiya</char><char style="ft" closed="false">asʌk ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yehoiyakịn</char></note> ayịn Yehoiyakịm adidem Yuda ye mme adaaha amọ, nta mme anam utomusọ ye mbon udomutịm asio ke Yeruselem, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amañwọt miin mme akpasa fik iba ekenịmme ke iso tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JER 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2" />Akpasa keed amaadọñọ ataa nti fik, nte mbon ekebakka edat; akpasa anye ako amaadọñọ ataa ndiọi fik, ediọi tutu idooho se ekan edia ammọ.<verse eid="JER 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambịp miin, “Yerimaiya, nsoo ke afo akịt?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 24:3">Ami mmaabọọrọ “Mme fik. Mbon se ido nti enekke efọọn, ado mbon se ido ndiọi ediọi tutu idooho se edia.”<verse eid="JER 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4" />Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadinsịm miin ate: <verse eid="JER 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: ‘Nte mme nti fik ami, ke ndat nte nti mbon a-ami ñkesioho nto Yuda nọ eka isọñ Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6" />Anyen mmi ayaakpeme ammọ ke ufọn ammọ, ndin ami ñyaaben ammọ ntịmme ñnyọñ ndi isọñ ami. Ami ñyaabọp ammọ ndin ndiiwuudo ammọ; ami ñyaatọ ammọ ado ndiiwịppeke ammọ. <verse eid="JER 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7" />Ami ñyaanọ ammọ esịd adindiọọñọ miin, ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ammọ ediido mbon mmi, ndin ami ñyaado Abasi ammọ, sia ammọ eyaenyọñ embịne miin ke afịd esịd ammọ.<verse eid="JER 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8" />“ ‘Ado kpa nte ndiọi fik, e-enyʌmmọke tutu idooho se edia,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, ‘kpa ntoro ke ami ndiinam ye Sedekaiya adidem Yuda, mme adaaha amọ ye mbon se isʌhọ e-eketooho Yeruselem enyọñ edi, me ammọ eba ke isọñ ami me edʌñ ke Iyib. <verse eid="JER 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9" />Ami ñyaanam ammọ edo ñkpọ itekesịd ye iyadesịd enọ afịd mme idịd ke ederimbod, ñkpọ ndọk ye ufiid, isuuñọ ye ñkpọ nsaha, ke itie akeedodo a-ami mbịnne ammọ nọ eka. <verse eid="JER 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10" />Ami ñyaadọñ akañkañ, akañ ye udọñọ nsobo nnọ esọk ammọ tutu esobo ammọ afịd esio ke isọñ a-ami ñkenọọhọ ammọ ye mme eteete ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25" />
  <para style="s1">Udʌk Ufʌn ke Isua Ata Mme Duob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1" />Ikọ amaadisịm Yerimaiya ke abaña afịd mbon Yuda ke ayọhọ isua inaañ ke ukara Yehoiyakịm ayịn Yosaiya adidem Yuda, a-akedooho akpa isua ukara Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2" />Ndin Yerimaiya prọfed amaabo afịd mbon Yuda ye afịd mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem: <verse eid="JER 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3" />Ke isua edịb mme ita, tọọñọ ke ayọhọ isua duob mme ita ke ukara Yosaiya ayịn Amọn adidem Yuda tutu usen mfịn; ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadinsịm miin idem ndin ami mmetañ mmaana ntañ inọ ndufo, ado ndufo ikpañña utọñ.<verse eid="JER 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4" />Ndin akpesʌkado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọñ mme isʌñutom amọ, mme prọfed inọ ndufo ke ini ke ini, ndufo ikikoppo inyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ. <verse eid="JER 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5" />Ammọ emaebo, “Iwọññọ idahami, ndufo keedekeed, ikpọñ mme ndiọi usʌñ ndufo ye mme ndiọi adinam ndufo, ndin ndufo emekeme adidʌñ ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akinọọhọ ndufo ye mme eteete ndufo ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi. <verse eid="JER 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6" />Ikiikeene mme abasi mfen ke adinam ñkpọ nnọọ ammọ ñnyʌñ ñkpono ammọ; ikiidemme iyadesịd mmi ke se ubọk ndufo abot. Ndin ami ndiinamma ndufo idiọọk.<verse eid="JER 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7" />“Ado ndufo ikikpañña utọñ innọ miin,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “ndin ndufo emedemme iyadesịd mmi ke se ubọk ndufo enam, ndin ndufo emeben mfịna enọ idem ndufo.”<verse eid="JER 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8" />Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan abo ntom: “Sia ndufo imiikoppo se ami ntañ, <verse eid="JER 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9" />ami ñyaakoot afịd mbon adoro ye afʌnadeen mmi Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ntañ, “ami ñyaanyʌñ nnam ammọ edinwana ye isọñ ami ye mbon se idʌñ do ye mme idịd e-ebaaha ke ñkanñkʌk ami. Ami ñyaasobo ammọ ataa afịd-afịd, ñnyʌñ nnam ammọ edo ñkpọ ndịk ye ñkpọ ndọk, ye nsi-nsi nsobo. <verse eid="JER 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10" />Ami ñyaabịn uyom idaara ye idadesịd nsio ke atu ammọ, uyom anwaanndọ ye ebendọ, uyom ukọkñkpọ ye unwana utuenikañ. <verse eid="JER 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11" />Afịd abio ami ayaakappa ado ñwuudo isọñ atahade, ndin ibon ami eyaenam ñkpọ enọ adidem Babilọn isua ata mme duob.<verse eid="JER 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12" />“Ado isua ata mme duob ado amaakweeñe, ami ñyaamia adidem Babilọn ye abio amọ ufen, isọñ mbon Babilọn, ke nnamndue ammọ, ñnyʌñ nnam anye ado nsobo ke nsi-nsi, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="JER 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13" />Ami ñyaanam afịd ñkpọ se ntañ mbaña isọñ ami atịppe, ye afịd se ewet ke ñwed ami ye afịd ñkukịd se Yerimaiya atañ abaña afịd mme idịd. <verse eid="JER 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14" />Ammọ ñko eyaedʌk ufʌn enọ uwak mme idịd ye mme ikpọ ndidem; ami ñyaasio ammọ usiene ñkeene adinam ammọ ye ubọkutom ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kọọb Ifiobesịd Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, akembo miin ado ami: “Bọ ke ubọk mmi kọọb ami a-ayọhọke ye ukọd ifiobesịd mmi nyʌñ nam afịd mme idịd a-ami udọññọ fiin nnọ enwọñ. <verse eid="JER 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16" />Ammọ emaenwọñ anye, ammọ eyaeteeñe enyʌñ edamma ato ke ntak akañkañ se ami ndiisịn ke ufọọd ammọ.” <verse eid="JER 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17" />Ndin ami mmaabọ kọọb ke ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñnyʌñ nnam afịd mme idịd se anye akendọñ miin anọ enwọñ:<verse eid="JER 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18" />Yeruselem ye mme abio Yuda, ndidem ye mme adaaha utom amọ, nọ edo ndoon ye ñkpọndịk ye ndọk, isuuñọ, kpa naña ammọ edo mfịn ami;<verse eid="JER 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19" />Fero adidem Iyib, nditọufọk amọ, mme adaaha amọ ye afịd mbon amọ, <verse eid="JER 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20" />ye afịd isenawo e-ebaaha do;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:20">afịd ndidem Us;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:20">afịd ndidem mbon Filistia (ndidem Askelọn, Kasa, Ekrọn, ye mbon awo se isʌhọ ke Asdọd);<verse eid="JER 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21" />Edọm, Mọb ye Amọn;<verse eid="JER 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22" />afịd ndidem Tai ye Sidọn;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:22">ndidem ke mme mben inyañ ke edem akpainyañ;<verse eid="JER 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23" />Dedan, Tema, Buus ye afịd mbon e-ebaaha ke mme anyan itie;<verse eid="JER 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24" />afịd ndidem Arebia ye afịd mme idịd mme isenawo e-edʌññọ ke anaan ikọd;<verse eid="JER 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25" />afịd ndidem Simri, Elam ye Media;<verse eid="JER 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26" />ye afịd ndidem adoro ke ñkped-ñkped ye nsan-nsan, keedekeed, afịd mme abioubọọñ ke iso isọñ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:26">Ndin ke afịd ammọ emaekweeñe, adidem Sesak ayaanwọñ ñko.<verse eid="JER 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27" />“Ndin dọkkọ ammọ, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Nwọñ, yak unaam nyʌñ kọk, ndin duọ, ado kuudakka uda aba ke ntak akañkañ se ami ndiidọñ ke atu ndufo.’ <verse eid="JER 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28" />Ado adieke ammọ esịnne edubọọ kọọb ke ubọk ñnwọñ, dọkkọ ammọ, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: Ana enwọñ anye! <verse eid="JER 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29" />Se, ami mmetọọñọ adiben nsobo nsọk abio a-akereke Anyịñ mmi, ndin nte afo amenịm ke afo ayaabọkkọ? Afo uduutreke adibọ ufen, sia ami mmekoot akañkañ nnọ afịd awo se idʌñ ke ederimbod, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ.’<verse eid="JER 25:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30" />“Idahami tañ afịd mme ikọ ami baña ammọ nyʌñ dọkkọ ammọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">“ ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaakuun ato anyọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">anye ayaatop nte aduma ato adisana itieidʌñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">anyʌñ akuun ke ekamba uyio abaña isọñ amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Anye ayaasio ñkpo nte mbon e-esọnnọke mme kreb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">abọñ ñkpo abaña afịd mbon e-edʌññọ ke ederimbod.<verse eid="JER 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31" />Ñkpoyo ayaafịt awuọ utịd ederimbod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaakoot mme idịd ikpe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">anye ayaabiide ikpe anọ afịd ubonawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">anyʌñ awot mbon ibak,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">“Se! Nsobo asʌk asuana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:32">ke idịd ke idịd;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">ekamba ayobio asʌk adi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:32">tọọñọ ke mme utịd ederimbod.”<verse eid="JER 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33" />Ke ini ado mbon se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> awot ediisuasuana eyọhọ afịd itie, tọọñọ ke utịd ederimbod keed tutu awuọ utịd uko. Awo idiifʌhọke ammọ, inyʌññọ idiikoono, inyʌññọ idiibuuk, ado ediitie nte uduañ ke isọñ.<verse eid="JER 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34" />Ndufo mme akpemeedọñ, itua inyʌñ isio ñkpo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">ndufo mme adadusʌñ, iwere ke ntọñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">Sia ini a-anaaha iwot ndufo adikem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">ndufo eyaeduọññọ nte nti akukịmedọñ.<verse eid="JER 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35" />Mme akpemeedọñ idiinieghe itie nte efeghe eka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:35">mme adadusʌñ nnọọ udịmedọñ idiinieghe itie ubọkkọ.<verse eid="JER 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36" />Kop ntuaña mme akpemeedọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:36">ñkpo mme adadusʌñ mme ufene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:36">sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asʌk asobo awawa mbid ufene ammọ.<verse eid="JER 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37" />Eyaebiat mme ifuuro itie nduọkadudu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:37">ke ntak ufiob iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 25:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38" />Nte ekpe, anye ayaadakka akpọñ itie nnaa amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:38">isọñ ammọ ayaanaa ukpọk</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">ke ntak akañkañ awo ufiik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:38">ye ke ntak ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 25:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26" />
  <para style="s1">Edịkke Yerimaiya Uwem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1" />Ke ntọọñọ ukara Yehoiyakịm ayịn Yosaiya adidem Yuda, ikọ ami amaato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adi: <verse eid="JER 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Da ke akwere ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nyʌñ tañ ikọ nọ afịd awo ke mme abio Yuda ediighe adikpono Abasi ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Dọkkọ ammọ afịd se ami ñkudọñ fiin; kuusio ikọ ndomokeed uduọk. <verse eid="JER 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3" />Akemeido ammọ keedekeed eyaekop enyʌñ etịmme ekpọñ ndiọi usʌñ ammọ. Ndin ami ñyaasio idem ñkpọñ, ñnyʌññọ mben nsobo a-ami ñkeduakka nnọ ammọ ato ke idiọọkñkpọ se ammọ enam mbịne ammọ. <verse eid="JER 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4" />Dọkkọ ammọ bo, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Adieke ndufo imiikpañña utọñ innọ miin inyʌñ inịm mbed mmi, a-ami nnịmme ke iso ndufo, <verse eid="JER 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5" />ñko adieke ndufo imiikoppo ikọ mme isʌñutom mmi mme prọfed, a-ami ndọññọ inọọ ndufo ke ini ke ini (akpesʌkado ndufo imiikoppo), <verse eid="JER 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6" />ami ñyaanam ufọk ami aba nte Silo, ñko abio ami ado idʌñ isuuñọ ke afịd idịd ke ederimbod.’ ”<verse eid="JER 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7" />Mme aku, mme prọfed ye afịd awo emaekop naña Yerimaiya aketañ mme ikọ ami ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JER 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8" />Ado ke Yerimaiya akesʌk atatañ afịd ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedọñ anye abo yak atañ ama, mme aku, mme prọfed ye afịd awo emaemʌm anye, ebo ete, “Ana afo akpa! <verse eid="JER 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9" />Nsoo inam nọ afo atañ prọfesi ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ke ufọk ami adiiba nte Silo, ñko ke abio ami adiina ukpọk, awo idʌññọ ke esịd?” Ndin afịd mme awo emaekanna Yerimaiya ekʌk ke esịd ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10" />Ke ini mme adaaha Yuda ekekoppo ebaña mme ñkpọ ami, ammọ emaeto ke akwere ubọọñ ekaa ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ ekedat itie ammọ ke Ufa Inuaatob ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JER 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11" />Akem mme aku ye mme prọfed emaedọkkọ mme adaaha ye afịd awo ete, “Ana ebiere ikpe ñkpa enọ awo ami sia anye atañ ñkukịd abaña abio ami. Ndufo emekop ke utọñ ndufo!”<verse eid="JER 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12" />Ndin Yerimaiya amaabo afịd mme adaaha ye afịd mbon awo: “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akendọñ miin nọ nditañ ñkukịd mbaña ufọk ami ye abio ami ye afịd ñkpọ se ndufo ekop ami. <verse eid="JER 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13" />Idahami ineeñe usʌñ ndufo ye mme adinam ndufo, inyʌñ ikop uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaafeen inyʌññọ inam nsobo a-anye aketañña isịm ndufo. <verse eid="JER 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14" />Amaado ami, nsịne ke ubọk ndufo; inam ye ami se ndufo ekịt ebo ke afọn anyʌñ anen. <verse eid="JER 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15" />Ado idiọọñọ ibo ke ndufo ekpeñwot miin, ndufo eyaedue sia eyaedat iyiib awo i-imiidueghe isop e-edot ke idem ndufo ye ke abio ami ye mbon e-edʌññọ ke esịd amọ, sia ke akpanikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akendọñ miin nọ ntañ afịd mme ikọ ami nọ ndufo ekop.”<verse eid="JER 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16" />Ndin mme adaaha ye afịd mbon awo emaebo mme aku ye mme prọfed, “Inaaha ebiere ikpe ñkpa enọ ete ami! Anye atañ ikọ inọ ñnyịn ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JER 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17" />Ubaak mme ñkpisọñ abio ado emaewuọ eda enyʌñ edọkkọ afịd atu awo ete, <verse eid="JER 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18" />“Maika awo Moresed amaatañ prọfesi ke ayio Hesikaiya adidem Yuda. Anye amaadọkkọ afịd mbon Yuda ate, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">“ ‘Eyaekịm Saiyọn ekappa nte inwañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">Yeruselem adiido itoon mbio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">mbid ayaakọt afʌk abod tembịd.’ ”<verse eid="JER 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19" />“Nte Hesikaiya adidem Yuda me awo mfen amaawot anye? Nte Hesikaiya ikiteeñeke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, inyʌñ iyem mfọn amọ? Ndin nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikifeene, ndin ikibenne nsobo a-anye aketañña abaña ammọ ifep? Ñnyịn iyaidat ekamba nsobo inọ idem ñnyịn!”<verse eid="JER 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20" />(Ndin Yuria ayịn Semaiya a-atooho Kiriad Yerịm akedo awo mfen a-aketañña ñkukịd ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; anye amaatañ ukem mme ñkpọ ami abaña abio ami ye isọñ ami kpa naña Yerimaiya akenam. <verse eid="JER 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21" />Ke ini Adidem Yehoiyakịm ye afịd ikpọ mbon ekọñ amọ ye mme adaaha amọ ekekoppo ikọ amọ, adidem amaabiide adiwot Yerimaiya. Ado Yuria akekop ami, anye amaakop ndịk ndin anyʌñ afeghe akaa Iyib. <verse eid="JER 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22" />Ado adidem Yehoiyakịm amaadọñ Elnatan ayịn Akbọ ye mme ideen mfen ekaa Iyib. <verse eid="JER 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23" />Ammọ emaekesio Yuria ke Iyib eben esọk adidem Yehoiyakịm, a-akewotto anye ke akañkañ ndin etop akpo amọ esịn ke itie ubuuk awo ake mme ñkaña awo.)<verse eid="JER 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24" />Ke ado aboiyoke, Ahikam ayịn Safan amaada ye Yerimaiya, ndin awo ikiyaaha anye inọ mbon awo nọ ewot anye.<verse eid="JER 26:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Adiisuuk Iwuod Inọ Nebukadnesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1" />Ke ntọọñọ ukara Sedekaiya ayịn Yosaiya adidem Yuda, ikọ ami amaato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adisịm Yerimaiya ate: <verse eid="JER 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ annọọ miin ado ami: “Nam ekọb akpọnọ ke udʌk ye akpọnọ itọñ nyʌñ kọñọ ke itọñ mfo. <verse eid="JER 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3" />Ndin nọ etob esọk mme ndidem Edọm, Mọb, Amọn, Tai ye Sidọn ato mme isʌñutom ediighe Yeruselem edikịt Sedekaiya adidem Yuda.” <verse eid="JER 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4" />Nọ ammọ etob esọk mme eteufọk ammọ bo, Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: “Dọkkọ mme eteufọk ndufo ñkpọ ami: <verse eid="JER 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5" />Ke akwa adudu ye ñnyanna ubọk mmi ami ñkebot ederimbod ye mme awo ye mme unam e-ebaaha ke esịd, ami ñnyʌñ nnọ awo akeedodo a-ami mmaaha. <verse eid="JER 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6" />Idahami ami ñyaayaak afịd mme abio ndufo nsịn ke ubọk awo mmi Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn; ami ñyaanam mme unam ikọd esuuk iwuod enọ anye. <verse eid="JER 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7" />Afịd mme idịd eyaenam ñkpọ enọ anye ye ayịn amọ ye ayeyịn awodeen amọ tutu ini isọñ amọ akem; ndin uwak mme idịd ye ikpọ ndidem eyaesuuhọ anye itie.”<verse eid="JER 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8" />“ ‘Ado, adieke idịd me abioubọọñ ndomokeed imiinamma ñkpọ inọ Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn me ituak iwuod inọ anye ke idak akpọnọ amọ, ami ñyaamia idịd ado ufen ke akañkañ, akañ ye udọñọ nsobo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, tutu ami ndat ubọk amọ nsobo anye. <verse eid="JER 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9" />Ke ntoro ikiikpañ utọñ inọọ mme prọfed ndufo, mbiaidiọñ ndufo, mme akappa ndab ndufo, me mbia ñkukịd ndufo etañña ikọ inọọ ndufo, ndufo idiinamma ñkpọ inọ adidem Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10" />Ammọ etañ nsu-nsu ñkukịd enyʌñ enekke esio ndufo anyan usʌñ ekpọñ isọñ ndufo; ami ñyaibịne ndufo ndin ndufo eyaetak. <verse eid="JER 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11" />Ado adieke idịd ndomokeed adiisuuk iwuod inọ akpọnọ ukara adidem Babilọn inyʌñ ikpono anye, ami ñyaanam idịd ado aba ke isọñ ammọ, ekịm isọñ ammọ ekappa, etọ ñkpọ enyʌñ edʌñ ke esịd, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12" />Ami mmaanọ ukem etob ado esọk Sedekaiya adidem Yuda. Ami mmaabo, “Suuk iwuod mfo nọ akpọnọ ukara adidem Babilọn; nam ñkpọ nọ anye ye ikọd ammọ, ndin afo ayaadu uwem. <verse eid="JER 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13" />Nsoo inam nọ afo ye ikọd mfo eyem edikpa ke akañkañ, akañ ye udọñọ nsobo <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> aduakka anọ idịd imiinyịmmeke adituak iwuod ñkpono adidem Babilọn? <verse eid="JER 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14" />Ikiikpañ utọñ inọọ ikọ mme prọfed e-ebooho ndufo ete, ‘Ndufo idiinamma ñkpọ inọ adidem Babilọn,’ sia ammọ etañ nsu-nsu ñkukịd inọ ndufo. <verse eid="JER 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatommo ate, ‘Ami ñkidọññọ ammọ; ammọ etañ prọfesi nsu ke anyịñ mmi. Ke ntoro, ami ñyaibịne ndufo ndin ndufo eyaetak, ndufo ye mme prọfed e-etañña prọfesi inọọ ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16" />Akem ami mmaabo mme aku ye afịd ibon ami nte, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Ikiikpañ utọñ inọọ mme prọfed e-ebooho, ‘Ke etək-etək ini eyaetịmme ekoono mme ñkpoduoho ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> eto Babilọn edi.’ Ammọ etañ prọfesi nsu inọ ndufo. <verse eid="JER 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17" />Ikiikpañ utọñ inọọ ammọ. Inam ñkpọ inọ adidem Babilọn, ndin ndufo eyaedu uwem. Ntak a-abio ami akpebaaha ke nsobo-o? <verse eid="JER 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18" />Adieke ammọ edooho mme prọfed enyʌñ enie ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, yak ammọ ekpe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ubọk mbaak edikoono mme nsʌhọ ñkpọufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke akwere adidem Yuda ye ke Yeruselem ekaa Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 27:19" />Sia ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ abaña mme abai, Akwa besịn a-brọns, ñkpọ udod besịn ekemekke iben nsio ye mme ñkpọufọk mfen asʌhọke ke abio ami, <verse eid="JER 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 27:20" />a-Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn imiikikoonoke idaha a-anye akebenne Yehoiyakịn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yekonaiya</char><char style="ft" closed="false">asʌk ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yehoiyakịn</char></note> ayịn Yehoiyakịm adidem Yuda anyọñ nte ifʌn ato Yeruselem aka Babilọn, ye afịd mme adaaha ke Yuda ye Yeruselem; <verse eid="JER 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 27:21" />ntoro, se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel atañ abaña mme ñkpọ se isʌhọ ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke akwere adidem Yuda ye ke Yeruselem ado ami: <verse eid="JER 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 27:22" />‘Eyaeben ammọ ekaa Babilọn ammọ ediinyʌñ iba do tutu akem usen se ami ndiidikoono ammọ,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. ‘Ndin ami ñyaaben ammọ ñnyọñ ndi ñnyʌñ ntịmme ndịppe ammọ ndaaha ke itie ami.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28" />
  <para style="s1">Nsu-nsu Prọfed Hananaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1" />Ke ayọhọ afiọñ ition kpa ke isua ado, ayọhọ isua inaañ, ke ntọọñọ ukara Sedekaiya adidem Yuda, prọfed Hananaiya ayịn Asọọ, a-aketooho Kibiọn, amambo miin ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke iso mme aku ye afịd mbon awo ate: <verse eid="JER 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel atañ ado ami: ‘Ami ñyaabuuñ akpọnọ adidem Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3" />Ke ufañ isua iba ami ñyaatịmme ñkoono afịd mme ñkpọufọk Abọọñ a-Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn akekoonoke ato mi anyọñ Babilọn ñnyọñ ndi. <verse eid="JER 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4" />Ñko ami ñyaatịmme mben Yehoiyakịn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yekonaiya</char><char style="ft" closed="false">asʌk ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yehoiyakịn</char></note> ayịn Yehoiyakịm adidem Yuda ye afịd mbon se ekekoono ke ntañmfeb eto Yuda e-ekekaaha Babilọn ñnyọñ ndi itie ami,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atommo, ‘sia ami ñyaabuuñ akpọnọ adidem Babilọn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5" />Ndin prọfed Yerimaiya amaabọọrọ prọfed Hananaiya ke iso mme aku ye afịd awo e-ekedaaha ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JER 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6" />Prọfed Yerimaiya amaabo, “Amen! <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpekap anam ntoro! Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam ikọ amọ a-afo atañña prọfesi abaña mme ñkpọ ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye afịd mbon se etañ nte ifʌn eka Babilọn asu. <verse eid="JER 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7" />Kpayeado, kpañ utọñ kop se ami nnie aditañ inọọ ndufo ye afịd mbon mfen. <verse eid="JER 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8" />Tọọñọ ke aditọọñọ ini mme prọfed e-ekibemme ndufo ye ami iso eba emaetañ prọfesi ebaña ekọñ, nsobo ye udọñọ nsobo ke uwak idʌñ ye mme ikpọ abioubọọñ. <verse eid="JER 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9" />Ado ediidiọọñọ prọfed a-atañña ñkukịd emem nte ata adinen a-atooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adieke ñkukịd amọ awuọhọ asu.”<verse eid="JER 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10" />Akem prọfed Hananaiya amaakọññọ akpọnọ ado asio ke itọñ prọfed Yerimaiya anyʌñ abuuñ anye, <verse eid="JER 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11" />ndin Hananaiya amaabo ke iso afịd mbon awo ate, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: ‘Kpa ke ukem usʌñ ado ami ñyaabuuñ akpọnọ Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn ke itọñ afịd mme idịd ke ufañ isua iba.’ ” Ke adikop ami, prọfed Yerimaiya amaadakka akaa uwa amọ.<verse eid="JER 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12" />Ke prọfed Hananaiya amaakebuuñ akpọnọ asio ke itọñ prọfed Yerimaiya, ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya, ate: <verse eid="JER 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13" />“Kaa kedọkkọ Hananaiya bo, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ami. Afo amebuuñ akpọnọ eto, ado ke itie amọ afo ayaanie akpọnọ ukwak. <verse eid="JER 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel atañ ado ami: Ami ñyaakọọñ akpọnọ ukwak ke itọñ afịd mme idịd ami nọ ammọ enam ñkpọ enọ Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn, ndin ammọ eyaenam ñkpọ enọ anye. Ami ñko ñyaanyʌñ nnọ anye ukeme adikara kpa mme unam ikọd.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15" />Ndin prọfed Yerimaiya amaabo prọfed Hananaiya ate, “Hananaiya, kpañ utọñ! <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> udọññọ fiin, ado afo amekpak idịd ami nọ ebuọt idem ke nsu. <verse eid="JER 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: ‘Ami ñyausio fiin mfep ke iso isọñ. Kpa ke isua ami afo ayaakpa, sia afo amaakwọrọ nsọñiwuod adian <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17" />Ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba kpa ke isua ado, prọfed Hananaiya amaakpa.<verse eid="JER 28:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29" />
  <para style="s1">Ñwedetob e-Enọọhọ Mbon Ntañmfeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1" />Ami ado ikọ se ikisịne ke ñwedetob a-prọfed Yerimaiya akenọọhọ ato Yeruselem esọk mme ñkpisọñ se ikisʌhọ ke atu mbon emaeketañ esio ye mme aku, mme prọfed ye afịd mbon se Nebukadnesa akekoono nte ifʌn ke Yeruselem anyọñ Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2" />(Akedo ke ini Adidem Yehoiyakịn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yekonaiya</char><char style="ft" closed="false">asʌk ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yehoiyakịn</char></note> ye akwa abọọñanwaan, mme adaaha esob ye mme adadusʌñ ke Yuda ye Yeruselem, nta mme anamutom ye mbon utomusọ emaekekpọñ Yeruselem ekaa asen idịd.) <verse eid="JER 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3" />Anye amaayaak ñwedetob ami anọ Elasa ayịn Safan ñko ye Kemaria ayịn Hilkia, a-Sedekaiya adidem Yuda akedọññọ anọ Adidem Nebukadnesa ke Babilọn. Ate:<verse eid="JER 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ anọ afịd mbon se ami ñkeben nto Yeruselem ñka Babilọn ado ami: <verse eid="JER 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5" />“Ibọp mme ufọk inyʌñ idʌñ do; itọ inwañ inyʌñ idia mbunwịm ammọ. <verse eid="JER 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6" />Idọ ndọ inyʌñ iboon nditọ ideen ye ibaan; iyem ibaan inọ nditọ ideen ndufo, inyʌñ inọ nditọ ibaan ndufo ke ndọ, nọ ammọ ñko enie nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan. Itọt ke ibad do; ikiisịp ke ibad. <verse eid="JER 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7" />Ñko, iyem emem ye uforo abio a-ami ibenne ndufo ñka. Ibọñ akam inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ibaña abio ado, sia abio ado amaaforo, ndufo ñko eyaeforo.” <verse eid="JER 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: “Ikiiyak mme prọfed ye mbiaidiọñ ke atu ndufo ibiaña ndufo. Ikiikpañ utọñ inọọ mme ndab a-ndufo eyemme ammọ edappa. <verse eid="JER 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9" />Ammọ etañ nsu-nsu ñkukịd inọ ndufo ke anyịñ mmi. Ami ndọññọ ammọ,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: “Ke isua ata mme duob amaayọhọ anọ Babilọn, ami ñyaadi ibịne ndufo ñnyʌñ ndinam nti enwọñọ mmi adiben ndufo ntịmme ñnyọñ itie ami asu. <verse eid="JER 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11" />Sia ami mmediọọñọ mme uduak a-ami nnieghe inọọ ndufo,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “uduak adiforo ndufo idooho adinọmọ ndufo, uduak adinọ ndufo idodanyen ye ini iso. <verse eid="JER 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12" />Ndin ndufo eyaeñkoot miin enyʌñ edi edibọñ akam ennọ miin, ndin ami ñyaakop inọ ndufo. <verse eid="JER 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13" />Ndufo eyaeñkịt miin idaha a-ndufo eñyemme miin ke afịd esịd ndufo. <verse eid="JER 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14" />Ndufo eyaeñkịt miin,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “ndin ami ñyaiben ndufo ke ufʌn ñnyọñ ndi. Ami ñyaikoono ndufo ke afịd mme idịd ye mme itie a-ami ñkisuanna ndufo ndọñ,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “ndin ñyaiben ndufo ñnyọñ ndi ke itie a-ami ñkibenne ndufo ñka nte ifʌn.”<verse eid="JER 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15" />Ndufo emekeme edibo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasio mme prọfed inọ ñnyịn ke Babilọn,” <verse eid="JER 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16" />ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami abaña adidem a-atieghe ke ebekpo Defid ye afịd mbon awo e-ebaaha ke abio ami, mbon idʌñ ndufo imiikikeeneke ndufo ikaa asen idịd; <verse eid="JER 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17" />ii, se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: “Ami ñyaadọñ akañkañ, akañ ye udọñọ nsobo ke atu ammọ ndin ñyaanam ammọ eba nte mme eto fik e-enekkeke ebiara tutu awo ikanna idia ammọ. <verse eid="JER 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18" />Ami ñyaabịne ammọ ke akañkañ, akañ ye udọñọ nsobo, ñnyʌñ nnam ammọ edo ñkpọ itekesịd enọ afịd mme abio ke ederimbod, isuuñọ ye ñkpọ ndịk, ndọk ye abuud, ke atu mme idịd se ami mbịne ammọ nọ eka. <verse eid="JER 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19" />Sia ammọ ikikpañña utọñ ke mme ikọ mmi,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “mme ikọ a-ami ñkedọññọ mme isʌñutom mmi mme prọfed mmi ke ini ke ini. Ado ndufo mbon e-edʌññọ ke asen idịd inyʌññọ ikop,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20" />Ke ntoro ikop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, afịd ndufo mbon e-edʌññọ ke asen idịd, a-ami ñkebịneke nsio ke Yeruselem ñka Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ abaña Ehab ayịn Kolaiya ye Sedekaiya ayịn Maaseiya etañña nsu-nsu prọfesi inọọ ndufo ke anyịñ mmi ado ami: “Ami ñyaayaak ammọ nsịn ke ubọk Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn, ndin anye ayaawot ammọ ke iso ndufo. <verse eid="JER 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22" />Ke ntak ammọ, afịd mbon Yuda e-ebịnne esio ke abio, e-ebaaha ke Babilọn eyaetañ ikọ isuuñọ ami: ‘Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inam ndufo nte Sedekaiya ye Ehab, a-adidem Babilọn akefọppọ ke ikañ.’ <verse eid="JER 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23" />Sia ammọ emaenam mme mbubiam ñkpọ ke Isrel; ammọ emaesịn efịbe ye ibaan mbọhọidʌñ ammọ, ñko ke anyịñ mmi ammọ emaesʌhọ nsu a-ami mmiikidọññọ. Ami mmediọọñọ ado ñnyʌñ ndo ntiense mbaña ñkpọ ami,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etob e-Enọọhọ Esọk Semaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24" />Dọkkọ Semaiya awo Nehelam, <verse eid="JER 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Afo amaanọ mme ñwedetob ke anyịñ mfo nọ esọk afịd awo ke Yeruselem, anọ aku Sefanaiya ayịn Maaseiya, ye afịd mme aku mfen. Afo amaabo Sefanaiya, <verse eid="JER 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26" />‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> u-umek fiin aku ke itie Yehoiyada adise ñkpọ mbaña ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ana afo asịn idaad akeedodo a-anamma ñkpọ nte prọfed ñkpọnọ ukod ye ake itọñ. <verse eid="JER 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27" />Nsoo inam nọ afo umuukpanna Yerimaiya awo Anatod, a-adatta idem amọ nte prọfed ke atu ndufo? <verse eid="JER 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28" />Anye adọñ etob ami isọk ñnyịn ke Babilọn: Adiido anyan ini. Ke ntoro ibọp mme ufọk inyʌñ idʌñ do; itọ inwañ inyʌñ idia mfịd ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29" />Aku Sefanaiya amaakoot ñwedetob ado anọ prọfed Yerimaiya. <verse eid="JER 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30" />Akem ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya: <verse eid="JER 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31" />“Nọ etob ami esọk afịd mbon se idʌñ ke asen idịd: ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ abaña Semaiya awo Nehelam ado ami: Sia Semaiya amaatañ prọfesi inọ ndufo, akpesʌkado ami ñkidọññọ anye, ado anye ikpeiye ndufo ate ebuọt idem ke mme nsu, <verse eid="JER 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32" />se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Ami ndiitreke adimia Semaiya awo Nehelam ye ubon amọ ufen. Anye idiinieghe awo ndomokeed se isʌhọ ke atu ibon ami, anye ñko idiikịtte mme nti ñkpọ se ami ndiinam nnọ ikọd mmi, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, sia anye akwọrọ nsọñiwuod ambaña miin.’ ”<verse eid="JER 29:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ndakkanda Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1" />Ikọ a-aketooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adisịm Yerimaiya ado ami: <verse eid="JER 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel atañ ado ami: ‘Wet afịd mme ikọ se ami ntañ unọọ fiin sịn ke ñwed. <verse eid="JER 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3" />Mme usen esʌk edi,’ Abọọñ atañ, ‘a-ami ndiiben ikọd mmi Isrel ye Yuda ke isọñ ufʌn ñnyọñ ndi, ñnyʌñ mmaana ñyaak isọñ a-ami ñkenọọhọ mme eteete ammọ nnọ ammọ yak enie,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.”<verse eid="JER 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4" />Mme ikọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ abaña Isrel ye Yuda ado ami: <verse eid="JER 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">“ ‘Ekop ntuaña ndịk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:5">afai, idooho emem.<verse eid="JER 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6" />Ebịp inyʌñ idiọọñọ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">Nte awodeen akeme adiman nditọ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Ndin nsoo inam nọ ami ñkịt afịd mme akobidem ideen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">naña ekama ubọk efiọññọ idịb nte awonwaan a-abaaha ke ubiakuman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">afịd iso awo ekpʌhọ iso ñkpa?<verse eid="JER 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7" />Sai, ndịk mfʌhọ usen ado adiiba die!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">Ibaaha usen mfen se idiiba ntoro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">Anye adiido ini mfịna anọ Yekọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">ado eyaenyaaña anye esio.<verse eid="JER 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8" />“ ‘Ke usen ado,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:8">‘Ami ñyaabuuñ akpọnọ nsio ke itọñ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:8">ñnyʌñ ñwai mme ekọb ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:8">mme isenawo idiisịnne ammọ ufʌn aba.<verse eid="JER 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9" />Ado, ammọ ediinam ñkpọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:9">ye Defid adidem ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:9">a-ami ndiimek nnọ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10" />“ ‘Ke ntoro kuufeghe ndịk, Yekọb ayịnutom mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">kuuyak idem ubọkkọ, Isrel,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">‘Ami ñyaunyaaña fiin nsio ke anyan itie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">mbon ubon mfo ke isọñ asen idịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Yekọb ayaamaana anie emem ye ukpeme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">ndin ibaaha awo se idiinam nọ anye akop ndịk.<verse eid="JER 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11" />Ami mmọdo mba ye afo ndin ñyaanyʌñ unyaaña fiin,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">‘Akpesʌkado a-ami nsoboke mme idịd ataa afịd-afịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">a-ami isuanna ndufo nsịn ke atu ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">ami ndiisoboke ndufo ataa afịd-afịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Ami ñyaimia ndufo ufen ado ini amaakem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">ami ndiiyakka ndufo enyọñ ke imiibọọhọ utịb idiọọkñkpọ.’<verse eid="JER 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:12">“ ‘unan mfo inieghe ukọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:12">unan mfo ñko idiikpaaha.<verse eid="JER 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13" />Ibaaha awo ndomokeed se inam ñkpeubọk mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">unwam ibaaha inọ inia mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">ukọk ibaaha unọ fiin.<verse eid="JER 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14" />Afịd mme ufan mfo efre ubaña fiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">ammọ ikereke ñkpọ ubaña fiin aba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">Ami mmunọmọ fiin naña asua akpenam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">ñnyʌñ umia fiin ufen naña awo ibak akpenam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">sia ndudue mfo anekke akpon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">idiọọkñkpọ mfo anyʌñ awak.<verse eid="JER 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15" />Nsoo inam nọ afo atua abaña unan mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">ubiak mfo i-imiinieghe ukọk?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Ato ke ntak akwa ndudue ye uwak idiọọkñkpọ mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">ami unam fiin mme ñkpọ ami.<verse eid="JER 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16" />“ ‘Ado afịd mbon se uta fiin eyaeta ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">afịd mme asua mfo eyaefeeñe enyọñọ asenidịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">Mbon se ibịme inie mfo eyaebịme inie ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">afịd mbon se ubiat fiin ami ñyaabiat ammọ.<verse eid="JER 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17" />Ado ami ñyaamaana unọ fiin nsọñidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">ñnyʌñ ñkọk mme unan mfo,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">‘sia ukoot fiin se emaekesịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">Saiyọn a-awo ndomokeed imiiseeghe ñkpọ ibaña.’<verse eid="JER 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">“ ‘Ami ñyaamaana ndemme uforo ufọk Yekọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">ñnyʌñ ñkop mbọm mbaña itie idʌñ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">eyaemaana ebọp ñwuudo abio amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">ndin akwere ubọọñ ayaada ke asaña-asaña itie amọ.<verse eid="JER 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19" />Mme ikwọ ekọọm eyaeto ammọ idem ewuọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">ye ñkpo idaara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">Ami ñyaadian mme awo ke ibad ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">ndin ammọ idiisuuhoke ke ibad;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">ami ñyaanọ ammọ ukpono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">ndin awo idiisọññọ ammọ anyen.<verse eid="JER 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20" />Nditọ ammọ eyaeba nte ke mme usen esed,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:20">ndin abio ammọ ayaanie nsọọñọnda ke iso mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:20">ami ñyaamia afịd mbon se ifiik ammọ ufen.<verse eid="JER 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21" />Keed ke atu ammọ adiido adadusʌñ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">andikara ammọ adiito ke atu ammọ iwuọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Ami ñyaaben anye nsịkke ñkpere, ndin anye ayañkpere miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">sia anie ido awo se idiisio idem amọ inịm saña-saña</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">adiñkpere miin?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22" />‘Ndin ndufo ediido ikọd mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:22">ndin ami ñyaado Abasi ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23" />Se, ayobio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:23">ayaabomo ke iyadesịd,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:23">usọp-usọp afịm afiakka adi isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:23">ke iwuod mbon ibak.<verse eid="JER 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24" />Ufiob iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idiitịmmeke edem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">tutu anye anam ataa afịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">mme uduak esịd amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:24">Ke mme usen se idiidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">ñkpọ ami ayainwaña ndufo.<verse eid="JER 30:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, “Ke ini ado, ami ñyaado Abasi nnọ afịd mme ekpək Isrel, ndin ammọ eyaedo ikọd mmi.”<verse eid="JER 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:2">“Mme awo se ibọkkọ akañkañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:2">eyaekịt mfọn ke anaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:2">ami ñyaadi adinọ Isrel nduọkadudu.”<verse eid="JER 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaara idem inọ ñnyịn ke usen edem, ate:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:3">“Ami mmaima ndufo ye nsi-nsi ima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:3">ami mmaituut ndufo ndian idem ye mfọn i-imiidiikweeñeke.<verse eid="JER 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4" />Ami ñyaamaana ibọp ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">ndin afo, Adisịre Abọikpa Isrel, eyaetịmme ubọp.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">Ini keed mfen afo ayaatịmme aben nsak mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">anyʌñ awuọ akenek ye mbon idaara.<verse eid="JER 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5" />Afo ayaatịmme atọ mme inwañ fain</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:5">ke mme abod Sameria;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:5">mme atọinwañ eyaetọ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:5">enyʌñ ekop inem mfịd ammọ.<verse eid="JER 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6" />Usen ayaaba se mme akpeme abio ediisio ñkpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">ke mme abod Ifrem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:6">‘Idi, yak ñnyịn idọọk ika Saiyọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">ibịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">“Ikwọ ke idaara inọ Yekọb;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">isio ñkpọ inọ mme ñwuọnda idịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">Inam yak ekop itooro ndufo, inyʌñ ibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nyaaña ikọd mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">ñyọhọnsʌhọ Isrel.’<verse eid="JER 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8" />Se, ami ñyaaben ammọ nto ke isọñ adoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">ñnyʌñ ñkoot ammọ ke mme utịd ederimbod mbok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Ke atu ammọ mme nnan ye mbʌñọ eyaeba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">ibaan idịb ye ibaan e-ebaaha ke ubiakuman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">ataa uwak awo eyaenyọñ edi.<verse eid="JER 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9" />Ammọ ediidi ye ntuaña;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">ammọ eyaebọñ akam idaha ami mbenne ammọ ñnyọñ ndi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Ami ñyaadat ammọ usʌñ mboiyo ke mme mben mmọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">ke isọñ a-adọnọke a-ammọ imiidiifiọnnọke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">sia ami ndo ete Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">ñko Ifrem ado akpan mmi.<verse eid="JER 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10" />“Ndufo mme idịd, ikop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">itañ anye ke afịd mme nsan-nsan abio:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">‘Anye a-akesuanna Isrel ayaamaana akoono ammọ abok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">ayaanyʌñ ase ñkpọ abaña udịmedọñ amọ nte akpemeedọñ.’<verse eid="JER 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaafak Yekọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:11">anyʌñ anyaaña ammọ asio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:11">ke ubọk mbon esọññọ adudu ekan ammọ.<verse eid="JER 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12" />Ammọ eyaedi enyʌñ esio ñkpo idaara ke mme atịñe abod Saiyọn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">ammọ eyaedat esịd ke mfọn <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">abakpa, ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">mme ñyịn ke udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Ammọ ediiba nte inwañ se enekke eduọk mmọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">ndin ammọ idiifʌhọke aba.<verse eid="JER 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13" />Ntək ubọikpa eyaenek enyʌñ edat esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">ñkparawa ye ñkaan ideen ñko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">Ami ñyaakappa ayịd ammọ nsịn ke idadesịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">ami ñyaanọ ammọ idọñesịd ye idaara utu ke mfʌhọ.<verse eid="JER 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14" />Ami ñyaayọhọ mme aku ye uwak nti ñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:14">ndin ikọd mmi eyaeyọhọ ye mfọn mmi,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:14">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">“E-ekop uyio ke Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">mfʌhọ ye akpọsọñ ntuaña,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">Ratiel atua abaña nditọ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">anyʌñ asịn adikop idọñesịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">sia ammọ ibaññake aba ke uwem.”<verse eid="JER 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">“Itre uyio ndufo aditua ayịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">ikwokko mmọọñayịd ke anyen ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">sia eyainọ ndufo utịb ke utom ndufo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">“Ammọ eyaeto isọñ mbon asua ammọ enyọñ edi.<verse eid="JER 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17" />Ke ntoro idodanyen aba anọ ubon ndufo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:17">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:17">“Nditọ ndufo eyaenyọñ edi isọñ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18" />“Ke akpanikọ ami mmekop ntuaayịd Ifrem:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">‘Afo amantʌnọ miin nte enañ ntịdutọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">ndin ami mmebọ ntʌnọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Tịmme ndemme miin, ndin ami ñyaatịmme ndi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">sia afo ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi.<verse eid="JER 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19" />Ke ami mmaaketịn ñkpọñ usʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">ami mmaakappa esịd;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">ke ami mmaakenie ndiọọñọidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">ami mmaamia esịd mmi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Ami mmaakop abuud ye asuenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">sia ami ñkebiom abuud uyịn mmi.’<verse eid="JER 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20" />Nte Ifrem idooho adima ayịn mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">ayịn a-ami nnemme esịd mbaña?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Akpesʌkado a-ami nsisọppọ aditañ ikọ ndian anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">ami nsʌk ntotoiyo anye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Ke ntoro itọñ amọ asʌk andọọdọñ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">ami mmenie ekamba mbọm mbaña anye,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21" />“Daaha mme idiọọñọ ke usʌñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">daaha mme eto ndadusʌñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Kpeme mme akpọusʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">usʌñ a-afo asañake.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Nyọñ di, Abọikpa Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">nyọñ kaa mme abio mfo.<verse eid="JER 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22" />Afo uduuyooñ ukpeene die,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">akpara Awonwaan Isrel?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam ufa ñkpọ ke ederimbod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">awonwaan ayaanyọñ abịne awodeen.”<verse eid="JER 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: “Ami mmaaben ammọ nto isọñ ufʌn ñnyọñ ndi, mbon isọñ Yuda ye ke mme abio ammọ eyaemaana etañ mme ikọ ami: ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> udiọñ fiin, afo abio a-ayọhọke ye nseghe, afo adisana abod.’ <verse eid="JER 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24" />Mme awo eyaedʌñọ keed ke Yuda ye ke afịd mme abio amọ, mme atọinwañ ye mbon e-esañake ye mme udịmedọñ ammọ. <verse eid="JER 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25" />Ñyaanọ mbon nsaditọñ mmọọñ ñnyʌñ ndemme mbon mmemidem.”<verse eid="JER 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26" />Ke adikop ami mmaademme ñnyʌñ ñkanna anyen nseet. Idab mmi amannemme miin.<verse eid="JER 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abọ, “Mme usen esʌk edi, idaha se ami ndiiwuuk mme abioubọọñ Isrel ye Yuda ye mme awo ye mme unam. <verse eid="JER 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28" />Kpa naña ami ñkekpeme ammọ, adiwịppe ñnyʌñ ñwuut, ñnyʌñ ndooño nduọñọ, ñnyʌñ nsobo ñnyʌñ mben afanekọñ ndi, kpa ntoro ñyaakpeme ammọ adibọp ñnyʌñ ntọ,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="JER 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29" />Ke mme usen ado mme awo idiibooho aba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">“Mme ete ye mme eka ekedia kreb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:29">ado adiyịk adidoro nditọ ke eded.”<verse eid="JER 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30" />Utu ke ado, afịd awo ediikpa ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ ammọ; awo akeedodo a-adiaha mbiara kreb, ammọ ke eded adiidoro adiyịk.<verse eid="JER 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “Mme usen esʌk edi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">a-ami ndiinam ufa edioomo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:31">ye mbon Isrel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">ye mbon Yuda ñko.<verse eid="JER 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32" />Idiibaaha nte edioomo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">a-ami ñkenamma ye mme eteete ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:32">ke ini ami ñkemʌmmọ ammọ ke ubọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">ndat ñwuọ ñkpọñ Iyib,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:32">sia ammọ emaebiat edioomo mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">akpesʌkado a-ami ñkedooho ebe nnọ ammọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">akedo eteufọk ammọ</char></note>,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33" />“Ami ado edioomo se ami ndiinam ye mbon Isrel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">ke ini ado amaaboiyo,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">“Ami ñyaasịn mbed mmi ke akikere ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">ñnyʌñ ñwet anye ke esịd ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">Ami ñyaado Abasi ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">ammọ eyaenyʌñ edo ikọd mmi.<verse eid="JER 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34" />Ammọ idiikpeebe mbọhọidʌñ ammọ aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">me emọ-emọ ibo, ‘Diọọñọ Abọọñ,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">Sia afịd ammọ eyaendiọọñọ miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">tọọñọ ke andisịb ñkan tutu akesịm andikpon ñkan,” Abọọñ atañ. Sia ami ñyaafeen mme ibak ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">ndiinyʌññọ ntoiyo mme ndiọiñkpọ ammọ aba.<verse eid="JER 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">anye a-akemekke utịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">nọ ayamma ke uweemeayio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">a-akenamma ewʌhọ nọ afiọñ ye mme ntantaafiọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">eyamma ke akonayio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">anye a-abəkkoke akpainyañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">tutu mbufịd amọ akuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ado anyịñ amọ:<verse eid="JER 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36" />“Ibọhọke mme ewʌhọ ami esop ke iso mmi,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:36">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:36">“ke Isrel adiitre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:36">adido idịd ke iso mmi.”<verse eid="JER 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">“Ibọhọke akpedo ekeme adidomo mme hefịn ke anyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">enyʌñ ekan eduuñọ ekịt mme itiad idakisọñ ederimbod</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">ke ami ndiisịn afịd mme ubon Isrel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">ato ke ntak afịd se ammọ enam,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38" />“Mme usen esʌk edi,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “ediitịmme ibọp abio ami innọ miin atọọñọ ke Tọwa Hananel tutu asịm Inuuk Inuaatob. <verse eid="JER 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39" />Udʌk udomoñkpọ ayaanyọọñ tọọñọ do tutu akesịm ke abod Kareb, ndin akaaña akewuọ Koa. <verse eid="JER 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40" />Afịd abedeñ e-eduọñọke mme akpo awo ye ntọñ, ndin ye afịd mme unaisọñ ke ñkan Abedeñ Kidrọn ke usakkautịn atọọñọ ke inuuk ñkañ Inuaatob Enañmbakara, adiido adisana anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Abio ami idiikịtte ñwuudo aba ndin awo idiidịppeke anye isio.”<verse eid="JER 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32" />
  <para style="s1">Yerimaiya Adep Inwañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1" />Ikọ se ikito <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idisịm Yerimaiya ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob ke isua ukara Sedekaiya adidem Yuda, a-akedooho ayọhọ isua ukara Nebukadnesa duob mme itiaita ado ami. <verse eid="JER 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2" />Udịmekọñ adidem Babilọn emaekanna Yeruselem ekʌk, ndin emaekʌk prọfed Yerimaiya esịn ke akwere mbon ukpeme ufọk ubọọñ Yuda.<verse eid="JER 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3" />Idaha ado Sedekaiya adidem Yuda amaasịn anye ke ñkpakọb do, abo ate, “Nsoo inam nọ afo atañ ñkukịd naña afo atañ ado? Afo ate, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Ami ñyaayaak abio ami nsịn ke ubọk adidem Babilọn, ndin anye ayaadat abio ami. <verse eid="JER 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4" />Sedekaiya adidem Yuda idiibọkkọke mbon Babilọn, ado eyaeyaak anye esịn adidem Babilọn ke ubọk, ndin ayaaneme nneme ye anye iso ye iso anyʌñ akịt anye ke anyen amọ. <verse eid="JER 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5" />Anye ayaaben Sedekaiya akaa Babilọn, itie se anye adiiba tutu ami ndinọmọ anye, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. Adieke afo anwanake ye mbon Babilọn, afo uduukanna.’ ”<verse eid="JER 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6" />Yerimaiya amaabo, “Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadinsịm miin: <verse eid="JER 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7" />Hanamel ayịn Salum ayịneka ete mfo ayaadi ubịne fiin adibo ate, ‘Dep inwañ mmi adaaha ke Anatod, sia nte ayịnete mmi anekkeke añkpere idem ado unen ye ubiọñutom mfo adidep anye.’<verse eid="JER 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8" />“Akem, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaketañ, ayịnete mmi Hanamel amaadi ambịne miin ke akwere mbon ukpeme adibo, ‘Dep inwañ mmi ke Anatod ke efaak ñkañ Benyamin. Sia adooho unen mfo adifakka anye ñnyʌñ ndat anye, dep anye nie nọ idem mfo.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 32:8">“Ami mmaadiọọñọ ke uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedo ami; <verse eid="JER 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9" />ndin ami mmaadep inwañ ado ke Anatod nto ayịnete mmi Hanamel ñnyʌñ ndomo mbaak akʌk sekel silfa duob mme itiaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kram 200</char></note> nnọ anye. <verse eid="JER 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10" />Ami mmaasịn ubọk ñnyʌñ mfiik ubọk ke ñwed isọñ ami, mmaanie ntiense, ñnyʌñ ndomo mme silfa ami ke udomoñkpọ. <verse eid="JER 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11" />Ami mmaaben ñwed unyam isọñ, ñwed a-akenieghe idiọọñọ ufiik ubọk a-akedọñọke mme item ye ewʌhọ, adiana ye ñwed a-awo imiikifiike ubọk; <verse eid="JER 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12" />ndin ami mmaayaak ñwed isọñ ami nnọ Baruk ayịn Neria, a-akedooho ayịn Maseiya, ke iso ayịnete mmi Hanamel ye ke iso mme ntiense e-emaekesịn ubọk ke ñwed isọñ ami ye afịd mme Yuu se ikitie ke akwere mbon ukpeme.<verse eid="JER 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 32:13" />“Ke iso ammọ ami mmaanọ Baruk mme item ami: <verse eid="JER 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 32:14" />‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Ben mme ñwed ami, mme ñwed ekenyamma isọñ se emaekesịn ubọk ye mbon se awo imiisịnne ubọk, nyʌñ sịn ammọ ke ako mbad nọ ammọ eba ekpeene ke anyan ini. <verse eid="JER 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15" />Sia se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Eyaetịmme edep mme ufọk, mme ikọd ye mme inwañ fain ke isọñ ami.’<verse eid="JER 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16" />“Ke ini ami mmaakeyaak ñwed isọñ ami nnọ Baruk ayịn Neria, ami mmaabọñ akam nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>:<verse eid="JER 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17" />“Aha, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, afo amaabot mme hefịn ye ederimbod ke akwa adudu ye ubọk mfo. Ibaaha ñkpọ se isọñ ukan fiin. <verse eid="JER 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18" />Afo awọt mme awo tọsịn ima ado aben ufen idiọọkñkpọ mme ete adot nditọ ke idem. Akwa ye akpọsọñ Abasi, a-anyịñ mfo adooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, <verse eid="JER 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19" />mme uduak mfo ekpoon, mme ubọkutom mfo enyʌñ enie uteeñe. Anyen mfo atara ase usʌñ afịd ubonawo; afo anọ awo keedekeed utịb akeene adinam ammọ ye naña adinam ammọ adot. <verse eid="JER 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20" />Afo amaanam mme idiọọñọ ye utịppeñkpọ ke Iyib ñko afo asʌk akaaka iso adinam ammọ tutu usen ami, ke Isrel ye ke atu afịd ubonawo, afo amenyʌñ awuọ etob a-afo asʌkkọ awuọ mfịn ami. <verse eid="JER 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21" />Afo amaaben ikọd mfo Isrel asio ke Iyib ye idiọọñọ ye utịppeñkpọ, ke akwa adudu ye akwa ubọk mfo ye ekamba ndịk. <verse eid="JER 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22" />Afo amaanọ ammọ isọñ ami a-afo akenwọñọke adinọ mme eteete ammọ, isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk. <verse eid="JER 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23" />Ammọ emaedʌk edi enyʌñ edat isọñ ado enie, ado ammọ ikikoppo item unọ fiin inyʌññọ ikeene mbed mfo; ammọ ikinamma se afo akenọọ ammọ nte ewʌhọ. Ndin afo amaaben afịd mme afanekọñ ami adot ammọ.<verse eid="JER 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24" />“Ise naña ebọp ñkpana ubiọọñọ ekọñ adidat mben abio ami. Ke ntak akañkañ, akañ ye udọñọ nsobo, eyaeyaak abio ami esịn ke ubọk mbon Babilọn e-enwanake ye anye. Se afo aketañ atịppe kpa naña afo akịt ke anyen mfo. <verse eid="JER 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25" />Akpesʌkado eyaeyaak abio ami esịn ke ubọk mbon Babilọn, afo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, a-ambo miin, ‘Dep inwañ ami ye silfa nyʌñ nam awo atie ntiense unọ ke ndubeghe ami.’ ”<verse eid="JER 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26" />Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya: <verse eid="JER 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27" />“Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi afịd ubonawo. Nte aba ñkpọ ndomokeed se isọñ iñkan miin? <verse eid="JER 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ami: Ami ñyaayaak abio ami nsịn ke ubọk mbon Babilọn ye Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn, ediisịn anye ukad. <verse eid="JER 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29" />Mbon Babilọn enwanake ye abio ami eyaedisịn ikañ ke abio ami; ammọ eyaefọp anye enịm ke isọñ, adiana ye mme ufọk a-mme awo ekedịppeke iyadesịd mmi, ke adifọp insensi ke mme akọmufọk nnọọ Baal, ñko ye ke adiduọk ukọd nte uwa nnọọ mme abasi mfen.<verse eid="JER 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30" />“Mbon Isrel ye Yuda inamma ñkpọ mfen ikan idiọọkñkpọ ke iso mmi tọọñọ ke uyịn ammọ; ke akpanikọ, mbon Isrel inamma ñkpọ mfen ke imiibọhọke adidịppe iyadesịd mmi ke se ubọk ammọ anam, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="JER 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31" />Tọọñọ ke usen ekebọppọ anye tutu asịm idahami, abio ami amaadịppe iyadesịd ye ifiobesịd mmi, ke ntak ado ana mben anye mfep ke iso mmi. <verse eid="JER 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32" />Mbon Isrel ye Yuda eñyat miin esịd ke afịd se ammọ enam; ammọ, mme ndidem ammọ, mme adaaha ammọ, mme aku ammọ, ye mme prọfed ammọ, mbon Yuda ye mme andidʌñ ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="JER 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33" />Ammọ emaekanna edem eñwọt miin, idooho iso ammọ; akpesʌkado a-ami ñkekpeebe ammọ mbañ mbañ, ammọ ikikpañña utọñ inyʌññọ ikop ntʌnọ. <verse eid="JER 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34" />Ammọ emaekọọñ mme mbubiam ñkpọ ammọ ke ufọk e-ekoodo edian Anyịñ mmi enyʌñ esappa anye. <verse eid="JER 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35" />Ammọ emaebọp mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie enọ Baal ke Abedeñ Ben Hinọm, adiwa nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ammọ nnọọ Mọlek, akpesʌkado a-ami mmiikinọọhọ ammọ utọ ewʌhọ ado; ikinyʌññọ indọdʌk miin akikere, nte ke ammọ ekpaenam utọ mbubiam ñkpọ ado enyʌñ enam Yuda anam idiọọkñkpọ.<verse eid="JER 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36" />“Afo atañ abaña abio ami, ‘Ke akañkañ, akañ ye udọñọ nsobo eyaeyaak anye esịn ke ubọk adidem Babilọn’; ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Isrel atañ ado ami: <verse eid="JER 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37" />Ami ñyaakoono ammọ ke afịd mme isọñ se ñkebịne ammọ ndọñ ke akpọsọñ iyadesịd ye ifiobesịd mmi; ami ñyaaben ammọ ñnyọñ ndi itie ami ñnyʌñ nnam ammọ edʌñ ke ifuuro. <verse eid="JER 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38" />Ammọ eyaedo ikọd mmi ndin ami ñyaado Abasi ammọ. <verse eid="JER 32:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39" />Ami ñyaanọ ammọ esịd keed ke unañña ñkpọ, mbaak ammọ emfeghe miin afịd ini, ñko nọ afịd ñkpọ afọn ye ammọ ye nditọ ammọ e-ekeeneke ammọ ke edem. <verse eid="JER 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40" />Ami ñyaanam nsi-nsi edioomo ye ammọ: Ami ndiitreke adinam eti ñkpọ nnọọ ammọ, ndin ami ñyaademme ammọ ukpọñ nọ embaak miin, mbaak ammọ edikanna edem eñkpọñ miin tutu amama. <verse eid="JER 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41" />Ami ñyaakop inemesịd ke adinam nti ñkpọ mfọn nnọọ ammọ, ndin ñyaawuuk ammọ ke isọñ ami ke afịd esịd ye ukpọñ mmi.<verse eid="JER 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Kpa naña ami ñkeben afịd ikpọ mfịna ami ndot ibon ami, kpa ntoro ke ami ndiinọ ammọ afịd uforo a-ami ñkenwọñọke nnọ ammọ. <verse eid="JER 32:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43" />Ini keed mfen eyaedep mme inwañ ke isọñ ami naña afo abo, ‘Anye ado isọñ emaekesobo, a-awo ye mme unam imiibaaha, sia emaeyaak anye esịn ke ubọk mbon Babilọn.’ <verse eid="JER 32:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44" />Eyaedep mme inwañ ke silfa, enyʌñ esịn ubọk ke ñwed isọñ, efiik ubọk ye ntiense ke ñkañ Benyamin, ke mme esịd idʌñ e-ekannake Yeruselem ekʌk, ke mme abio Yuda ye ke mme anyọñ abio isọñ idʌñ, ke usuuk ntəkabod edem usobutịn ye ke ñkañ Nekef, sia ami ñyaatịmme ndịppe uforo ammọ ndaaha,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ñyaatịmme </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mben ammọ nsio ke isọñ ufʌn</char></note> <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.”<verse eid="JER 32:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33" />
  <para style="s1">Enwọñọ Adimaana Ndemme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1" />Ke idaha Yerimaiya akesʌkkọ aba ke esịd akwere mbon ukpeme, uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm anye ayọhọ akañ iba: <verse eid="JER 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ami, anye a-akebotto ederimbod, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-akebotto anye anyʌñ awuuk anye, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado anyịñ amọ: <verse eid="JER 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3" />“Ñkoot miin ndin ami ñyauyie fiin ñnyʌñ udọkkọ fiin mme ikpọ ye ntotəño ñkpọ a-afo umuudiọọñọke.” <verse eid="JER 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4" />Sia se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañ abaña mme ufọk ke abio ami ye mme ufọk ubọọñ ke Yuda ewuudo ediben ammọ ñnwana mme ndibene ubiọọñọ ye akañkañ <verse eid="JER 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5" />ke anwan ammọ ye mbon Babilọn ado ami: Ammọ ediiyọhọ ye akpo mbon awo se ami ndiiwot ke iyadesịd ye ifiobesịd mmi. Ami ñyaadịp abio ami iso mmi ato ke ntak afịd ibak ammọ.<verse eid="JER 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6" />Kpayeado, ami ñyaaben nsọñidem ye ukọk nsọk anye; ami ñyaakọk ikọd mmi ñnyʌñ nnam ammọ enie ayọhọ emem, mfọn ye ukpeme. <verse eid="JER 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7" />Ami ñyaaben Isrel ye Yuda nto isọñ ukad ndi, ñnyʌñ mmaana nnam ammọ eba naña ekeba akpa. <verse eid="JER 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8" />Ami ñyaakwokko afịd idiọọkñkpọ a-ammọ ekenamma nsio, ñyaanyʌñ mfeen afịd idiọọkñkpọ nsọñiwuod a-ammọ ekenamma ye ami mfep. <verse eid="JER 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9" />Ndin abio ami ayannọ miin itooro, idaara, ekọọm ye ukpono ke iso afịd mme idịd ke ederimbod e-ekoppo afịd nti ñkpọ se ami nnam nnọ ammọ; ndin ammọ eyaeba ke ñkpaidem enyʌñ edịkke ebaña akpọmiọk uforo ye emem a-ami nnọọhọ anye.<verse eid="JER 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 33:10" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: ‘Afo ametañ abaña isọñ ami, Anye ado ñwuudo ukpọkisọñ, mbon awo ye mme unam ibaaha ke esịd.’ ” Ado ke mme abio Yuda ye mme efaak ke Yeruselem a-mme awo emaekekpọñ, mbon awo me mme unam inyʌññọ idʌñọ ke esịd, eyaetịmme ekop uyio ammọ <verse eid="JER 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 33:11" />mme uyom idaara ye inemesịd, uyio anwaanndọ ye ebendọ, ndin ye uyio mbon ebenne uwa ekọọm edi ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ebo ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:11">“Nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ekọọm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> afọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">ima amọ aba ke nsi-nsi.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 33:11">Sia ami ñyaamaana ndemme mme uforo isọñ ami naña akeba ke akpa, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: ‘Ke isọñ ami, a-anaaha ukpọk, mme awo ye unam ibaaha, ke afịd mme abio amọ, nseghe ayaatịmme aba anọ mme akpemeedọñ adinọ udịmedọñ ammọ nduọkadudu. <verse eid="JER 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13" />Ke mme abio isọñ idʌñ, ke usuuk ntəkabod edem usobutịn ye ke ñkañ Nekef, ke ñkanñkʌk abio Benyamin, ke mme idʌñ Yeruselem ye ke mme abio Yuda, mme ufene eyaemaana esaña eboiyo ke ubọk mbon e-ebatta ammọ,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14" />“ ‘Mme usen esʌk edi,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ‘a-ami ndiinam mme nti enwọñọ ami ñkenamma nnọ mbon Isrel ye Yuda esu.<verse eid="JER 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15" />“ ‘Ke mme usen ado ye ke ini ado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:15">ami ñyaanam adinen Ñkọk atịppe ato aduuk Defid;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:15">anye ayaanam se inen inyʌñ ifọn ke isọñ.<verse eid="JER 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16" />Ke mme usen ado Yuda ayaabọkkọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:16">ndin Yeruselem ayaadʌñ ke ifuuro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:16">Anyịñ se ediikoot anye ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:16">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Adinen Andinyaaña Ñnyịn.’<verse eid="JER 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17" />Sia se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ami: ‘Defid idiitreke adinie awodeen se itie ke ebekpo Isrel, <verse eid="JER 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18" />me mme aku Lifai editre edinie awodeen se ida ke iso mmi afịd ini inọ ufọfọb uwa, adiwa uwa mfịd ñnyʌñ nnam mme uwa.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya: <verse eid="JER 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ami: ‘Adieke afo akemeke adibiat edioomo mmi ke uweemeayio anyʌñ abiat edioomo mmi ke akonayio, tutu uweemeayio ye akonayio idiighe aba ke akemini ammọ, <verse eid="JER 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21" />ndin edioomo mmi ye isʌñutom mmi Defid, ye edioomo mmi ye mme Lifai e-edooho mme aku e-enamma ñkpọ ennọọ miin, ekeme edibiara ndin Defid idiinieghe awo ke ubon amọ adiikara ke ebekpo amọ. <verse eid="JER 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22" />Ami ñyaanam ubon isʌñutom mmi Defid ye mme Lifai e-enamma ñkpọ ennọọ miin ewak nte udịm ntantaafiọñ ke ikpaanyọñ anyʌñ ananaibad nte ntan ke mben inyañ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya ate: <verse eid="JER 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24" />“Nte afo ukịtte ke ibon ami esʌk ebo, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-asịn mme abioubọọñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mme ubon</char></note> iba a-anye akemekke’? Ke ntoro ammọ ese ikọd mmi ke ndek inyʌññọ ibat ammọ nte idịd aba. <verse eid="JER 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: ‘Akpedo ami ñkinamma edioomo mmi ye uweemeayio ye akonayio ñnyʌñ ñwuuk mme mbed mbaña hefịn ye ederimbod, <verse eid="JER 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26" />ndin ami ñyaasịn ubon Yekọb ye Defid isʌñutom mmi ndin ndiimekke keed ke atu nditọ amọ adikara ubon Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb. Sia ami ñyaatịmme ndemme uforo ammọ ñnyʌñ ñkop mbọm mbaña ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34" />
  <para style="s1">Edʌt Sedekaiya Utọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 34:1" />Ke ini Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn ye afịd udịmekọñ amọ ye afịd mme abioubọọñ ye mbon awo ke idʌñ a-anye akekarake ekenwanake ye Yeruselem ye afịd mme ñkanñkʌk abio amọ, ikọ ami amaato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adisịm Yerimaiya: <verse eid="JER 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 34:2" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Kaa bịne Sedekaiya adidem Yuda nyʌñ kedọkkọ anye ate, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Ami ñyaayaak abio ami nsịn adidem Babilọn ke ubọk, ndin anye ayaafọp anye anịm ke isọñ. <verse eid="JER 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3" />Afo uduubọkkọke anye, ado eyaumʌm fiin eyaak enọ anye. Afo ayaakịt adidem Babilọn ke anyen mfo, ndin anye ayaatañ ikọ ye afo iso ye iso. Ndin afo ayaakaa Babilọn.<verse eid="JER 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4" />“ ‘Ado kop enwọñọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> u-ubañake fiin, Sedekaiya adidem Yuda. Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ubaña fiin ado ami: Afo uduukpaaha ke akañkañ; <verse eid="JER 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5" />afo uduukpa ke emem. Naña mme awo ekebara ikañ ukpono enọ mbọọñ e-eketooho ekara mbemiso afo adidat itie ammọ, ndidem e-ekekarake mbemiso afo, kpa ntoro ke ammọ ediibara ikañ ukpono unọ fiin enyʌñ eseeme, “Sai, eteufọk!” Ami ke idem mmi nnam enwọñọ ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6" />Akem prọfed Yerimaiya amaatañ afịd mme ñkpọ ami anọ Sedekaiya adidem Yuda, ke Yeruselem, <verse eid="JER 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7" />ke idaha udịmekọñ adidem Babilọn ekesʌkkọ enwana ye Yeruselem ye mme abio Yuda mfen ekesʌkkọ esọọñọ emʌm ekama, Lakis ye Aseka. Ukweeñe ñkpọsọñ abio se ikisʌhọ ke Yuda ekedo ami.<verse eid="JER 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwuọufʌn mme Ifʌn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya ke ini adidem Sedekaiya amaakenam edioomo ye afịd awo ke Yeruselem adikwọrọ uwuọufʌn nnọọ mme ifʌn. <verse eid="JER 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9" />Akena nte afịd awo esaana ifʌn Hibru ammọ eyaak, ke ideen ye ibaan; ikinaaha awo ndomokeed asịn emọ-emọ awo Hibru ke ukad. <verse eid="JER 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10" />Ndin afịd mme adaaha se ikinyịmme edioomo ami emaebo ke mmimọ iyaisaana ifʌn mmimọ ideen ye ibaan iyaak inyʌññọ isịn ammọ ukad. Ammọ emaenyịmme, enyʌñ esaana ammọ eyaak. <verse eid="JER 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11" />Ado akema ammọ emaekpəho akikere enyʌñ etịmme emuum mme ifʌn ammọ e-emaekeyaak enyʌñ emaana esịn ammọ ke ufʌn.<verse eid="JER 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12" />Akem ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya: <verse eid="JER 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Ami mmaanam edioomo ye mme eteete ndufo idahami a-ñkesioho ammọ ke isọñ Iyib, ke isọñ ufʌn. Ami mmaabo, <verse eid="JER 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14" />‘Ke afịd ayọhọ isua itiaba ana ndufo esaana emọ-emọ mbon Hibru ekenyamma idem ammọ nte ifʌn inọọ ndufo eyaak. Ke ammọ emaekedʌñ ye ndufo ke isua itiokeed, ana nte ndufo eyaak ammọ nọ enyọñ.’ Ado mme eteete ndufo ikikoppo se ami ñketañ, ikinyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ innọ miin. <verse eid="JER 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15" />Ke mmi-mmi afo amaakappa esịd anyʌñ anam se inen ke iso mmi: Ndufo keedekeed emaenyịmme uwuọufʌn enọ ikọd ndufo. Ndufo emaenam edioomo ke iso mmi ke ufọk a-akereke Anyịñ mmi. <verse eid="JER 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16" />Ado idahami ndufo emetịmme esappa anyịñ mmi; ndufo keedekeed emaetịmme eben ifʌn ndufo ideen ye ibaan a-ndufo ekesaanake eyaak ete enyọñọ. Ndufo emenyịk ammọ aditịmme ndo ifʌn ndufo.<verse eid="JER 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17" />“Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Ndufo ikoppo item mmi; ndufo ikikpọkkọ mbon ndufo iyaak. Ke ntoro ami mmekwọrọ ‘ñkpọkñyak’ inọ ndufo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ‘ñkpọkñyak’ adikpa ke akañkañ, udọñọ nsobo ye akañ. Ami ñyaanam ndufo edo ñkpọ itekesịd enọ afịd mme idịd ke ederimbod. <verse eid="JER 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 34:18" />Mbon e-ekebiatta edioomo mmi, i-imiinyʌññọ inịm mme ewʌhọ edioomo a-ammọ ekenamma ke iso mmi, ami ñyaanam ammọ nte ñyịn enañ a-ammọ ekebakkake iba enyʌñ esaña ke ufọọd mbaak iba ado eboiyo. <verse eid="JER 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 34:19" />Mme adadusʌñ ke Yuda ye ke Yeruselem, mme adaaha esob, mme aku ye afịd mme awo ke abio ekesañake ke mbaak iba ñyịn enañ ado, <verse eid="JER 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20" />ami ñyaayaak nsịn ke ubọk mme asua ammọ eyemme adiwot ammọ. Mme akpo ammọ eyaekappa ndidia enọ mme inuen ye ndiọi unam.<verse eid="JER 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21" />“Ami ñyaaben Sedekaiya adidem Yuda ye mme adaaha amọ nsịn mme asua ammọ eyemme adiwot ammọ ke ubọk, ye udịmekọñ adidem Babilọn, emaeketịmme edem ikpọñ ndufo. <verse eid="JER 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22" />Ami ñyaanọ ewʌhọ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ndin ami ñyaaben ammọ ntịmme ndi abio ami. Ammọ eyaenwana ye anye, eben anye enyʌñ efọp anye enịm ke isọñ. Ndin ami ñyaasobo mme abio Yuda mbaak awo ndomokeed adidʌñ do.”<verse eid="JER 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35" />
  <para style="s1">Mbon Rekab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1" />Ikọ aketooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adisịm Yerimaiya ado ami ke ini ukara Yehoiyakịm ayịn Yosaiya adidem Yuda: <verse eid="JER 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2" />“Ikaa ufọk Rekab ikikoot ammọ nọ edi keed ke atu mme ubeed ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ enọ ammọ ukọd nọ enwọñ.”<verse eid="JER 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3" />Ndin ami mmaakaa adikoot Yaasania ayịn Yerimaiya, ayịn Habasinia, ye nditọeka amọ ideen ye afịd nditọ amọ ideen, afịd ufọk Rekab. <verse eid="JER 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4" />Ami mmaaben ammọ ndi ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke ubeed nditọ ideen Hanan ayịn Ikdalia awo Abasi. Ubeed ado akediana ubeed mme adaaha, a-akedaaha ke anyọñ ubeed Maaseiya ayịn Salum, akpeme inuausʌñ. <verse eid="JER 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5" />Akem ami mmaanịm mme ntotəño bọwịd e-ekeyọhọke ye ukọd ye kọọb ke iso mbon Rekab ñnyʌñ mbo ammọ, “Inwọñ ukọd.”<verse eid="JER 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6" />Ado ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Ñnyịn isinwọññọ ukọd, sia eteete ñnyịn Yehonadab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yonadab</char><char style="ft" closed="false">asʌk ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yehonadab;</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ke ufañ ami ye ke iwuod ñwed ami.</char></note> ayịn Rekab amainọ ñnyịn ewʌhọ ami: ‘Inaaha ndufo me mbon ubon ndufo enwọñ ukọd. <verse eid="JER 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7" />Ñko inaaha ndufo ebọp ufọk, etọ mfịd me etọ inwañ fain; inaaha ndufo enie mme ñkpọ ami ndomokeed, ado ana nte edʌñ ke mme atayad. Ndin ndufo eyaedʌñ ke anyan ini ke isọñ a-ndufo ebaaha ekpeme edọñ.’ <verse eid="JER 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8" />Ñnyịn iminịm afịd mbed se eteete ñnyịn Yehonadab ayịn Rekab akitemme ñnyịn. Ibaaha awo ñnyịn ndomokeed me ibaan ndọọdọ ñnyịn me nditọ ideen ñnyịn me nditọ ibaan ñnyịn akenaanam anwọññọ ukọd akpa <verse eid="JER 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9" />me abọp ufọk adidʌñ ke esịd me anie inwañ fain, me ikọd me mfịd. <verse eid="JER 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10" />Ñnyịn imaidʌñ ke mme atayad inyʌñ ikpono afịd se eteete ñnyịn Yehonadab akitemme ñnyịn. <verse eid="JER 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11" />Ado idaha a-Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn akekannake abio ami akʌk, ñnyịn imaibo ite, ‘Idi, ana ñnyịn ika Yeruselem nọ ibọkkọ mbon ekọñ Babilọn ye Aram.’ Ke ntoro ñnyịn imisʌhọ ke Yeruselem.”<verse eid="JER 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 35:12" />Akem ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya ate: <verse eid="JER 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 35:13" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Kaa ke dọkkọ mbon Yuda ye mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem, ‘Nte ndufo idiikpeebe ñkpọ inyʌñ ikop ikọ mmi?’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="JER 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14" />‘Yehonadab ayịn Rekab amaawuuk mbon ubon amọ ate ke enwọñ ukọd ndin ammọ emaenịm ewʌhọ ami. Tutu usen mfịn ami ammọ inwọññọ ukọd, sia ammọ enịm item mme eteete ammọ. Ado ami mmetañ ikọ ye ndufo uwak-uwak ini, ado ndufo ikoppo item mmi. <verse eid="JER 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15" />Ke ini ke ini ami mmaadọñ mme isʌñutom mmi, mme prọfed mmi inọ ndufo. Ammọ emaibo, “Ndufo keedekeed ana ewọññọ ekpọñ mme usʌñ ibak ndufo enyʌñ ediọñ mme adinam ndufo; ikiikeene mme abasi mfen adinam ñkpọ nnọọ ammọ. Ndin ndufo eyaedʌñ ke isọñ a-ami inọọhọ ndufo ye mme eteete ndufo.” Ado ndufo ikpañña utọñ innọ miin inyʌññọ ikop uyio mmi. <verse eid="JER 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16" />Mbon ubon Yehonadab ayịn Rekab enam ewʌhọ a-mme eteete ammọ ekenọọhọ, ado ibon ami ikoppo item mmi.’<verse eid="JER 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17" />“Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: ‘Ikpañ utọñ! Ami ñyaaben afịd afanekọñ se ñkenwọñọ mbaña ammọ ndot Yuda ke idem ye afịd mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem. Ami mmaatañ ikọ nnọ ammọ, ado ammọ ikikoppo uyio mmi; ami mmaakoot ammọ, ado ammọ ikibọọrọke.’ ”<verse eid="JER 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18" />Akem Yerimaiya amaabo ufọk Rekab ate, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: ‘Ndufo emaenịm ewʌhọ mme eteete ndufo Yehonadab, enyʌñ ekeene afịd mme item amọ, enyʌñ enam afịd se anye akewuuk.’ <verse eid="JER 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel atañ ado ami: ‘Yehonadab ayịn Rekab idiitreke adinie awo se inam ñkpọ innọọ miin.’ ”<verse eid="JER 35:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36" />
  <para style="s1">Yehoiyakịm Afọp Ikpañwed Yerimaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua inaañ Yehoiyakịm ayịn Yosaiya adidem Yuda, ikọ ami amaato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adisịm Yerimaiya: <verse eid="JER 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2" />“Ben ikpañwed nyʌñ wet afịd mme ikọ se ami ntañ unọọ fiin mbaña Isrel, Yuda ye afịd mme idịd mbon ako tọọñọ ke idaha a-ami ñketọọñọke aditañ ikọ unọọ fiin ke ini ukara Yosaiya tutu idahami. <verse eid="JER 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3" />Akemeido mbon Yuda emaekop afịd nsobo a-ami nduakka adinam ammọ, ammọ keedekeed eyaesịññe idem ekpọñ mme usʌñ ibak ammọ; ndin ami ñyaafeen mme ibak ammọ ye idiọọkñkpọ ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4" />Akem Yerimaiya amaakoot Baruk ayịn Neria, ndin ke idaha Yerimaiya akesʌkkọ akoot afịd mme ikọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ anọ anye, Baruk amaawet ammọ ke ikpañwed. <verse eid="JER 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5" />Akem Yerimaiya amaadọkkọ Baruk ate, “Awo iyakka ami ñka afịd itie se ñyem; awo iyakka ami ñka tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JER 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6" />Ke ntoro afo dʌk kaa ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke usen utreudia nyʌñ koot mme ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> se afo akewet ke ikpañwed ado naña ami ñketañ unọọ fiin nọ atu awo. Koot anye nọ afịd mbon Yuda e-etooho mme abio ammọ edi. <verse eid="JER 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7" />Akemeido ammọ eyaeben ebeeñe ammọ edi iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ esịññe idem ekpọñ mme usʌñ ibak ammọ, sia iyadesịd ye ifiobesịd <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọke abaña idịd ami akpon.”<verse eid="JER 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8" />Baruk ayịn Neria amaanam afịd ñkpọ naña prọfed Yerimaiya aketemme anye abo anam; ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anye amaakoot mme ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ato ikpañwed. <verse eid="JER 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9" />Ke ayọhọ afiọñ usʌkkeed ke ayọhọ isua ukara ition ake Yehoiyakịm ayịn Yosaiya adidem Yuda, emaesian ini utreudia ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enọ afịd mbon awo ke Yeruselem ye mbon se ikito mme abio Yuda idi. <verse eid="JER 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10" />Tọọñọ ke ubeed Kemaria ayịn Safan awedñwed, a-akebaaha ke ubeed anyọñ ke ntondʌk Ufa Inuaatob tembịd, Baruk amaakoot mme ikọ Yerimaiya ato ikpañwed anọ afịd awo ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11" />Ke ini Maikaiya ayịn Kemaria, ayịn Safan, akekoppo afịd mme ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> se ikito ikpañwed, <verse eid="JER 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12" />anye amaanam isañ akaa ke ubeed awedñwed ufọkadidem, a-afịd mme adaaha ekebonoke: Elisama awedñwed, Delaiya ayịn Semaiya, Elnatan ayịn Akbọ, Kemaria ayịn Safan, Sedekaiya ayịn Hananaiya, ye afịd ikpọ mme adaaha mfen. <verse eid="JER 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13" />Ke Maikaiya amaakedọkkọ ammọ afịd ñkpọ se anye akekop naña Baruk akekoot ke ikpañwed anọ afịd awo, <verse eid="JER 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14" />afịd mme adaaha emaedọñ Yehudi ayịn Netania, ayịn Selemia, ayịn Kuusi, akedọkkọ Baruk abo, “Ben ikpañwed a-afo akekamake akoot anọọ mbon awo di.” Ndin Baruk ayịn Neria amaakaa abịne ammọ ye ikpañwed ke ubọk. <verse eid="JER 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15" />Ammọ emaebo anye ete, “Mbọk, suuk tie, nyʌñ koot anye inọ ñnyịn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 36:15">Ndin Baruk amaakoot anye anọ ammọ. <verse eid="JER 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16" />Ke ammọ emaekekop afịd mme ikọ ami, ammọ emaese emọ-emọ ye ndịk enyʌñ ebo Baruk ete, “Ana ñnyịn itañ afịd mme ikọ ami inọ adidem.” <verse eid="JER 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17" />Akem ammọ emaebịp Baruk ete, “Idọkkọ ñnyịn, afo akesaña die awet afịd mme ikọ ami? Ado Yerimaiya akekoot unọọ?”<verse eid="JER 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18" />Baruk amaabọọrọ ate, “Ii, anye akekoot afịd mme ikọ ami annọọ miin, ndin ami mmaawet ammọ ke mmọọññwed ke ikpañwed.”<verse eid="JER 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19" />Akem mme adaaha emaebo Baruk ete, “Afo ye Yerimaiya ikaa ikidịbe. Ikiiyak awo ndomokeed adiọọñọ nte ndufo eba.”<verse eid="JER 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20" />Ke ammọ emaekesịn ikpañwed ado ke ubeed Elisama awedñwed, ammọ emaekaa ebịne adidem ke akwere amọ enyʌñ ekedọkkọ anye afịd ñkpọ. <verse eid="JER 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21" />Adidem amaadọñ Yehudi akeben ikpañwed ado adi, ndin Yehudi amaakeben ikpañwed ke ubeed Elisama awedñwed anyʌñ akoot anye anọ adidem ye afịd mme adaaha ekedaaha ke ñkañ amọ. <verse eid="JER 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22" />Akedo ke ayọhọ afiọñ usʌkkeed ndin adidem aketie ke ubeed atueb, ndin ikañ akesʌk asak ke ebʌkikañ ke iso amọ. <verse eid="JER 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23" />Idaha akeedodo a-Yehudi akekoodo ñkpọ nte udịm ita me inaañ ke ikpañwed ami, adidem amaakama ikwa awedñwed akpịkke ammọ anyʌñ atop ammọ adọñ ke ebʌkikañ, tutu afịd ikpañwed ado asak ke ikañ. <verse eid="JER 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24" />Adidem ye afịd mbon utom amọ se ikikop mme ikọ ami ikikoppo ndịk ndomokeed, ammọ ikinyʌññọ iwai afọñ ammọ. <verse eid="JER 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25" />Akpesʌkado Elnatan, Delaiya ye Kemaria emaekpeiye adidem ete anye akuufọp ikpañwed ami, anye ikikpañña utọñ inọ ammọ. <verse eid="JER 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26" />Utu ke ado, adidem amaanọ Yerameel, ayịn adidem, Seraiya ayịn Asriel ye Selemia ayịn Abdeel uyio ate emʌm Baruk awedñwed ye prọfed Yerimaiya. Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadịp ammọ.<verse eid="JER 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27" />Ke adidem amaakefọp ikpañwed akedọñọke mme ikọ se Baruk akewet akeene se Yerimaiya akekoot anọ anye, ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya: <verse eid="JER 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28" />“Ben ikpañwed mfen nyʌñ ñwet afịd mme ikọ se ikidọñọ ke akpa ikpañwed, a-Yehoiyakịm adidem Yuda akefọppọ. <verse eid="JER 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29" />Ñko dọkkọ Yehoiyakịm adidem Yuda ate, ‘Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ: Afo amaafọp ikpañwed ado anyʌñ abo, “Ntak afo akewette abo ke adidem Babilọn ayaadi adisobo isọñ ami anyʌñ aben mme awo ye unam ikọd afep-e?” <verse eid="JER 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ abaña Yehoiyakịm adidem Yuda ado ami: Anye idiinieghe awo ndomokeed se idiitie ke ebekpo ubọọñ Defid; eyaetop akpo amọ eduọọk enyʌñ enịm anye anwa-anwa nọ ayio amia ke uweemeayio ye ndedeñ ñko ke akonayio. <verse eid="JER 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31" />Ami ñyaamia anye ye nditọ amọ ye nditọufọk amọ ufen ke ntak ibak ammọ; ami ñyaaben ndot ammọ ye afịd mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem ye mbon Yuda afịd nsobo a-ami ñkenwọñọke adinam ammọ, sia ammọ ikpañña utọñ innọ miin.’ ”<verse eid="JER 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32" />Ndin Yerimaiya amaaben ikpañwed mfen anọ Baruk awedñwed ayịn Neria, ndin naña Yerimaiya aketañ, Baruk amaawet afịd mme ikọ se ekewet ke ikpañwed a-Yehoiyakịm adidem Yuda akefọppọ ke ikañ. Emaenyʌñ edian mme uwak mbid ikọ ntoro ke ñwed ado.<verse eid="JER 36:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37" />
  <para style="s1">Yerimaiya ke Ufọkñkpakọb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1" />Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn amaanam Sedekaiya ayịn Yosaiya adidem ke Yuda; anye akekara ke itie Yehoiyakịn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Konia</char><char style="ft" closed="false">asʌk ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yehoiyakịn</char></note> ayịn Yehoiyakịm. <verse eid="JER 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2" />Anye, me mbon utom amọ, me awo ndomokeed ke isọñ abio ikinọọhọ ñkpañutọñ ke mme ikọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ ato inua prọfed Yerimaiya.<verse eid="JER 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3" />Ado Adidem Sedekaiya amaadọñ Yehukal ayịn Selemia ye aku Sefanaiya ayịn Maaseiya utom anọ prọfed Yerimaiya ye etob ami: “Mbọk bọñ akam nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn inọ ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JER 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4" />Ke ini ntom Yerimaiya amaanie unen adisaaña ke atu awo, sia awo ikisịnne anye diin ke ufọk ñkpakọb. <verse eid="JER 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5" />Udịmekọñ Fero emaesaña ewuọ ke Iyib, ndin ke ini mbon Babilọn e-ekekannake Yeruselem ekʌk ekekoppo etob ebaña ammọ, ammọ emaewuọñọ ke Yeruselem.<verse eid="JER 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6" />Akem ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm prọfed Yerimaiya: <verse eid="JER 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7" />“Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañ: Dọkkọ adidem Yuda, a-akudọññọ fiin abo adibịp ñkpọ anto miin ate, ‘Udịmekọñ Fero e-ekesañake ewuọñọ edi adunwam fiin eyaetịmme enyọñọ isọñ ammọ ke Iyib. <verse eid="JER 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8" />Ndin mbon Babilọn eyaetịmme edi edinwana abio ami; ammọ eyaekan anye enyʌñ efọp anye enịm ke isọñ.’<verse eid="JER 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9" />“Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ: Ikiibiaña idem ndufo, ikere ibo, ‘Ke akpanikọ mbon Babilọn eyaikpọñ ñnyịn.’ Ammọ idiikpọññọ! <verse eid="JER 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10" />Akpekọm ndufo ekpaekan afịd udịmekọñ mbon Babilọn e-ediighe edinwana ndufo ndin ado ideen se idat unan ikpọọñ esʌhọ ke atayad ammọ, ammọ eyaewuọ edifọp abio ami enịm ke isọñ.”<verse eid="JER 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11" />Ke ini mbon ekọñ Babilọn emaekewuọñọ ke Yeruselem ato ke ntak mbon ekọñ Fero, <verse eid="JER 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12" />Yerimaiya amaatọọñọ adiwuọ ke abio Yeruselem ñkaa edem ukañ Benyamin adibọ udeeme ñkpọ amọ do. <verse eid="JER 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13" />Ado ke anye amaakewuọ Inuaatob Benyamin, adaiwuod ukpeme, a-anyịñ amọ akedooho Iriya ayịn Selemia, ayịn Hananaiya, amaamʌm prọfed Yerimaiya abo, “Afo ayem adifeghe ñkaa ukañ mbon Babilọn!”<verse eid="JER 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14" />Yerimaiya amaabo ate, “Idooho ntoro! Ami mfegheke ñkpọñ mi mbịne mbon Babilọn.” Ado Iriya ikikpañña utọñ inọ anye; utu ke ado anye amaamʌm Yerimaiya anyʌñ aben anye asọk mme adaaha. <verse eid="JER 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15" />Mme adaaha emaeyat esịd ye Yerimaiya enyʌñ enam emia anye enyʌñ esịn anye ke ñkpakọb ke ufọk Yọnatan awedñwed, a-ammọ ekekappake enịm nte ufọk ñkpakọb.<verse eid="JER 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16" />Ekesịn Yerimaiya ke ebuka ñkpakọb ke ubeed esịdisọñ, ndin anye amaaba do ke anyan ini. <verse eid="JER 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17" />Akem adidem Sedekaiya amaadọñ ekekoot anye anyʌñ aben anye adi ufọk ubọọñ, do ke akebịp anye ke ndịbe ate, “Nte aba ikọ se ito <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 37:17">Yerimaiya amaabọọrọ ate, “Ii, eyauyaak fiin esịn ke ubọk adidem Babilọn”<verse eid="JER 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18" />Akem Yerimaiya amaabo adidem Sedekaiya ate, “Nsoo idiọọk ke ami unam fiin me mbon utom mfo, me idịd ami, nọ afo ansịn miin ke ufọk ñkpakọb? <verse eid="JER 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19" />Mmọ mme prọfed mfo e-eketañña prọfesi unọọ fiin ebo, ‘Adidem Babilọn idiinwanake ye afo me ye isọñ ami’? <verse eid="JER 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20" />Ado idahami, abọọñ mmi ye adidem mmi, mbọk kop. Yak ami mben ñkpeubọk mmi ndi iso mfo: Kuumaana unnọọ miin ñka ufọk Yọnatan awedñwed, imiidooho ntoro ami ñyaakekpa do.”<verse eid="JER 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21" />Akem Adidem Sedekaiya amaanọ uyio ate enịm Yerimaiya ke akwere itie mbon ukpeme enyʌñ enọ anye idem uyo keed ke usen ke usen ato itie mbon unam uyo ke efaak tutu afịd uyo ke abio akweeñe. Ndin Yerimaiya amaakaa iso aba ke akwere itie mbon ukpeme.<verse eid="JER 37:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38" />
  <para style="s1">Etop Yerimaiya Esịn ke Ube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1" />Sefatia ayịn Matan, Kedalia ayịn Pasọ, Yehukal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yukal</char><char style="ft" closed="false">asʌk ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yehukal</char></note> ayịn Selemia, ye Pasọ ayịn Malkiya emaekop se Yerimaiya akedọkkọ afịd mbon awo idaha anye akebooho ate, <verse eid="JER 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2" />“Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ: ‘Awo akeedodo a-abaaha ke abio ami adiikpa ke akañkañ, akañ me udọñọ nsobo, ado awo akeedodo a-akaaha Babilọn ayaadu uwem. Ammọ eyaebọkkọ ye uwem; ammọ eyaedu uwem.’ <verse eid="JER 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3" />Ndin ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ: ‘Ke akpanikọ eyaeyaak abio esịn mbon ekọñ adidem Babilọn ke ubọk, a-adiidat anye inie.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4" />Akem mme adaaha emaebo adidem ete, “Akpena ewot awo ami. Anye asịn mbon ekọñ se isʌhọ ke abio ye afịd mbon awo mmemidem, akeene mme ikọ se anye atañ anọ ammọ. Awo ami iyemme ufọn ammọ ado ayem iduọ ammọ.”<verse eid="JER 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5" />Adidem Sedekaiya amaabọọrọ ate, “Anye isịne ndufo ke ubọk, adidem ikemeke adinam ñkpọ ndomokeed adibiọọñọ ndufo.”<verse eid="JER 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6" />Ndin ammọ emaemʌm Yerimaiya esịn ke ube mmọọñ Malkiya, ayịn adidem, a-akebaaha ke akwere itie mbon ukpeme. Ammọ emaekama udʌk esuuk Yerimaiya esịn ke ube ami; mmọọñ ikisịneke, akedo akpʌk ikpọọñ, ndin Yerimaiya amaabʌhọ ke akpʌk ado.<verse eid="JER 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7" />Ado Ebed-Melek, awo Kuus, adaaha ke ufọkubọọñ adidem, amaakop ke emaesuuk Yerimaiya esịn ke ube mmọọñ. Ke ini adidem asʌkkọ atie ke Inuaatob Benyamin, <verse eid="JER 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8" />Ebed-Melek amaawuọ akedọkkọ adidem ate, <verse eid="JER 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmi adidem, ibon ami enam ibak ke afịd se ammọ enam ye prọfed Yerimaiya. Ammọ etop anye esịn ke ube mmọọñ, itie se abiọọñ adiiwot anye ke idaha uyo imiibaaha aba mi ke abio.”<verse eid="JER 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10" />Akem adidem amaanọ Ebed-Melek awo Kuus uyio ate, “Ben ideen edịb mme duob mi kaa ke dʌt prọfed Yerimaiya sio ke ube mmọọñ mbemiso anye akpa.”<verse eid="JER 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11" />Ndin Ebed-Melek amaaben mme ideen ami anyʌñ akaa ke ubeed ukañ idak itie unịm akʌk ke ufọkadidem. Anye amaaben ñkaan ntaaha afọñ ye afọñ emaekewaiya anyʌñ akama udʌk ayaak ammọ asuuk anọ Yerimaiya ke ube mmọọñ ado. <verse eid="JER 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12" />Ebed-Melek awo Kuus amaabo Yerimaiya ate, “Sịn ñkaan ntaha afọñ ami ye ñwaiya afọñ ke idak ñkpafaha mfo adimʌm udʌk ami ñkama.” Yerimaiya amaanam ntoro, <verse eid="JER 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13" />ndin ammọ emaedʌt anye ye mme udʌk ami enyʌñ edịppe anye esio ke ube mmọọñ. Ndin Yerimaiya amaaba do ke akwere mbon ukpeme.<verse eid="JER 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sedekaiya Amaana Abịp Yerimaiya Mbuume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14" />Akem Adidem Sedekaiya amaadọñ ekekoot prọfed Yerimaiya anyʌñ anam eben anye edi ayọhọ inuausʌñ ita ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Adidem amaabo Yerimaiya ate, “Ami ñyaubịp fiin ñkpọ, kundịp miin ñkpọ ndomokeed.”<verse eid="JER 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15" />Yerimaiya amaabo Sedekaiya ate, “Adieke ami unọọhọ fiin ibọọrọ, nte afo uduñwotto miin? Adieke ami ñkpekunọọhọ fiin item, afo ukpukukpañña utọñ unnọ miin.”<verse eid="JER 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16" />Ado Adidem Sedekaiya amaanam enwọñọ ami anọ Yerimaiya ke ndịbe ate: “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem, anye inọọhọ ñnyịn ibifịk uwem, ami nduuwotto fiin, ndiinyʌññọ uyaak fiin nnọ mbom eyemme aduwot fiin.”<verse eid="JER 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17" />Akem Yerimaiya amaabo Sedekaiya ate, “Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel atañ: ‘Adieke afo ayaaha idem anọọ mme adaaha adidem Babilọn, eyaesʌhọ uwem mfo ndin awo idiifọppọ abio ami; afo ye ufọk mfo eyaedu uwem. <verse eid="JER 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18" />Ado adieke afo umuuyaaha idem unọ mme adaaha adidem Babilọn, eyaeyaak abio ami esịn ke ubọk mbon Babilọn, ndin ammọ eyaefọp anye enịm ke isọñ; afo ke idem mfo uduubọkkọke ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19" />Adidem Sedekaiya amaabo Yerimaiya ate, “Ndịk annam miin abaña mme Yuu emaekekaa ebịne mbon Babilọn, sia mbon Babilọn ekeme ediñyaak miin nsịn ammọ ke ubọk ndin ammọ eyaemfiomo miin.”<verse eid="JER 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20" />Yerimaiya amaabọọrọ anye ate, “ammọ iduuyaaka fiin inọ, kop uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke adinam se ami ntañ unọọ fiin. Ndin ayaafọn ye afo, ndin eyaenyaaña uwem mfo. <verse eid="JER 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21" />Ado adieke afo atreke adiyaak idem mfo nnọọ, se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaara annọ miin, <verse eid="JER 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22" />eyaeben afịd ibaan se isʌhọ ke ufọkubọọñ adidem Yuda enọ mme adaaha adidem Babilọn. Ibaan ado eyaubo fiin ete:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">“ ‘Ammọ emautịn fiin usʌñ enyʌñ ukan fiin ubọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">mme nta ufan mfo ado.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">Ukod mfo abʌhọ ke akpʌk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">mme ufan mfo efeeñe ukpọñ fiin.’<verse eid="JER 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23" />“Eyaekoono afịd ibaan mfo ye nditọ mfo enọ mbon Babilọn. Afo ke idem mfo uduubọkkọke ke ubọk ammọ, ado adidem Babilọn ayaumʌm fiin; ndin eyaefọp abio ami enịm ke isọñ.”<verse eid="JER 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24" />Akem Sedekaiya amaabo Yerimaiya ate, “Kuuyak awo ndomokeed adiọọñọ abaña nneme ami, imiidooho ntoro afo ayaakpa. <verse eid="JER 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25" />Adieke mme adaaha ukara ekoppo ke ami mmaatañ ikọ ye afo, ndin ammọ edi ubịne fiin edibo ete, ‘Idọkkọ ñnyịn se afo aketañ anọọ adidem ye se adidem aketañ unọọ fiin; kuudịp ñnyịn, imiidooho ntoro ñnyịn iyauwot fiin,’ <verse eid="JER 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26" />dọkkọ ammọ bo, ‘ami ñkesʌk ñkpeiye adidem mbo ke anye amaana annọọ miin ñka ufọk Yọnatan nọ ñkekpa do.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27" />Afịd mme adaaha ukara emaedi ebịne Yerimaiya enyʌñ ebịp anye, ndin anye amaadọkkọ ammọ afịd se adidem akewuuk anye abo atañ. Ndin ammọ ikitañña ikọ mfen aba ye anye, sia awo ndomokeed ikikoppo nneme amọ ye adidem.<verse eid="JER 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28" />Ndin Yerimaiya amaaba ke akwere itie mbon ukpeme tutu usen e-ekedikanna Yeruselem.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JER 38:28">Iduọ Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 38:28">Naña ekemʌm Yeruselem ado ami:<verse eid="JER 38:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua usʌkkeed ke ukara Sedekaiya adidem Yuda, ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob, Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn amaanam isañekọñ akaa Yeruselem ye afịd udịmekọñ amọ anyʌñ anam nnaaekọñ akanna Yeruselem akʌk. <verse eid="JER 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2" />Ndin ke ayọhọ usen usʌkkeed ke ayọhọ afiọñ inaañ ke isua duob mme keed ke ukara Sedekaiya, ndibene abio amaaduọ. <verse eid="JER 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3" />Akem afịd mme adaaha ukara adidem Babilọn emaedidat itie ke Ufọọd Inuaatob: Nekal-Saresa a-atooho Samka, Nebo-Sasekịm ataa ekamba etubom ekọñ, Nekal-Saresa ataa ekamba adaaha ye afịd mme adaaha adidem Babilọn mfen. <verse eid="JER 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4" />Idaha Sedekaiya adidem Yuda ye afịd mbon ekọñ ekekịtte ammọ, ammọ emaefeeñe. Ammọ ekesaña ke usʌñ inwañ adidem ewuọ ekpọñ abio akonayio, esaña ke inuaatob ke ufọọd ndibene iba, enyʌñ ekaa ke usʌñ ukañ Araba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abedeñ Yọdan</char></note>.<verse eid="JER 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5" />Ado udịmekọñ Babilọn emaebịne ammọ enyʌñ ekesịme Sedekaiya ke unaisọñ Yeriko. Ammọ emaemʌm anye eben esọk Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn ke Ribla ke isọñ Hamad, ndin do ke anye akebiide ikpe anọ anye. <verse eid="JER 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6" />Do ke Ribla adidem Babilọn amaawot nditọ ideen Sedekaiya ke iso amọ anyʌñ awoot afịd mme adaaha ke Yuda. <verse eid="JER 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7" />Ndin anye amaakaap Sedekaiya anyen asịññe anyʌñ abọp anye ke ñkpọnọ brọns adiben anye ñnyọñ Babilọn.<verse eid="JER 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8" />Mbon Babilọn emaesịn ikañ ke ufọk adidem ye ke mme ufọk mbon awo enyʌñ ewuut ndibene Yeruselem. <verse eid="JER 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9" />Nebusaradan, asaña-asaña adaiso ekọñ adidem, amaakoono mbon e-ekesʌhọke ke abio akaa Babilọn, dian ye mbon se ikikaa ibịne anye, ye mbon awo se ikisʌhọ. <verse eid="JER 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10" />Ado Nebusaradan adaiso ekọñ amaasʌhọ usʌk mbon uweene ke isọñ Yuda, i-imiikinieghe ñkpọ ndomokeed; ndin ke ini ado anye amaanọ ammọ inwañ fain ye mme ikọd.<verse eid="JER 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11" />Idaha ntoro Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn amaanọ ewʌhọ ami abaña Yerimaiya ato inua Nebusaradan adaiso ekọñ adidem: <verse eid="JER 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12" />“Ben anye nyʌñ se ñkpọ baña anye; kuunam anye ibak ado nam nọ anye se adodo a-anye ayemme.” <verse eid="JER 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 39:13" />Ndin Nebusaradan adaiso ekọñ adidem, Nebusaban ataa ekamba adaaha ukara, Nekal-Saresa ekamba adaaha ukara ye afịd mme adaaha adidem Babilọn mfen <verse eid="JER 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 39:14" />emaekaa ekesio Yerimaiya ke itie akwere mbon ukpeme. Ammọ emaeyaak anye enọ Kedalia ayịn Ahikam, ayịn Safan, adiben anye ntịmme ñnyọñ ufọk amọ. Ke ntoro anye akeba ye mbon amọ.<verse eid="JER 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15" />Ke idaha Yerimaiya akebaaha ke akwere itie mbon ukpeme, ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm anye: <verse eid="JER 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16" />“Kaa kedọkkọ Ebed-Melek awo Kuus bo, ‘Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ: Ami ñyaadinam ikọ mmi asu abaña abio ami, mme ikọ e-ebañake nsobo, idooho uforo. Ke ini ado ammọ eyaewuọ esu ke anyen mfo. <verse eid="JER 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17" />Ado ami ñyaunyaaña fiin ke usen ado, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atommo; awo iduuyaaha fiin isịn ke ubọk mbon se afo abaak. <verse eid="JER 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18" />Ami ñyaunyaaña fiin; afo uduuduọhọ ke akañkañ ado ayaabọkkọ ye uwem mfo, sia afo amebuọt idem ye ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atommo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 39:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40" />
  <para style="s1">Esaana Yerimaiya Eyaak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya ke ini Nebusaradan adaiso ekọñ adidem amaakesaana anye ayaak ke Rama. Anye amaakịt naña edọñ Yerimaiya ñkpọnọ ukwak etem ke atu afịd mme ifʌn se ekemʌm ke Yeruselem ye Yuda e-ekebenne enyọñ Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2" />Idaha a-adaiso ekọñ akekịtte Yerimaiya, anye amaabo anye ate, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo akebiide nsobo ami anọ itie ami. <verse eid="JER 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3" />Ndin idahami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam nọ anye awuọ asu; anye anam naña anye akeduak adinam. Afịd ñkpọ ami eketịppe sia ndufo emaenam idiọọkñkpọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ikinyʌññọ ikop uyio amọ. <verse eid="JER 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4" />Ado mfịn ami mmutat fiin ñkpọnọ nsio ke itọñubọk. Ñkeene miin kaa Babilọn, adieke afo amaaha, ndin ami ñyaase ñkpọ ubaña fiin; ado adieke afo umuumaaha, kuudi. Se, afịd abio una fiin ke iso; amenie unen adika nte afo amama.” <verse eid="JER 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5" />Kpayeado, mbemiso Yerimaiya akanna anekke iso adidakka ñnyọñ, Nebusaradan amaadian abo, “Tịmme bịne Kedalia ayịn Ahikam, ayịn Safan, a-adidem Babilọn akemekke abo ase ñkpọ abaña mme abio Yuda, nyʌñ dʌñ ye anye ke atu ammọ, imiidooho kaa itie nte afo amama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 40:5">Akema etubom ekọñ amaanọ anye mme ñkpọ ndidia adian enọ mfen anyʌñ asaana anye ayaak nọ anyọñ. <verse eid="JER 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6" />Ndin Yerimaiya amaakaa abịne Kedalia ayịn Ahikam ke Mispa anyʌñ akeba do ye anye ye mbon awo se ekeyaak esʌhọ ke isọñ ado.<verse eid="JER 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewot Kedalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7" />Ke idaha a-afịd mme etubom ekọñ ye mbon ekọñ ammọ e-ekesʌkkọ eba ke anwa abio ekekoppo ke adidem Babilọn amaamek Kedalia ayịn Ahikam nte adaukara ke idʌñ ndin ke amaanyʌñ anọ anye unen ke iwuod afịd ideen, ibaan ye ntəkayịn, kpa mbon ekedooho mme akpọikpọi uweene ke abio, a-adooho awo ikikoonoke nte ifʌn ika asenidịd ke Babilọn, <verse eid="JER 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8" />Ismeel ayịn Netania, Yohanan ye Yọnatan nditọ ideen Kare, Seraiya ayịn Tanumed, nditọ ideen Efai awo Netofa, ye Yaasania<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yesania</char><char style="ft" closed="false">asʌk ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yaasania.</char></note> ayịn Maakad, ye mme ideen ammọ, emaekaa ebịne Kedalia ke Mispa. <verse eid="JER 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9" />Kedalia ayịn Ahikam, ayịn Safan, amaadat unwọñọ adisọọñọ ammọ ye ideen ammọ idem. Anye amaabo ammọ, “Ikiikop ndịk adinam ñkpọ nnọọ mbon Babilọn. Isuuk ibono ke isọñ inyʌñ inam ñkpọ inọ adidem Babilọn, ndin ayaafọn ye ndufo. <verse eid="JER 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10" />Ami ke idem mmi ndiiba ke Mispa adida ke iwuod ndufo ke iso mbon Babilọn ediighe ibịne ñnyịn, ado ana nte ndufo eben ukọd, mfịd ndaayio ye adan ọlif, enyʌñ edọñ ammọ ke abañ unịm ñkpọ ndufo, enyʌñ edʌñ ke isọñ a-ndufo edatta enie.”<verse eid="JER 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11" />Ndin ke ini afịd mme Yuu ke Mọb, Amọn, Edọm ye afịd mme idịd mfen emaekekop ke adidem Babilọn amaanịm nsʌhọ ke Yuda ndin ke amaanyʌñ amek Kedalia ayịn Ahikam, ayịn Safan, nte andikara afịd ammọ, <verse eid="JER 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12" />afịd ammọ emaeto edi isọñ Yuda, edi ebịne Kedalia ke Mispa, eto ke afịd mme idịd se ekesuan ammọ. Ndin ammọ emaenie ataa uwak ukọd ye mfịd inwañ ndaayio.<verse eid="JER 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13" />Yohanan ayịn Kare ye afịd mme adaaha ekọñ ekesʌkkọ ebaba ke anwa abio emaedi ebịne Kedalia ke Mispa <verse eid="JER 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14" />enyʌñ ekebo anye ete, “Ado nte afo udiọọñọke ke Baalis adidem mbon Amọn adọñ Ismeel ayịn Netania abo aduwot fiin?” Ado Kedalia ayịn Ahikam ikinịmme ammọ ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="JER 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15" />Akem Yohanan ayịn Kare amaatañ ke ndedịbe anọ Kedalia ke Mispa ate, “Yak ami ñka ñkewot Ismeel ayịn Netania, ndin ibaaha awo ndomokeed se idiidiọọñọ. Nsoo inam nọ anye ayem aduwot fiin anyʌñ anam nọ afịd mme Yuu e-ebaaha ukanna fiin esuana ndin nọ mme nsʌhọ ufọk Yuda etak?”<verse eid="JER 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16" />Ado Kedalia ayịn Ahikam amaabo Yohanan ayịn Kare ate, “Kuunam uto ñkpọ ado! Se afo atañ abaña Ismeel idooho akpanikọ.”<verse eid="JER 40:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 41:1" />Ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba, Ismeel ayịn Netania, ayịn Elisama, a-aketooho ubon ubọọñ, akenyʌññọ ado keed ke atu mme adaaha adidem, amaasaña ye ideen duob adibịne Kedalia ayịn Ahikam ke Mispa. Ke idaha ammọ esʌkkọ etie keed edia ñkpọ, <verse eid="JER 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 41:2" />Ismeel ayịn Netania ye ideen duob e-ekebaaha ye anye emaedakka eda ewot Kedalia ayịn Ahikam, ayịn Safan, ke akañkañ, ewot anye a-adidem Babilọn akemekke nte adaiwuod ukara ke abio ado. <verse eid="JER 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3" />Ismeel amaanyʌñ awot afịd ideen ke Yuda e-ekebaaha ye Kedalia ke Mispa, ukem ñko ye mbon ekọñ Babilọn e-ekebaaha do.<verse eid="JER 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 41:4" />Usen e-ekewotto Kedalia akeboiyo, mbemiso awo ndomokeed adidiọọñọ abaña ñkpọ ami, <verse eid="JER 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 41:5" />ideen anaañ e-emaekekwaat ñwaebek ammọ, ewai afọñ ammọ enyʌñ ekpii idem ammọ emaeto Sekem, Silo ye Sameria edi, eben mme enọ mfịd inwañ ye insensi edi ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JER 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6" />Ismeel ayịn Netania amaato Mispa awuọ akesoobo ammọ, asʌk atua naña anye akesañake aka. Ke anye amaakesoobo ammọ, anye amaabo ate, “Idi ibịne Kedalia ayịn awodeen Ahikam.” <verse eid="JER 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7" />Ke ini ammọ emaekedọọk ediwuọ abio, Ismeel ayịn Netania ye mme ideen e-ekebaaha ye anye emaemʌm ammọ eyọọk ewot enyʌñ etoomo ammọ edọñ ke ube mmọọñ. <verse eid="JER 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8" />Ado awo duob ke atu ammọ emaebo Ismeel ete, “Kuuwot ñnyịn! Ñnyịn iminie wiid ye baali, adan ọlif ye adanakwọọk, e-edịppe ke inwañ.” Ndin anye amaayaak ammọ inyʌññọ iwot ammọ ye mbon ako. <verse eid="JER 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9" />Ube mmọọñ a-anye aketoomoke afịd mme akpo awo se anye akewot adọñ akọrọ ye akpo Kedalia akedo anye a-adidem Asa aketịppeke nte ñkpọ ukpeme amọ ke abaña Baasa adidem Isrel. Ismeel ayịn Netania amaadọñ akpo awo ayọhọ ube ado.<verse eid="JER 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10" />Ismeel amaamʌm afịd mbon awo se ikisʌhọ ke Mispa asịn ke ufʌn, nditọ ibaan adidem dian ye afịd mbon mfen se ikisʌhọ do, a-Nebusaradan adaiso ekọñ adidem akemekke Kedalia ayịn Ahikam nte andikara. Ismeel ayịn Netania amaamuum ammọ nte ifʌn anyʌñ anam isañ adiboiyo ñkaa ukañ mbon Amọn.<verse eid="JER 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11" />Ado ke ini Yohanan ayịn Kare ye afịd mme adaaha ekọñ e-ekebaaha ye anye ekekoppo ebaña afịd mme ibak se Ismeel ayịn Netania akenam, <verse eid="JER 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12" />ammọ emaeben afịd mme ideen ammọ ekaa adinwana ye Ismeel ayịn Netania. Ammọ emaesoobo ye anye ke ñkpere ekamba ñkpọdiọhọ mmọọñ ke Kibiọn. <verse eid="JER 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 41:13" />Ke idaha a-afịd mme awo ake Ismeel akekoonoke ekekịtte Yohanan ayịn Kare ye mme adaaha ekọñ e-ekebaaha ye anye, ammọ emaenem esịd. <verse eid="JER 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 41:14" />Afịd mme awo se Ismeel akemuum nte ifʌn ke Mispa emaekappa ekeene Yohanan ayịn Kare. <verse eid="JER 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15" />Ado Ismeel ayịn Netania ye ideen amọ awo itiaita emaebọkkọ Yohanan efeeñe ekaa ukañ mbon Amọn.<verse eid="JER 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ufeghe Ñkaa Iyib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16" />Akem Yohanan ayịn Kare ye afịd mme adaaha ekọñ e-ekebaaha ye anye emaedat afịd awo se ikisʌhọ ke Mispa usʌñ etịmme enyọñọ, mbon se Yohanan akenyaaña asio ke ubọk Ismeel ayịn Netania ke ini Ismeel amaakewot Kedalia ayịn Ahikam, mbon ekọñ, ibaan, ntəkayịn ye mbon esob a-anye akebọiyọ ato Kibiọn. <verse eid="JER 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 41:17" />Ndin ammọ emaeka iso esaña, eduọk adudu ke Kerud Kimham a-akpereke Betlehem ke usʌñ a-ammọ ekekaaha Iyib <verse eid="JER 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 41:18" />adifeghe mbọkkọ mbon Babilọn. Ammọ emaekop ndịk ebaña ammọ sia Ismeel ayịn Netania amaawot Kedalia ayịn Ahikam, a-adidem Babilọn akemekke nte adaiwuod ukara ke abio ado.<verse eid="JER 41:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 42:1" />Akem afịd mme adaaha ekọñ, ye Yohanan ayịn Kare ye Yesania ayịn Hosaiya, ye afịd awo tọọñọ ke andisịb ñkan tutu asịm andikpon ñkan emaekaa ebịne <verse eid="JER 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 42:2" />prọfed Yerimaiya enyʌñ ekebo anye ete, “Mbọk kpañ utọñ kop ñkpeubọk ñnyịn nyʌñ bọñ akam nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo baña afịd ñyọhọnsʌhọ ami. Sia naña afo akịt idahami, akpesʌkado aba ini adooho ñnyịn imaiwak, idahami ibad-ibad edisʌhọ. <verse eid="JER 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3" />Bọñ akam nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo nọ idọkkọ ñnyịn itie se ñnyịn ikpikaa ye se ñnyịn ikpinam.”<verse eid="JER 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4" />Prọfed Yerimaiya amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, “Ami mmekop se ndufo etañ, ami ñyaabọñ akam nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo naña ndufo ebeeñe; ami ñyaidọkkọ ndufo afịd ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ndiinyʌññọ idịp ndufo ñkpọ ndomokeed.”<verse eid="JER 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5" />Akem ammọ emaebo Yerimaiya ete, “Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado ntiense unen ye akpanikọ inọ ñnyịn adieke ñnyịn imiinamma afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo udọñ fiin abo adidọkkọ ñnyịn. <verse eid="JER 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6" />Me afọñ me ifọnnọ, ñnyịn iyaikop uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, anye a-ñnyịn udọññọ fiin inọọ, mbaak afọñ ye ñnyịn, sia ñnyịn iyaikop uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JER 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7" />Ke usen duob amaakeboiyo ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya. <verse eid="JER 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8" />Ndin anye amaakoot Yohanan ayịn Kare ye afịd mme adaaha ekọñ e-ekebaaha ye anye ye afịd mbon awo tọọñọ ke ntək-ntək tutu asịm ikpọ. <verse eid="JER 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9" />Ndin anye amaabo ammọ ate, “Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, a-ndufo ekendọññọ miin adiben ebeeñe ndufo nsọk anye atañ: <verse eid="JER 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10" />‘Adieke ndufo edʌññọ ke isọñ ami, ami ñyamaana ibọp ndufo, ndiiwuudo ndufo; ami ñyaitọ ndufo, ndiiwịppeke ndufo nduọọk, sia ami mmeteek ubọk mbaña mme nsobo a-ami ñkeduakka adinam ye ndufo. <verse eid="JER 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11" />Ikiikop ndịk ibaña adidem Babilọn, a-ndufo efegheke idahami. Ikiifeghe anye, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, sia ami mmọdo mba ye ndufo ñko ami ñyainyaaña ndufo ñnyʌñ isio ndufo ke ubọk amọ. <verse eid="JER 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12" />Ami ñyaitua ndufo mbọm nọ anye ñko akop mbọm ibaña ndufo anyʌñ iyaak ndufo etịmme enyọñọ isọñ ndufo.’<verse eid="JER 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13" />“Ado, adieke ndufo ebooho, ‘Ñnyịn idiidʌññọ ke isọñ ami,’ ndin etre utọñ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, <verse eid="JER 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14" />ñko adieke ndufo ebooho, ‘Iyoo, ñnyịn iyaikaa ikidʌñ ke Iyib, itie a-ñnyịn imiidiikịtte ekọñ me ikop uyio adukpoñ me ikop abiọọñ uyo,’ <verse eid="JER 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15" />ndin ikop uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndufo mme nsʌhọ ufọk Yuda. Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ: ‘Adieke ndufo ebeeñeke idem adika Iyib ndin ndufo enyʌñ ekaa ekedʌñ do, <verse eid="JER 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16" />ndin akañkañ a-ndufo efegheke ayaidia ndufo do, ñko akañ a-ndufo ebaaha ayaikeene ndufo akaa Iyib, ndin do ke ndufo ediikikpa. <verse eid="JER 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17" />Ke akpanikọ, afịd mbon se iyem adika Iyib ñkedʌñ do ediikpa ke akañkañ, akañ ye udọñọ nsobo; awo ammọ ndomokeed idiisʌhọke, idiinyʌññọ ibọkkọ nsobo se ami ndiiben ndot ammọ.’ <verse eid="JER 42:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18" />Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel atañ: ‘Naña ñkeduọk iyadesịd mmi ye ifiobesịd mmi nnọ mbon e-ekedʌññọ ke Yeruselem, ukem ado ke ndiiduọk ifiobesịd inọ ndufo ke ini ndufo ekaaha Iyib. Ndufo ediido isuuñọ ye ñkpọ ndịk, isuuñọ ye ñkpọ ndọk; ndufo idiikịtte itie ami aba tutu amama.’<verse eid="JER 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19" />“Nsʌhọ ufọk Yuda, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idọkkọ ndufo, ‘Ikiikaa Iyib.’ Idiọọñọ ami: Ami mmidʌt ndufo utọñ mfịn ami <verse eid="JER 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20" />nte ke ndufo emaenam ekamba ndudue ke idaha a-ndufo ekendọññọ miin enọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo enyʌñ ebo ete, ‘Bọñ akam nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn inọ ñnyịn, ndin idọkkọ ñnyịn afịd ñkpọ se anye atañ ndin ñnyịn iyainam.’ <verse eid="JER 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21" />Ami mmidọkkọ ndufo mfịn, ado ndufo isʌkkọ inịm <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke akpanikọ ke afịd se anye akendọñ miin abo yak ndidọkkọ ndufo. <verse eid="JER 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22" />Ndin idahami, idiọọñọ ntom: Ndufo ediikpa ke akañkañ, akañ ye udọñọ nsobo ke itie a-ndufo eyemme adika ñkedʌñ.”<verse eid="JER 42:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1" />Ke ini Yerimaiya amaakedọkkọ mme awo afịd ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ, afịd ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedọñ anye abo adọkkọ ammọ, <verse eid="JER 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2" />Asaria ayịn Hosaiya ye Yohanan ayịn Kare ye afịd ideen ñkịdidem emaebo Yerimaiya ete, “Afo asʌhọ nsu! <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn ikudọññọ fiin nọ abo, ‘Inaaha ndufo eka ekedʌñ ke Iyib.’ <verse eid="JER 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3" />Ado Baruk ayịn Neria udọọñ fiin abo iyaak ñnyịn anọ mbon Babilọn, nọ ammọ iwot ñnyịn imiidooho ammọ iben ñnyịn enyọñ Babilọn nte ifʌn.”<verse eid="JER 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4" />Ndin Yohanan ayịn Kare ye afịd mme adaaha ekọñ ye afịd awo emaesịn edinịm ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiba ke isọñ Yuda. <verse eid="JER 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5" />Utukeado, Yohanan ayịn Kare ye afịd mme adaaha ekọñ emaekoono afịd ñyọhọnsʌhọ ufọk Yuda emaeketịmme enyọñọ eto afịd mme idịd se ekesuan yak edidʌñ ke isọñ Yuda. <verse eid="JER 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ ekoono afịd mbon se Nebusaradan adaiso ekọñ adidem akekpọñ anọ Kedalia ayịn Ahikam, ayịn Safan, ideen, ibaan, ntəkayịn ye nditọ ibaan adidem. Ñko ammọ emaenyʌñ eben prọfed Yerimaiya ye Baruk ayịn Neria. <verse eid="JER 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7" />Ndin ammọ emaetịt utọñ ke se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ enyʌñ edʌk Iyib ekaa ataa esịd-esịd idʌn tutu ekewuọ Tapanes.<verse eid="JER 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8" />Ke Tapanes ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Yerimaiya ate: <verse eid="JER 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9" />“Ke idaha mme Yuu esʌkkọ ese, ben mme ikpọ itiad nyʌñ buuk ammọ ke aduañ ke ñkpufañ ntək itiad ke ntondʌk inuausʌñ ufọkubọọñ Fero ke Tapanes. <verse eid="JER 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10" />Ndin dọkkọ ammọ, ‘Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel atañ: Ami ñyaadọñ ekoot ayịnutom mmi Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn, ndin ami ñyaadaaha ebekpo ubọọñ amọ ke anyọñ itiad a-ami ñkebuuhọ mi; anye ayaatat ufʌkayio ubọọñ amọ afʌk ammọ. <verse eid="JER 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11" />Anye ayaadinwana ye Iyib, aben ñkpa asọk mbon e-enịmme enọ ekpa, ñkpakọb anọ mbon e-enịmme enọ ñkpakọb, anyʌñ aben akañkañ asọk mbon e-enịmme enọ akañkañ. <verse eid="JER 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12" />Anye ayaasịn ikañ ke mme tembịd mme abasi mbon Iyib; anye ayaafọp mme tembịd ammọ, anyʌñ asịn mme abasi ammọ ukad. Kpa naña akpemeedọñ anam ewịra amọ asana ke adidiañña mme ndañ nsio, kpa ntoro ke anye adiinam Iyib asana mbemiso anye anyọñ. <verse eid="JER 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13" />Ke itie tembịd utịn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Heliopolis</char></note> ke Iyib, anye ayaawuut ndisana abai anyʌñ afọp mme tembịd mme abasi Iyib abono ke isọñ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 43:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44" />
  <para style="s1">Nsobo ke Ntak Ubobodñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1" />Ikọ ami amaadisịm Yerimaiya abaña afịd mme Yuu e-ekedʌññọ ke Usuuk Iyib, ke Mikdol, Tapanes ye Memfis, ye ke ñkañ Adoro Iyib: <verse eid="JER 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Ndufo emaekịt ekamba nsobo a-ami ñkebenne ndot Yeruselem ye afịd mme abio Yuda. Mfịn ami ammọ ena ukpọk enyʌñ eba ke ñwuudo <verse eid="JER 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3" />ato ke ibak a-ammọ ekenamma. Ammọ emaedịppe iyadesịd mmi ke adifọp insensi nnọọ ñnyʌñ ñkpono mme abasi mfen a-ammọ me ndufo me mme eteete ammọ imiikidiọọñọke. <verse eid="JER 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4" />Ke ini ke ini ami mmaadọñ isʌñutom mmi mme prọfed, e-ekebooho ammọ, ‘Ikiinam mbubiam ñkpọ a-ami nsuaha!’ <verse eid="JER 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5" />Ado ammọ ikikoppo inyʌññọ inọ ñkpañutọñ; ammọ ikikpọññọ ibak, inyʌññọ itre ufọp insensi nnọọ mme abasi mfen. <verse eid="JER 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6" />Ke ntoro, ami mmaaduọk ammọ ufiob iyadesịd mmi; anye amaata akanna mme abio Yuda ye mme efaak ke Yeruselem anyʌñ anam ammọ edo mme ñwuudo abio a-ammọ edooho mfịn ami.<verse eid="JER 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7" />“Idahami se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel atañ ado ami: Nsoo inam nọ ndufo eben utọ ekamba nsobo ami enọ idem ndufo ke adiwoot afịd ideen ye ibaan, ye ntəkayịn ye nsek nditọ mfep ke Yuda, inyʌññọ inịm nsʌhọ inọ idem ndufo? <verse eid="JER 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8" />Nsoo inam nọ ndufo edịppe iyadesịd mmi ato se ubọk ndufo enam, ke ufọp insensi nnọ mme abasi mfen ke Iyib, a-ndufo ekedʌññọ ke esịd? Ndufo eyaesobo idem ndufo enyʌñ enam idem ndufo ñkpọ isuuñọ ye ñkpọ ndọk ke iso afịd mme idịd ke unadod. <verse eid="JER 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9" />Nte ndufo emefre ibak se mme eteete ndufo ye ndidem ye mbọọñibaan ndufo ke Yuda ekenam ye mme ibak se ndufo ye mme ibaan ndufo ekenam ke isọñ Yuda ye ke mme efaak ke Yeruselem? <verse eid="JER 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10" />Tutu usen mfịn ami ammọ isuuhọke idem inyʌññọ iwọt ukpono, a-ammọ ekeeneke mbed ye ewʌhọ a-ami ñkinịmme ndufo ye mme eteete ndufo ke iso.<verse eid="JER 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11" />“Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Ami mmebeeñe idem adiben afanekọñ inọọ ndufo ñnyʌñ nsobo afịd Yuda. <verse eid="JER 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12" />Ami ñyaaben nsʌhọ Yuda e-ekebeeñeke idem adika ñkedʌñ ke Iyib nsio. Afịd ammọ eyaetak ke Iyib; ammọ eyaeduọ ke akañkañ, imiidooho ekpa ke akañ. Tọọñọ ke ntək-ntək tutu asịm ekamba, ammọ eyaekpa ke akañkañ, imiidooho ekpa ke akañ. Ammọ eyaedo isuuñọ ye ñkpọ ndịk, isuuñọ ye ñkpọ ndọk. <verse eid="JER 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13" />Ami ñyaamia mbon e-edʌññọ ke Iyib ufen ye akañkañ, akañ ye udọñọ nsobo, naña ñkemia Yeruselem ufen. <verse eid="JER 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14" />Ibaaha ñyọhọnsʌhọ Yuda ndomokeed e-ekaaha ekedʌñ ke Iyib se idiibọkkọ me se idiidu uwem itịmme inyọñ isọñ Yuda, a-ammọ eduakka adinyʌñ ntịmme ñnyọñ ñkedʌñ; ibaaha mbon se idiitịmme inyọñ, ibọhọke ibad-ibad mbon efeeñeke ekpọñ Iyib.”<verse eid="JER 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15" />Akem afịd ideen e-ekediọọñọke ke ibaan ammọ ekesʌk efọp insensi enọ mme abasi mfen, dian ye afịd ibaan e-ekebaaha do, ataa ekamba atu awo, ye afịd mme awo e-ekedʌññọ ke Usuuk ye Adoro Iyib, emaebo Yerimaiya ete, <verse eid="JER 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16" />“Ñnyịn idiikoppo etob a-afo atañña inọọ ñnyịn ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>! <verse eid="JER 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17" />Ke akpanikọ ñnyịn iyainam afịd se ñnyịn iduak adinam: Ñnyịn iyaifọp insensi inọ Abọọñanwaan Hefịn inyʌñ iduọk uwa ukọd inọ anye, kpa naña ñnyịn ye mme eteete ñnyịn, ndidem ñnyịn ye mme adaaha ñnyịn ikinam ke mme abio Yuda ye ke mme efaak ke Yeruselem. Ke mme ini ado ñnyịn imainie uwak ndidia, ñko itie ñnyịn amaafọn, ndin ñnyịn ikibọọhọ ufen. <verse eid="JER 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18" />Ado tọọñọ ñnyịn ikitre adifọp insensi nnọọ Abọọñanwaan Hefịn inyʌñ itre adinam uwa ukọd nnọọ anye, ñnyịn inieghe ñkpọ ndomokeed, ñko isʌk ikpañña ke akañkañ ye akañ.”<verse eid="JER 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19" />Mme ibaan emaedian do ete, “Idaha a-ñnyịn ikifọppọ insensi inọọ Abọọñanwaan Hefịn inyʌñ iduọk ukọd inọọ anye, ado nte mme ebe ñnyịn ikidiọọñọke ke ñnyịn ikisʌk isinam uyo e-emịññe usioidem Abọọñanwaan Hefịn inyʌñ iduọk uwa ukọd inọ anye?”<verse eid="JER 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20" />Akem Yerimaiya amaabo afịd mbon awo, ideen ye ibaan, e-ekebọọrọke anye ntom ate, <verse eid="JER 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21" />“Ado nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikitoiyoke inyʌññọ idat isịn ke akikere mme insensi a-ndufo ye mme eteete ndufo ekefọppọ ke mme abio Yuda ye ke mme efaak ke Yeruselem, ukem ye ndidem ndufo ye mme adaaha ndufo ye afịd mme awo ke isọñ abio? <verse eid="JER 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22" />Ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> imiikikanna aba ime mme ibak adinam ndufo ye mbubiam ñkpọ a-ndufo ekenamma, isọñ ndufo amaakappa ñkpọ isuuñọ anyʌñ anaa ukpọk, mme awo ibaaha ke esịd, kpa naña aba mfịn ami. <verse eid="JER 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23" />Sia ndufo emaefọp insensi enyʌñ enam idiọọkñkpọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, inyʌññọ ikop uyio amọ, inyʌññọ ikeene mbed amọ me mme ewʌhọ amọ me mme ubonoñkpọ amọ, nsobo ami adi ibịne ndufo, naña ndufo ekịt idahami.”<verse eid="JER 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24" />Akem Yerimaiya amaabo afịd mbon awo, dian ye mme ibaan ate, “Ikop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> afịd ndufo mbon Yuda e-edʌññọ ke Iyib. <verse eid="JER 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Ndufo ye mme ibaan ndufo emenam se ndufo ekebo ke eyaenam idaha ekenwọñọke ebo, ‘Ñnyịn iyainam mme enwọñọ a-ñnyịn ikinamma adifọp insensi ñnyʌñ nduọk uwa ukọd nnọọ Abọọñanwaan Hefịn.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 44:25">“Ikaa iso ndin, inam se ndufo ekenwọñọ! Inịm mme enwọñọ ndufo! <verse eid="JER 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26" />Ado ikop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, afịd ndufo mme Yuu se idʌñ ke Iyib: ‘Ami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmenwọñọ ke akwa anyịñ mmi,’ mbo ke, ‘ibaaha awo ndomokeed a-atooho Yuda a-adʌññọ ke itie akeedodo ke Iyib se idiitommo anyịñ mmi aba me anwọñọ ate, “Ke akpanikọ naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara adu uwem.” <verse eid="JER 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27" />Sia ami nsʌk ñkpeme ammọ nnịm nnọ unọmọ, idooho ke eti; mme Yuu e-ebaaha ke Iyib eyaetak ke akañkañ ye akañ tutu esobo afịd ammọ. <verse eid="JER 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28" />Mbon se idiibọkkọ akañkañ itịmme ito Iyib inyọñ isọñ Yuda ediido ibad-ibad. Ndin afịd mme nsʌhọ ufọk Yuda ekediidʌññọ ke Iyib eyaediọọñọ me ikọ anie adiida, ake mmi me ake ammọ.<verse eid="JER 44:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29" />“ ‘Se idiido idiọọñọ inọ ndufo ke ami ñyaimia ndufo ufen ke itie ami ado ami,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ‘nọ ndufo ediọọñọ ebo ke uduak mmi adisobo ndufo mmọdo aba ke akpanikọ.’ <verse eid="JER 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: ‘Ami ñyaayaak Fero Hofra adidem Iyib nsịn ke ubọk mme asua amọ e-eyemme adiwot anye, ukem naña ñkeyaak Sedekaiya adidem Yuda nsịn ke ubọk Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn, a-asua akeyemme adiwot anye.’ ”<verse eid="JER 44:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45" />
  <para style="s1">Etob e-Enọọhọ Esọk Baruk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua inaañ ke ukara Yehoiyakịm ayịn Yosaiya adidem Yuda, ke ini Baruk ayịn Neria akewette mme ikọ a-prọfed Yerimaiya aketañña anọ anye asịn ke ikpañwed, Yerimaiya amaabo Baruk ate: <verse eid="JER 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2" />“Baruk, se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañ unọọ fiin ado ami: <verse eid="JER 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3" />Afo amaabo, ‘Adọdiọọk annọ miin! <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-adian ukuud ke ubiak annọ miin; udịd añkweeñe miin ato ke mmịm ndin nnieghe nduọkadudu.’ <verse eid="JER 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> andọkkọ miin ate yak ubo fiin, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>atañ ado ami: Ami ñyaadooño se ami mbọp nduọñọ, ñyaanyʌñ mbʌkkọ se ami ntọ ke afịd ederimbod. <verse eid="JER 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5" />Nte akpena afo ayem ikpọ ñkpọ anọ idem mfo? Kuuyem ammọ. Sia ami ñyaaben nsobo nsọk afịd awo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ado itie akeedodo a-afo akaaha ami ñyaanam afo abọkkọ ye uwem mfo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 45:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46" />
  <para style="s1">Etob A-abañake Iyib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1" />Ami ado ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-akedisịmme prọfed Yerimaiya abaña mme idịd:<verse eid="JER 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2" />Ke abaña Iyib:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 46:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 46:2">Ami ado etob a-abañake mbon ekọñ Fero Neko adidem Iyib, a-Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn akekanna ke ekọñ ke Kaakemis ke mben Inyañ Yufretis ke ayọhọ isua inaañ ke ukara Yehoiyakịm ayịn Yosaiya adidem Yuda:<verse eid="JER 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3" />“Ibeeñe mbọbọekọñ ndufo, ikpọ ye ntək,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:3">inyʌñ isaña iwuọ ikaa ekọñ!<verse eid="JER 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4" />Ibọbọ mme enañmbakara mbọbọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">idọọk mme enañ ekọñ idoro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Idat mme itie ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">ye uyadiwuod!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Itʌk mme eduad ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">isịne mme mbọbọekọñ ndufo!<verse eid="JER 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5" />Nsoo ke ami ñkịt?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">Ammọ ekop ndịk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">ammọ etịmme edem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">e-ekan mbon uko ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Ammọ efeeñe usọp-usọp</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">inyʌññọ ise edem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">ndin akpọsọñ ndịk aba ke afịd itie,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6" />“Mbon se isọp idem ikanna ifeghe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">mbon adudu ikanna ibọkkọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">Ke adoro ukañ Inyañ Yufretis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">ammọ etuak ukod enyʌñ eduọññọ.<verse eid="JER 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7" />“Anie awo ido ami a-adakkake nte Inyañ Nail,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:7">nte mbufịd mmọọñ inyañ?<verse eid="JER 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8" />Iyib adakka nte Inyañ Nail,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">nte mbufịd mmọọñ inyañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Anye ate, ‘Ami ñyaadakka ñnyʌñ mfʌk ederimbod;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">ami ñyaasobo mme abio ye mbon ammọ.’<verse eid="JER 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9" />Idịppe idem, ndufo mme enañmbakara!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">Iwat ke iyadesịd, ndufo mme andiwad sariọd!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Isaña ikaa, ndufo mbon ekọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">ideen Kuus ye Pud e-ekamake mme atuekọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">ideen Lidia e-edʌttọ utịgha.<verse eid="JER 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10" />Ado usen ado anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">usen usio usiene, usiene ye mme asua amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Akañkañ ayaadia tutu akop uyʌkkọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">tutu anye asuuk nsaditọñ amọ ye iyiib.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, ayaanọ uwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">ke isọñ adoro a-adianake ye Inyañ Yufretis.<verse eid="JER 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11" />“Dọọk kaa ke Kilied ke dat baam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">Adiaha Abọikpa Iyib.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Ado afo amedomo uwak ibọk ufọn ibaaha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">ukọk ibaaha unọ fiin.<verse eid="JER 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12" />Mme idịd eyaekop ebaña ndọk mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">ntuaña mfo ayaayọhọ unadod.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">Awo ekọñ keed ayaaduọ adoro ke awo ekọñ mfen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">ammọ naña iba eyaeduọññọ keed.”<verse eid="JER 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13" />Ami ado etob se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ anọ prọfed Yerimaiya abaña adidi Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn adinwana Iyib:<verse eid="JER 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14" />“Isian etob ami ke Iyib, inyʌñ inam ediọọñọ anye ke Mikdol;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">inyʌñ inam ediọọñọ anye ke Memfis ye Tapanes:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">‘Idat itie ndufo inyʌñ ibeeñe idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">sia akañkañ adia mbon e-ebaaha ye afo.’<verse eid="JER 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15" />Nsoo inam nọ esuuhọ mbon uko ndufo enịm?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:15">Ammọ ikanna ida, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanək ammọ aduọọk.<verse eid="JER 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16" />Ammọ eyaeduọññọ uwak-uwak ini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">ammọ eyaeduọññọ edudotto emọ-emọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">Ammọ eyaebo, ‘Idakka ida, yak ñnyịn itịmme ika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">ibịne ataa ubon ñnyịn ye mme ntịppe isọñ ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">ikpọñ akañkañ mme afiikawo.’<verse eid="JER 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17" />Do ammọ eyaebọọñ ete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">‘Fero adidem Iyib ado akpọsọñ uyom kpọd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">ini amọ aboiyo.’<verse eid="JER 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18" />“Ke akpanikọ naña ami ndu uwem,” Adidem abo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">a-anyịñ amọ adooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">“keed ayaadi adiiba nte Tabọ ke atu mme ikpọabod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">nte Kamel ke mben akpainyañ.<verse eid="JER 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19" />Ikoono mme ñkpoduoho ndufo ibeeñe idem edika asenidịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">ndufo e-edʌññọ ke Iyib,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">sia eyaenam Memfis anaa ukpọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">anyʌñ awuudo, inieghe mme andidʌñ ke esịd.<verse eid="JER 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20" />“Iyib ado uyaiya ñyịn enañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">ado nsʌñ utañkpọ asʌk adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">ato adoro abịne anye.<verse eid="JER 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21" />Mbon ekọñ e-ekpeeghekpe ke atu udịmekọñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">eba nte mme enañ ñkuuhọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Ammọ ñko eyaewọññọ edem enyʌñ efeeñe udịm keed,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">ammọ idiikanna isọọñọ ida ñkpad iba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">sia usen nsobo asʌk adi abịne ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">ini akem se emia ammọ ufen.<verse eid="JER 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22" />Iyib ayaasiama nte udʌkikọd a-afegheke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">naña mbon usua esaña ekpere ke adudu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">ammọ eyaedi ebịne anye ye mme ekịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">nte ideen e-ekpịkkeke mme eto.<verse eid="JER 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23" />Ammọ eyaekpeeñe mme akai ammọ enịm ke isọñ,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">“akpesʌkado anye ayọhọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">Ammọ ewak ekan ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">awo ikemeke adibat ammọ.<verse eid="JER 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24" />Eyaesịn Adiaha Iyib ke abuud,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:24">eyaak anye esịn mbon adoro ke ubọk.”<verse eid="JER 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, abo ate: “Ami mmebeeñe idem adiben ufen ndot Amọn, abasi Tebes ke idem, ndot Fero, ye Iyib ye mme abasi amọ ye ndidem amọ, ñko ye mbon e-edotto anyen ke Fero. <verse eid="JER 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26" />Ami ñyaaben ammọ nsịn ke ubọk mbon e-eyemme adiwot ammọ, Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn ye mme adaaha amọ. Ado amaaboiyo, eyaedʌñ ke Iyib nte naña akedo akpa,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 46:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27" />“Yekọb ayịnufọk mmi, kuukop ndịk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">Isrel, kuuyak idem unyeñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Ke akpanikọ ami ñyaunyaaña fiin nsio nto ke anyan itie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">ntịppe ubon mfo nsio ke isọñ ufʌn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Yekọb ayaamaana anie emem ye ukpeme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">ndin ibaaha awo ndomokeed a-adiinam anye akop ndịk.<verse eid="JER 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28" />Yekọb ayịnufọk mmi, kuukop ndịk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">sia ami mmọdo mba ye afo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">“Akpesʌkado ami mmesobo afịd mme idịd ukeed-ukeed</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">ke atu ammọ ami isuan ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">ami ndiisoboke ndufo ataa afịd-afịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Ami ñyaitʌnọ ndufo ado ke ayọhọ udomo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">ami ndiiyakka ndufo enyọñ afịd-afịd ke imiibọọhọ ufen.”<verse eid="JER 46:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47" />
  <para style="s1">Etob A-abañake Mbon Filistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> se ikidisịm prọfed Yerimaiya ke abaña mbon Filistia mbemiso Fero akenwana ammọ ke Kasa ado ami:<verse eid="JER 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">“Se naña mme mmọọñ edakka ke ukañ adoro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">ammọ eyaekappa edo atọadibeghe akpa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Ammọ eyaetọ ebọhọ adaña isọñ ye afịd ñkpọ ke esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">mme abio ye mbon se idʌñ ke esịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Mbon awo eyaetuaha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">afịd mbon se idʌñ ke isọñ eyaebọñ ñkpo<verse eid="JER 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3" />ke adikop uyom mme ukod enañ naña ewat edi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">ke uyom aditịm mme sariọd mbon usua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">ye ndukwaaha mme wiil ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">Mme ete ye eka idiikannake anyen adinwam nditọ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">ubọk ammọ ayaatọ atekke.<verse eid="JER 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4" />Sia usen a-adikem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">adisobo afịd mbon Filistia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">adinyʌñ nsio afịd mbon se ibọkkọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">ekemekke adinwam Tai ye Sidọn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aba ke mbeeñeidem adisobo mbon Filistia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">mme nsʌhọ e-etooho mben inyañ Kaftọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Kred</char></note>.<verse eid="JER 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5" />Kasa ayaakwaat ided amọ ke mfʌhọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">Askelọn idiisioho uyio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Ndufo mme ñyọhọnsʌhọ ke unaisọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">adiikpeene die ndufo edika iso ñkpeeñe idem ndufo?<verse eid="JER 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6" />“ ‘Sai, akañkañ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">adiikpeene die mbemiso afo aduọk adudu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">Tịmme dʌk efọk mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">tre nyʌñ dop da.’<verse eid="JER 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7" />Ado anye adiikeme die adiduọk adudu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ anye ewʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ anye uyio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">adinwana ye Askelọn ye mbon mben inyañ?”<verse eid="JER 47:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48" />
  <para style="s1">Etob A-abañake Mọb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1" />Se ibaña Mọb:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 48:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:1">Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">“Adọdiọọk anọ Nebo, sia anye ayaakịt ñwuudo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">Eyaesuenne Kiriataim enyʌñ emʌm anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">eyaesuenne mme ñkpọsọñ itie enyʌñ esuan ammọ.<verse eid="JER 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2" />Awo idiitooroke Mọb aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">ke Hesbọn mbon awo eyaeduak iduọ amọ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">‘Idi, yak ñnyịn ikọọk iwuod ibaña iduọ idịd ado.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Ndufo, mbon abio Madmen, eyaeba ñko ke ndobuyio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">akañkañ ayaibịne ndufo.<verse eid="JER 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3" />Ntuaña ayịd ntaeded awuọ ato Horonaim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:3">ntuaña ayịd ekamba afanekọñ ye nsobo.<verse eid="JER 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4" />Eyaebuuñ Mọb;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:4">ntək nditọ ammọ eyaetua.<verse eid="JER 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5" />Ammọ eyaekaa ke abod Luhid,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">etua ndod-ndod ayịd naña ammọ esañake eka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">ke usʌñ a-akaaha Horonaim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">eyaekop akpọsọñ ntuaña ayịd, ntaeded ebaña nsobo.<verse eid="JER 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6" />Ifeeñe! Ifeeñe ke ntak uwem ndufo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:6">iba nte ikọd ke akpautatan.<verse eid="JER 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7" />Sia ndufo ebuọttọ idem ke mme adinam ye inie ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">eyaiben ndufo ñko nte ifʌn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">ndin eyaeben Kemos enyọñ nte ifʌn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">dian ye mme aku ye mme adaaha amọ.<verse eid="JER 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8" />Andisobo ayaadi abịne afịd mme abio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">ibaaha abio ndomokeed se idiibọkkọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">Nsobo ayaasịm abedeñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">ndin eyaesobo mme ikpọabod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9" />Isịn inʌñ ke Mọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">sia eyaenịm anye nsobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">mme abio amọ eyaenaa ukpọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">ibaaha awo ndomokeed se idʌñ ke esịd.<verse eid="JER 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10" />“Isuuñọ anie awo akeedodo a-akoppo ifu adinam utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:10">Isuuñọ anie awo akeedodo a-adịppe akañkañ ammọ mbaak uduọkiyiib!<verse eid="JER 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11" />“Mọb aba ke emem tọọñọ ke uyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">nte ukọd asʌhọke ke ntak amọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">awo inwaññake ito ikịm keed isịn ke mfen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">anye ikaaha ikidʌñ ke asen idịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">Ke ntoro anye anem inua naña akesʌk aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">ndin inem ufịk amọ ikpʌhọke.<verse eid="JER 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12" />Ado mme usen esʌk edi,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">“idaha se ami ndiidọñ ideen e-etọkkọke ukọd eto mme abañ ukọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">ndin ammọ eyaeduọk anye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">ammọ eyaenịm abañ ukọd amọ ukpọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">enyʌñ eboom mme ikịm amọ.<verse eid="JER 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13" />Ndin Mọb ayaakop abuud abaña Kemos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:13">kpa naña Isrel akekop abuud</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:13">idaha a-ammọ ekebuọttọ idem ye Beteel.<verse eid="JER 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14" />“Die ke ndufo ekeme edibo, ‘Ñnyịn ido mbon uko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:14">ideen se isọñ adudu ke ekọñ’?<verse eid="JER 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15" />Eyaesobo Mọb, enyʌñ edọñọ mme abio amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:15">mme akobidem ñkparawa amọ eyaeduọññọ ke afịd,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:15">Adidem atañ, a-anyịñ amọ adooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan.<verse eid="JER 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16" />“Iduọ Mọb akpere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:16">afanekọñ amọ ayaadi usọp-usọp.<verse eid="JER 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17" />Itua ibaña anye, afịd ndufo e-edʌññọ ekpere anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">afịd mbon e-ediọọñọke etob amọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">ibo, ‘Enam die ebuuñ akpọsọñ esañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">enam die ebuuñ esañ ubọọñ!’<verse eid="JER 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18" />“Isọiyọ ke itie ubọọñ ndufo idi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">inyʌñ itie ke nsaad isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">ndufo mbon e-edʌññọ ke Adiaha Dibon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">sia anye a-asoboke Mọb</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">ayaadi ibịne ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">anyʌñ abiat ñkpọsọñ abio ndufo.<verse eid="JER 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19" />Ida ke usʌñ inyʌñ ise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:19">ndufo e-edʌññọ ke Arowa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">Ibịp awodeen a-afegheke inyʌñ ibịp awonwaan a-abọkkọke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:19">ibịp ammọ, ‘Nsoo itịppe?’<verse eid="JER 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20" />Esuenne Mọb, sia emaesuan anye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">Isio ñkpo ayịd inyʌñ itua!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Isian etob ke Anọn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">ibo ke esobo Mọb.<verse eid="JER 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21" />Ubiereikpe adi anọ mbara-mbara abod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:21">anọ Holon, Yasa ye Mefaad,<verse eid="JER 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22" />anọ Dibon, Nebo ye Bed Diblataim,<verse eid="JER 48:22" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23" />anọ Kiriataim, Bed-Kamul ye Bed-Mọọn,<verse eid="JER 48:23" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24" />anọ Keriọd ye Bosra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:24">tutu afịd mme abio Mọb, ke anyan ye ñkpere.<verse eid="JER 48:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25" />E-ekpịkke nnʌk Mọb esio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:25">e-ebuuñ anye ubọk,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:25">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26" />“Nam ukọd anaam anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:26">sia anye asọñ iwoud ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:26">Yak Mọb anyịne ke akikọi amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:26">yak anye ado ñkpọ nsaha.<verse eid="JER 48:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27" />Nte Isrel ikidooho ñkpọ nsaha ndufo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:27">Nte ekemʌm anye ke atu mme inọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:27">nọ ndufo efuuñ iwuod ndufo ke ndọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:27">ini akeedodo a-ndufo etañña ikọ ebaña anye?<verse eid="JER 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28" />Ifeghe ikpọñ abio ndufo, inyʌñ idʌñ ke mme abaitiad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:28">ndufo mbon e-edʌññọ ke Mọb.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:28">Iba nte ibiom a-abọppọ efọk amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:28">ke inua abaitiad.<verse eid="JER 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29" />“Ñnyịn imikop ibaña ntañidem Mọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">ñkokkoidem amọ akpon die!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">Usọñanyen amọ, ntañidem amọ, ñkịdidem amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">ye ntañidem esịd amọ.<verse eid="JER 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30" />Ami mmediọọñọ ke usọñanyen amọ ibaaha ufọn,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:30">“ñko ñkpoon inua amọ idatta ufọn ndomokeed idi.<verse eid="JER 48:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31" />Ke ntoro ami mmetua mbaña Mọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:31">mmetua mbaña afịd Mọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:31">ami mmefʌhọ mbaña mbon Kii Haresed.<verse eid="JER 48:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32" />Ami mmetua ibaña ndufo, naña Yasa atua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">ndufo mme fain Sibma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Mme ñkọk ndufo etara ekewuọ mben akpainyañ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">ammọ emaetara tutu ekewuọ ukañ Yasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Andisobo amaaduọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">adʌk mfịd ye mme kreb mfo emaekedat.<verse eid="JER 48:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33" />Idaara ye inemesịd enyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">ke inwañ mfịd ye mme inwañ Mọb.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Ami mmetre ukọd adiwuọ ke mme ñkpọ unyịmme ukọd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">awo ndomokeed isọnnọke ammọ aba ye ñkpo idaara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Akpesʌkado ñkpo abaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">ado idooho ñkpo idaara.<verse eid="JER 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34" />“Uyio ayịd ammọ adọọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:34">atọọñọ ke Hesbọn akewuọ Eliele ye Yahas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:34">atọọñọ ke Soa anyọọñ akewuọ Horonaim ye Eklad Selisiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:34">sia mme mmọọñ Nimrim emaesaat.<verse eid="JER 48:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35" />Ke Mọb ami ñyaatre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:35">mbon e-enamma mme uwa ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:35">enyʌñ efọp insensi enọ mme abasi ammọ,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 48:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36" />“Ke ntoro esịd mmi aseeme abaña Mọb nte ikwọ e-efịtte ke adʌk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:36">anye aseeme nte adʌk abaña mbon Kii Haresed.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:36">Mme inie se ammọ ekekọọk ebono atahade.<verse eid="JER 48:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37" />Emaekwaat afịd iwuod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:37">enyʌñ efat afịd ñwaebek esio;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:37">emaekpịkke afịd ubọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:37">enyʌñ efʌk afịd isịn ke afọñikpo.<verse eid="JER 48:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38" />Ke afịd mme akọmufọk ke Mọb</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">ye ke mme afe idʌñ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:38">ibaaha ñkpọ ndomokeed mfen ikan mfʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">sia ami mmebom Mọb</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">nte abañ a-awo ndomokeed imiiyemme,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 48:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39" />“Kase naña anye asuana! Kase naña ammọ etuaha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:39">Kase naña Mọb akanna edem amọ ke abuud!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:39">Mọb akappa ado ñkpọ ndọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:39">ñkpọ akpọsọñ ndịk anọ afịd mbon e-edʌññọ ekpere anye.”<verse eid="JER 48:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:40">“Se! Ntrukpuum asʌk asọiyọ adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:40">ataat mba amọ afʌk Mọb.<verse eid="JER 48:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41" />Eyaedat Keriọd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">enyʌñ eben ñkpọsọñ itie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:41">Ke usen ado esịd mbon uko Mọb</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">adiiba nte esịd awonwaan a-abaaha ke ubiakuman.<verse eid="JER 48:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42" />Eyaesobo Mọb nte idịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:42">sia anye amaasọñ iwuod ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 48:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43" />Akpọsọñ ndịk ye ube ye afia eda ibet ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:43">ndufo mbon Mọb,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:43">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 48:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44" />“Awo akeedodo a-afegheke akpọñ afai ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">ayaaduọ adʌk ube,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">awo akeedodo adọọhọ awuọ ke ube,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">afia ayaamʌm anye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">sia ami ñyaaben isua ufen amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">ndot Mọb,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 48:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45" />“Ke mfuud Hesbọn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">mbon itọk ñkpakọb eda inieghe udịd,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">sia ikañ amaato Hesbọn awuọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">ikañ ato ufọọd Sihọn asak awuọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">anye ata mme ekoiso Mọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">mme ñkpọkpọrọ mbon uyom ukpọinua.<verse eid="JER 48:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46" />Mọb, adọdiọọk unọ fiin!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">Esobo mbon Kemos;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:46">ekoono nditọ ideen mfo ekaa asen idịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">enyʌñ ekoono nditọ ibaan mfo nte ifʌn.<verse eid="JER 48:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47" />“Kpayeado ami ñyaatịmme ndịppe mfọnọñkpọ Mọb</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:47">ke mme usen ini iso,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:47">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:47">Ubiereikpe Mọb akweeñe mi.<verse eid="JER 48:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JER 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49" />
  <para style="s1">Etob A-abañake Amọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: abaña mbon Amọn</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:1" />
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">“Nte Isrel inieghe adiaakpa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">Ndin nsoo inam nọ Mọlek aben isọñ Kad?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">Nsoo inam nọ ikọd Mọlek edʌñ ke mme abio Kad?<verse eid="JER 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2" />Ado mme usen esʌk edi,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">“idaha se ami ndiifịt adukpoñ ekọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">mbaña Raba ke abio Amọn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">anye ayaakappa ado abod nsobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">ndin eyaesịn ikañ ke mme ñkanñkʌk abio amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Ndin Isrel ayaabịne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">mbon se ikibịne anye isio,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3" />“Hesbọn, tua, sia esobo Ai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">Isio ñkpo, ndufo mme andidʌñ ke Raba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Isịne afọñikpo inyʌñ ifʌhọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">ifeeñe ikaa iso ye edem ke mme esịd ndibene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">sia eyaeben Mọlek ekaa asenidịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">dian ye mme aku ye mme adaaha amọ.<verse eid="JER 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4" />Nsoo inam nọ ndufo eduaak inua ebaña mme abedeñ ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">eduaak inua ebaña mme abedeñ ndufo naña enwịm mfịd?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:4">Adiaha Amọn mforo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">afo abuọt idem ke mme inie mfo anyʌñ abo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">‘Anie adiinwana ye ami?’<verse eid="JER 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5" />Ami ñyaaben afai idot ndufo ke idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">nto afịd mbon e-ebaaha ikanna ndufo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">“Eyaebịne afịd ndufo esio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">ndin awo ndomokeed idiikoonoke mbon itọk ñkpakọb ibok.<verse eid="JER 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6" />“Ke ado amaaboiyo, ami ñyaatịmme ndemme mfọnọñkpọ mbon Amọn,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:6">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etob A-abañake Edọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7" />Se ibaña Edọm:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:7" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:7">Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atan ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">“Nte aniọñ ibaaha aba ke Teman?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Nte nnọitem akweeñe akpọñ mbon ndiọọñọidem?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Nte aniọñ ammọ amañ?<verse eid="JER 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8" />Ikanna iso inyʌñ ifeeñe, idịbe ke mme abaitiad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">ndufo mbon e-edʌññọ ke Dedan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:8">sia ami ñyaaben nsobo nsọk Isọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">ke ini se ami ndiimia anye ufen.<verse eid="JER 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9" />Adieke mbon e-etañña kreb ekpediighe ubịne fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:9">nte ammọ ikpisʌhọke idem kreb ifañ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:9">Adieke mme inọ ekpediighe ke akonayio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:9">nte ammọ ikpiyịppe se ammọ eyem ikpọọñ?<verse eid="JER 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10" />Ado ami ñyaasuuk Isọ ifed;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">ami ñyaayaara mme itie udịbe amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">mbaak anye adikan adịp idem amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">E-esobo mbon ekọñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">ukem ado ñko ye mme nsaña ye mme mbọhọidʌñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">tutu awo ndomokeed ibaaha se ibo anye,<verse eid="JER 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11" />‘Ikpọñ nditọakpa ndufo; ami ñyaanịm ammọ uwem.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:11">Mme ebekpa ndufo ñko ekeme ibuọt idem ke ami.’ ”<verse eid="JER 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: “Adieke mbon se i-imiidotto adinwọñ kọọb anaaha nte enwọñ anye, nsoo ikpinam nọ afo akpetre adibọ ufen? Afo uduunyọññọ ke umuubọọhọ ufen, ado ana nte anwọñ anye. <verse eid="JER 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13" />Ami mmenwọñọ ke idem mmi,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “ke Bosra ayaakappa ado ñwuudo ye isuuñọ, ñkpọ ndịk ye ndọk; ndin afịd mme abio amọ ediido ñwuudo ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="JER 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14" />Ami mmekop etob nto <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">emaedọñ isʌñutom nọ aka mme idịd akebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">“Ibok idem ndufo adinwana ekọñ ye anye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">Idakka ida ke mbeeñeidem ekọñ!”<verse eid="JER 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15" />“Idahami ami ñyaanam afo asịp ke atu mme idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:15">ubonawo eyausọọn fiin.<verse eid="JER 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16" />Akpọsọñ ndịk a-afo asịnne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">ye ntañidem esịd mfo ubiaña fiin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">afo a-adʌññọ ke mme aba ikpọitiad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">a-adʌññọ ke mme anyọñ abod.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Akpesʌkado afo abọppọ efọk mfo ke anyọñ nte efọk ntrukpuum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">ami ñyaato do udooro fiin nsuuho nnịm ke isọñ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17" />“Edọm ayaakappa ado ñkpọ ndịk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:17">afịd mbon se isaña iboiyo eyaekop ñkpaidem eyaenyʌñ esaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:17">ato ke afịd mme unan amọ.<verse eid="JER 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18" />Naña ekedooro Sọdọm ye Komora eduọọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">ye mme abio mbọhọidʌñ ammọ,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:18">“mbaak awo ndomokeed adidʌñ do;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">mbon awo ndomokeed idiidʌññọ ke anye.<verse eid="JER 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19" />“Nte ekpe a-atooho akai Yọdan awuọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">aka isọñ a-ayọhọke ye nti ndidia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">ami ñyaabịne Edọm nsio ke isọñ amọ ini keed.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">Anie ado awo a-ami ndiimek adidọñ utom ami?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">Anie aba nte ami, anie anyʌñ akeme adidomo idem ye ami?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">Anie akpemeedọñ anyʌñ akeme adida ñnwana ye ami?”<verse eid="JER 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20" />Ke ntoro, ikop se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduak adinam Edọm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:20">se anye abiide abaña mbon e-edʌññọ ke Teman:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:20">Eyaedʌt mme ñyịn edọñ esịññe ekpọñ udịmedọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:20">mme inwañ ndidia ammọ eyaeba ke ñkpaidem ke se iwuọñọ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21" />Ke uyom iduọ ammọ ekondo ayaanyeeñe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:21">ntuaña ammọ ayaatop akewuọ Ndad-Ndad Akpainyañ.<verse eid="JER 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22" />Se! Ntrukpuum ayaafuurọ adọọk anyọñ, anyʌñ asọiyọ ke isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:22">ataat mba amọ afʌk Bosra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:22">Ke usen ado esịd mbon uko ekọñ Edọm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:22">ediiba nte esịd awonwaan a-abaaha ke ubiakuman.<verse eid="JER 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etob A-abañake Damaskọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23" />Ke abaña Damaskọs:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">“Hamad ye Apad e-enie ayeeme nsia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">sia ammọ emaekop idiọọk etob.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">Ammọ e-enie iduọesịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">a-afịna ammọ nte akpainyañ ammiiduọkkọ adudu.<verse eid="JER 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24" />Udịd a-abọkkọ Damaskọs,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">anye a-akanna iso adifeghe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">ndịk a-anyʌñ amʌm anye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">ntuaña ye ubiak e-emʌm anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">ubiak nte awonwaan a-abaaha ke ubiakuman.<verse eid="JER 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25" />Nsoo inam nọ mme awo imiifegheke ikpọñ awuọ etob abio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:25">abio se ami nnem esịd mbaña?<verse eid="JER 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26" />Ke akpanikọ, ñkparawa amọ eyaeduọññọ ke mme efaak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:26">eyaekʌp afịd mbon ekọñ ammọ inua ke usen ado,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:26">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ.<verse eid="JER 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27" />“Ami ñyaakịm ikañ nsịn ke mme ndibene Damaskọs;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:27">anye ayaata ñkpọsọñ itie Ben-Hadad.”<verse eid="JER 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etob A-abañake Keda ye Hasọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28" />Ke abaña Keda ye mme abio Hasọ, a-Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn akenwanake:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:28" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:28">Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:28">“Dakka da, nyʌñ nwana ye Keda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:28">nyʌñ sobo mbon edem usakkautịn.<verse eid="JER 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29" />Eyaeben mme atayad ammọ ye udịmedọñ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">eyaekoono mme itie idʌñ ammọ enyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">ye afịd ñkpọudua ye mme kamel ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">Mme awo eyaebọñ ñkpo ebo ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">‘Afai ke afịd itie!’<verse eid="JER 49:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30" />“Ifeghe ke usọp inyọñọ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">Idịbe ke mme ntotəño abaitiad ndufo mbon e-edʌññọ ke Hasọ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">“Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn a-akọọk afia anịm inọ ndufo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">anye anie idiọọk akikere ibaña ndufo.<verse eid="JER 49:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31" />“Idakka ida inyʌñ inwana ye idịd a-abaaha ke emem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">a-adʌññọ ke uko,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">“idịd a-adooho inieghe mme inuaatob ye mme aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">mbon amọ edʌñ enyọọñ usʌñ ekpọñ afanekọñ.<verse eid="JER 49:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32" />Eyaebịme mme kamel ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">ndin uwak udịmenañ ammọ ediido mbịme ñkpọ ekọñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">Ami ñyaasuan mbon e-ebaaha ke anyan itie ndọñ ke afịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">ñnyʌñ mben nsobo ke afịd itie nsọk ammọ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33" />“Hasọ adiido ñkpọ ubịne anọ mme ewaikọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:33">itie a-awo imiidʌññọ ke nsi-nsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">Awo ndomokeed idiidʌññọ do;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:33">mbon awo ndomokeed idiidʌññọ do.”<verse eid="JER 49:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etob A-abañake Elam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> se ikisịm prọfed Yerimaiya ke abaña Elam ado ami, ke ntọọñọ ukara Sedekaiya adidem Yuda:<verse eid="JER 49:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:35">“Se, ami ñyaabuuñ utịgha Elam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:35">asaña-asaña adudu ammọ.<verse eid="JER 49:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36" />Ami ñyaaben afịm mbañ inaañ ndot Elam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">ato ke mbañ hefịn inaañ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:36">ami ñyaasuan ammọ nnọ mbañ afịm inaañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">ndin idịd idiibaaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">a-mbon itọkekọñ Elam imiidiikaaha.<verse eid="JER 49:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37" />Ami ñyaasuan Elam ke iso mme asua ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">ke iso mbon e-eyemme adiwot ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">ami ñyaaben nsobo nsọk ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">kpa ye ataa iyadesịd mmi,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">“Ami ñyaabịne ammọ ke akañkañ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">tutu nnam ammọ ekịt utịd.<verse eid="JER 49:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38" />Ami ñyaadaaha ebekpo ubọọñ mmi ke Elam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:38">ñnyʌñ nsobo adidem amọ ye mme adaaha amọ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:38">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 49:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39" />“Kpayeado ami ñyaatịmme ndemme uforo Elam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:39">ke mme usen se idiidi,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:39">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 49:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50" />
  <para style="s1">Etob A-abañake Babilọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1" />Ikọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ ato inua prọfed Yerimaiya abaña Babilọn ye isọñ Babilọn ado ami:<verse eid="JER 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2" />“Isian inyʌñ itañ ke atu mme idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">idịppe mme afọñidiọọñọ inyʌñ itañ anye anwa-anwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">ikiisʌhọ ñkpọ ndomokeed, ado ebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">‘Eyaemʌm Babilọn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">eyaesịn Bel ke abuud,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">Maduk ayaayọhọ ye akpọsọñ ndịk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Mme usioidem amọ eyaekịt abuud</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">ndin mme ubobodñkpọ amọ eyaeyọhọ ye akpọsọñ ndịk.’<verse eid="JER 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3" />Idịd a-atooho adoro ayaanwana mme anye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:3">anyʌñ anịm isọñ amọ anaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:3">Awo ndomokeed idiidʌññọ ke anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:3">mme awo ye unam eyaefeeñe ewuọ.<verse eid="JER 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4" />“Ke mme usen ado, ke ini ado,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:4">“mbon Isrel ye mbon Yuda eyaediana keed</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:4">ekaa ke mmọọñayịd adiyem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ.<verse eid="JER 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5" />Ammọ eyaebịp usʌñ a-akaaha Saiyọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">enyʌñ ekanna iso ammọ ese udo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:5">Ammọ eyaedi edibọp idem ammọ edian ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">ke nsi-nsi edioomo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">a-awo imiidiifreke.<verse eid="JER 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6" />“Ikọd mmi edo mme edọñ e-esoppo usʌñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">mbon se ikpeme ammọ emaetịn ammọ usʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">enyʌñ enam ammọ edutịn ke mme anyọñ ikpọabod.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:6">Ammọ eyooñ esaña ke anyọñ ikpọabod ye ntəkabod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">ndin efre mme itie nduọkadudu ammọ.<verse eid="JER 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7" />Mbio se ikikịt ammọ emaeta ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:7">mme asua ammọ emaebo, ‘Ñnyịn idueghe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:7">sia ammọ emaenam idiọọkñkpọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nseghe isọñ mbunwịm ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:7">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, idodanyen mme eteete ammọ.’<verse eid="JER 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8" />“Ifeeñe iwuọñọ ke Babilọn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:8">ikpọñ isọn mbon Babilọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:8">inyʌñ iba nte mme ebod edatta udịmedọñ usʌñ.<verse eid="JER 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9" />Sia ami ñyaademme udọñ mme ikpọ idịd ke isọñ adoro, ñnyʌñ nnam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">ammọ ebọp idiọọk edioomo ebaña Babilọn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Ammọ eyaedat itie mbeeñeidem ekọñ ebaña anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">ndin tọọñọ ke adoro eyaesịn anye ukad.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Mme idañ ammọ ediiba nte idañ mme nta mbon uko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">i-imiisinyọññọ ubọk ñkaña.<verse eid="JER 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10" />Ndin eyaebịme Babilọn ekoono;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:10">afịd mbon se ibịme anye eyaenie uyʌkkọ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:10">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11" />“Sia ndufo emedaara e-enyʌñ enem esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">ndufo e-ekoonoke udeeme mmi ke ñkanubọk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">sia ndufo emenek nte ñyịn enañ ke afe abakpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">enyʌñ esio uyio nte ñyaara enañmbakara.<verse eid="JER 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12" />Eka ndufo ayaakop ekamba abuud;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">eyaesuenne anye a-akimanna ndufo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">Anye adiido andisịb ñkan ke atu mme idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">anaan, nsaad isọñ, akpautatan.<verse eid="JER 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13" />Ke ntak iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> awo idiidʌññọ ke anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">ado adiina ukpọk ataa afịd-afịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">Afịd mbon se isaña iboiyo ke Babilọn eyaeba ke ñkpaidem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">ammọ eyaesaha ato ke afịd mme unan amọ.<verse eid="JER 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14" />“Idat itie ekọñ ndufo ikanna Babilọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:14">afịd ndufo mme atop utịgha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">Itop anye! Ikiisʌhọ idañ ndomokeed,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:14">sia anye anam idiọọkñkpọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15" />Ibọọñ ñkpo ye anye ke afịd idaha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">Anye akpeubọk, mme tọwa amọ eduọññọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">ewuut mme ndibene amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Sia ami adooho usiene iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">esio anye usiene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">enam ye anye kpa naña anye akenam ye mbon mfen.<verse eid="JER 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16" />Ikpịkke atọinwañ isio ke Babilọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">ye andidọk ye ikwa ukpeeñe amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">Ke ntak akañkañ afiikawo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">yak afịd awo etịmme enyọñ ebịne mbon ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">yak afịd awo efeghe eka isọñ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17" />“Isrel ado udịmedọñ a-amaakesuana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">a-mme ekpe ekebịneke esio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">Akpa andikita ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">akedo adidem Asiria;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">akpatre andikiboom akpọ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">akedo Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn.”<verse eid="JER 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:18">“Ami ñyaamia adidem Babilọn ye isọñ amọ ufen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:18">kpa naña ñkemia adidem Asiria.<verse eid="JER 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19" />Ado ami ñyaamaana mben Isrel ñnyọñ ndi isọñ awawa mbid ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:19">ndin anye ayaata mbid ke isọñ Kamel ye Basan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:19">iwʌd amọ ayaakop uyʌkkọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:19">ke mme abod Ifrem ye Kilied.<verse eid="JER 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20" />Ke mme usen ado, ke mme ini ado,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">eyaenam nduuñọ ebaña mme ndudue Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">ado awo idiikịtte ndomokeed,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">enyʌñ eduuñọ ebaña ndiọiñkpọ Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">ado awo idiikịtte ndomokeed,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">sia ami ñyaafeen mme nsʌhọ a-ami nnịmme.<verse eid="JER 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21" />“Nwana ye isọñ Merataim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">ye mbon se idʌñ ke Pekod.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">Bịne, wot nyʌñ sobo ammọ ataa afịd-afịd,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">“Nam afịd ñkpọ se ami udọñ fiin.<verse eid="JER 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22" />Uyom ekọñ aba ke isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:22">uyom ekamba nsobo!<verse eid="JER 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23" />Se naña ebuuñ enyʌñ esuan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:23">ukọññkpọ afịd ekondo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:23">Ñwuudo Babilọn abadie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:23">ke atu mme idịd!<verse eid="JER 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24" />Babilọn, ami mmaakọọk afia unọ fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">ndin emaumʌm fiin mbemiso afo adiọọñọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">emaukịt fiin enyʌñ umʌm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">sia afo amaasọñ iwuod ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 50:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abeere itie unịm ñkpọekọñ amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">anyʌñ asịññe mme ñkpọekọñ iyadesịd amọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:25">sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara ye Andikponñkan anie utom adinam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">ke isọñ mbon Babilọn.<verse eid="JER 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26" />Ito anyan itie idi ibịne anye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">Ibom mme itie unịmndidia amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">Ikọọk anye nte mme ebono ñkpasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">Isobo anye ataa afịd-afịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">ikiinyʌñ iyaak nsʌhọ ndomokeed aba.<verse eid="JER 50:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27" />Iwot afịd mme ñyịn ñyaaraenañ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:27">yak ammọ eka ke itie uwot unam!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:27">Adọdiọọk anọ ammọ! Sia usen ammọ adisịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:27">ini adimia ammọ ufen.<verse eid="JER 50:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28" />Ikpañ utọñ inọ mbon e-efeeñeke itọk ye mme ifʌn e-etooho Babilọn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:28">etañ ke Saiyọn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:28">naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn asio usiene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:28">usiene anọ tembịd amọ.<verse eid="JER 50:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29" />“Ikoot mme atobidañ nọ enwana ye Babilọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">afịd mbon e-edʌttọ utịgha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Inam nnaaekọñ ikanna anye ikʌk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">ikiiyak awo ndomokeed abọkkọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Isio anye usiene idiọọk amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">inam ye anye naña anye ñko anam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Sia anye a-amiom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">Adisana Abasi Isrel.<verse eid="JER 50:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30" />Ke ntoro, ñkparawa amọ eyaeduọññọ ke mme efaak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:30">eyaekʌp mbonekọñ amọ inua ke usen ado,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:30">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 50:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31" />“Se, ami mmenwana ye afo, afo awo ntañidem,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:31">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atommo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">“sia usen mfo adikem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:31">ini afo adibọ ufen.<verse eid="JER 50:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32" />Awo ntañidem ayaatuak ukod anyʌñ aduọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">ndin awo ndomokeed idiinwamma adidịppe anye ndaaha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:32">ami ñyaasịn ikañ ke mme abio amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">se idiita afịd mbon se iba ikpere anye.”<verse eid="JER 50:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">“E-efiik mbon Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:33">ukem ñko ye mbon Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">Afịd mbon se imʌm ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:33">emʌm ammọ ekama ubọk asọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:33">esịn adisaana ammọ ñyaak.<verse eid="JER 50:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34" />Ado Andifak ammọ asọñ adudu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ado anyịñ amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:34">Anye ayaabọọrọ ikọ anọ ammọ ke afịd adudu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">nọ ato do anye asịn emem ke isọñ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">ado ndutịme aba ke atu mbon e-edʌññọ ke Babilọn.<verse eid="JER 50:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35" />“Akañkañ ayaadoro mbon Babilọn!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:35">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">abaña mbon e-edʌññọ ke Babilọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:35">ye mme adaaha amọ ye ntaifiọk amọ!<verse eid="JER 50:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36" />Akañkañ ayaadoro mme nsu-nsu prọfed amọ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:36">Ammọ eyaekappa edo mbon ndisịme.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Akañkañ ayaadoro mbon uko amọ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:36">Ammọ eyaekop akpọsọñ ndịk.<verse eid="JER 50:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37" />Akañkañ ayaadoro mme enañmbakara ye mme sariọd amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">ye afịd mme isenawo ke nsio-nsio ndaha amọ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">Ammọ eyaekappa edo mbon idek.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Akañkañ ayaadoro mme ñkpọuto amọ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">Eyaebịme ammọ.<verse eid="JER 50:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38" />Nsaad isọñ ayaasịm mmọọñ amọ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:38">Ammọ eyaesaat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">Sia anye ado isọñ mme ubobodñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:38">mme ubobodñkpọ e-ediidamma ye ndịk.<verse eid="JER 50:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39" />“Ke ntoro mme unam akpautatan ye mme haiyena eyaedʌñọ do,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:39">ndin do ke mme ñkịdikịd ediidʌñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:39">Awo idiidʌññọ ke anye aba ke nsi-nsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:39">inyʌññọ idʌñ do ke emana ke emana.<verse eid="JER 50:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40" />Naña ami ñkedooro Sọdọm ye Komora nduọọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">ye mme mbọhọidʌñ abio ammọ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:40">“mbaak awo ndomokeed adidʌñ do;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">mbon awo ndomokeed idiidʌññọ ke anye.<verse eid="JER 50:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41" />“Se! Udịmekọñ asʌk ato adoro abio adi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:41">edịppe nduduai ekamba idịd ye uwak mme ndidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:41">tọọñọ ke mme utịd ederimbod.<verse eid="JER 50:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42" />Ammọ ebana idem ye mme utịgha ye mme eduad;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">ammọ edo ibak inyʌññọ itua mbọm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Ammọ enam uyom nte mbufịd akpainyañ adakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">naña ammọ ewat ke mme enañmbakara ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">ammọ esaña edi nte ideen ke udịmekọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">edunwana fiin, Adiaha Babilọn.<verse eid="JER 50:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43" />Adidem Babilọn akop mme etob abaña ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:43">ndin ubọk amọ atọ atekke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">Afanekọñ asịm anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:43">ubiak nte ake awonwaan a-abaaha ke ubiakuman.<verse eid="JER 50:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44" />Kpa nte ekpe a-atooho akai Yọdan awuọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">adika isọñ a-ayọhọke ye nti ndidia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">ami ñyaabịne Babilọn nsio ke isọñ amọ ini keed.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">Anie awo ido anye a-ami mmekke adidọñ utom ami?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">Anie awo iba nte ami, ñko anie akeme adidomo idem ye ami?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">Anie akpemeedọñ akeme adidomo idem ye ami?”<verse eid="JER 50:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45" />Ke ntoro, ikop se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduak adinam ye Babilọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:45">se anye adioomo abaña isọñ mbon Babilọn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:45">Eyaedʌt mme ñyịn edọñ esịññe ekpọñ udịmedọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:45">mme inwañ ndidia ammọ eyaeba ke ñkpaidem ke se iwuọñọ ammọ.<verse eid="JER 50:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46" />Ke uyom ediimʌm Babilọn, ekondo ayaanyeeñe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:46">ntuaña amọ ayaatop awuọ ke atu mme idịd.<verse eid="JER 50:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">“Se, ami ñyaademme udọñ sịbidịd awo nsobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:1">mbaña Babilọn ye mbon Leb Kamai.<verse eid="JER 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2" />Ami ñyaadọñ isenawo nnọ Babilọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">nọ ekeñ anye nte mbio enyʌñ esobo isọñ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">ammọ eyaetịmede anye ke afịd ndaha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">ke usen afanekọñ amọ.<verse eid="JER 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3" />Yak atobidañ akudʌt utịgha amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">me adibọbọ mbọbọekọñ amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">Ikiisʌhọ ñkparawa ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">isobo mbon ekọñ amọ ataa afịd-afịd.<verse eid="JER 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4" />Ammọ eyaeduọ enaa ekpañña ke Babilọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:4">enaa ke mme efaak ye unan ñkpa.<verse eid="JER 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5" />Sia Abasi, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:5">ifreke Isrel ye Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">akpesʌkado isọñ ammọ ayọhọke ye ndudue</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:5">ke isọ Adisana Abasi Isrel.<verse eid="JER 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6" />“Ifeeñe ikpọñ Babilọn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">Ifeghe ke ntak uwem ndufo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">Ikiiyak isobo ndufo ke ntak ndiọiñkpọ amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">Ini usio usiene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adikem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">anye ayaakpe anye utịb naña anye adot.<verse eid="JER 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7" />Babilọn akedo kọọb kold ke ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">anye amaanam ukọd anaam afịd ekondo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">Mme idịd emaenwọñ ukọd amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">ke ntoro idahami ammọ edamma.<verse eid="JER 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8" />Babilọn ayaaduọ anyʌñ abomo adiwad-adiwad.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">Itua ibaña anye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">Ibọ adan mfiọññọ ibaña ubiak amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">akemeido anye ayaabọ ukọk.<verse eid="JER 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9" />“ ‘Ñnyịn ikpaikikọk Babilọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">ado awo ikanna ikọk anye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">yak ñnyịn ikpọñ anye inyʌñ ikaa ke isọñ ñnyịn keedekeed,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">sia ubiideikpe amọ awuọ ikpaanyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">anye adọọk anyọñ anyọọñ nte mme hefịn.’<verse eid="JER 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10" />“ ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> itoppo ñnyịn ikpe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:10">idi, yak ñnyịn itañ ke Saiyọn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:10">se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn anam.’<verse eid="JER 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11" />“Iban mme idañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">iben mme atuekọñ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaademme iyadesịd ndidem mbon Med,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">sia uduak amọ ado adisobo Babilọn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaasio usiene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">usiene ke abaña tembịd amọ.<verse eid="JER 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12" />Idịppe afọñidiọọñọ ibaña mme ndibene Babilọn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">Imaana idian mme awo inọ mbon ukpeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">idaaha mbon ukpeme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">ibeeñe idem idịbe ibem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam uduak amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">ewʌhọ amọ ke abaña mbon Babilọn.<verse eid="JER 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13" />Ndufo mbon e-edʌññọ ekpere mme mmọọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">enyʌñ emọinyọ ke mme inie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">utịd ndufo a-adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">ini a-anaaha nte isobo ndufo.<verse eid="JER 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan anwọñọ ke idem amọ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:14">Ke akpanikọ ami ñyaiyọhọ ndufo ye udịmekọñ, nte eboho uwak ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:14">ndin ammọ eyaesio ñkpo adikan ibaña ndufo.<verse eid="JER 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15" />“Anye akenam ekondo ke adudu amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">anye aketọọñọ ederimbod ke aniọñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">anyʌñ adeet mme hefịn anịm ke mbufiọk amọ.<verse eid="JER 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16" />Anye amaatop nte aduma, mme mmọọñ ke mme hefịn ekuun;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">anye anam mme ntọñanyọñ edakka tọọñọ ke mme utịd ekondo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Anye adọñ akebkeb nọ asaña ye edịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">anyʌñ asio afịm ke mme ufọk ubonoñkpọ amọ.<verse eid="JER 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17" />“Afịd awo enana ifiọk ye ikike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">afịd anamusọ kold abọ asuenne ato mme ubobodñkpọ amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">Mme ubobodñkpọ se anye anam edo mbiaña;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">ibifịk ndomokeed isịneke ammọ ke idem.<verse eid="JER 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18" />Ammọ edo ikpu-ikpu, mme ñkpọ ndọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:18">ubiomikpe ammọ amaadi, ammọ eyaetak.<verse eid="JER 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19" />Anye a-adooho Udeeme Yekọb ibaaha nte mbon ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">sia anye ado Andinam afịd ñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">kpa ye mbon e-edooho udeeme amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ado anyịñ amọ.<verse eid="JER 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20" />“Afo ado akpeti ekọñ mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">ñkpọ unwana ekọñ mmi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">ye afo ami mmesuan mme idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">ye afo ami mmesobo mme abioubọọñ,<verse eid="JER 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21" />ye afo ami mmesuan enañmbakara ye andiwad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:21">ye afo ami mmesuan sariọd ye andiwad,<verse eid="JER 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22" />ye afo ami mmesuan awodeen ye awonwaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">ye afo ami mmesuan akaanadeen ye iwaad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">ye afo ami mmesuan akparawa ye abọikpa,<verse eid="JER 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23" />ye afo ami mmesuan akpemeedọñ ye udịmedọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">ye afo ami mmesuan atọinwañ ye abaakenañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">ye afo ami mmesuan mme adaukara ye mme adaaha ukara.<verse eid="JER 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24" />“Ke iso mfo ami ñyaasio Babilọn ye afịd mbon se idʌñ ke Babilọn usiene ke afịd ndiọi se ammọ ekenam ke Saiyọn,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 51:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25" />“Ami mmetọhọ ye afo, afo ekamba abod nsobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">ndufo e-esoboke afịd ekondo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">“Ami ñyaanyan ubọk mmi udot fiin ke idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">uwere fiin ndooro ke mme anyọñ itiad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">ñnyʌñ nnam afo ado ekamba abod u-udịd amaakweeñe.<verse eid="JER 51:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26" />Awo idiibenne mbai itiad mfo inam itiad inuuk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:26">me itiad ndomokeed inam itiad idakisọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:26">sia afo adiido anaan ke nsi-nsi,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 51:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27" />“Idịppe afọñidiọọñọ ke anyọñ ke isọñ ami!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">Ifịt adukpoñ ke atu mme idịd!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Ibeeñe mme idịd idem adinwana ekọñ ye anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">ikoot mme abioubọọñ ami ediana keed ebaña anye:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">Ararad, Mini ye Askenas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Imek adaiso ekọñ ibaña anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">idọñ mme enañmbakara nte udịm ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ.<verse eid="JER 51:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28" />Ibeeñe mme idịd idem ekọñ adinwana ye anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">ndidem mbon Med,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:28">mme adaukara ammọ ye afịd mme adaaha ukara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">ye afịd mme abio se ammọ ekaara.<verse eid="JER 51:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29" />Isọñ anyeñ anyʌñ amiañña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">sia mme uduak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-abañake Babilọn asọọñọ ada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:29">adisobo isọñ Babilọn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">mbaak awo ndomokeed adidʌñ do.<verse eid="JER 51:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30" />Mbon uko ekọñ Babilọn etre anwan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">ammọ eda ke mme ñkpọsọñ itie ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Udịd ammọ akweeñe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">ammọ ekappa edo mme idek.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Esịn ikañ ke mme itieidʌñ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">ebʌñ mme ukwak inuaatob amọ.<verse eid="JER 51:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31" />Asuanetob keed akeene mfen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:31">ndin isʌñutom akeene isʌñutom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:31">adisian adidem Babilọn mbo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:31">ke emʌm afịd abio amọ,<verse eid="JER 51:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32" />uboiyo inyañ atre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:32">esịn ikañ ke mme ndua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:32">ndin akpọsọñ ndịk anam mbon ekọñ.”<verse eid="JER 51:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">“Adiaha Babilọn aba nte afe ubeek abakpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:33">ke idaha e-esọnnọke anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:33">ini adidọk anye ayaasọp adi.”<verse eid="JER 51:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34" />“Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn isobo ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">anye itop ñnyịn asịn ke ndutịme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">anye inam ñnyịn ido ukpọk ikịm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Nte akukubarakpa anye iben ñnyịn amen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">anyʌñ ayọhọ idịp amọ ye inem udia ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">ndin anyʌñ ikọkkọ ñnyịn aduọọk.<verse eid="JER 51:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35" />Mme andidʌñ ke Saiyọn ebo ete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">yak enam Babilọn ibak e-ekenamma ikpọkidem ñnyịn.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">Yeruselem abo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">“Yak iyiib ñnyịn adoro mbon e-edʌññọ ke Babilọn ke idem.”<verse eid="JER 51:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">“Se, ami ñyaanwana ekọñ iwuod mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">ñnyʌñ nsio usiene mfo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">ami ñyaanam akpainyañ amọ asat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">ñnyʌñ nnam idịm amọ asat.<verse eid="JER 51:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37" />Babilọn adiido ebono itie mbio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">itie ndidia mme ewaikọd,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">ñkpọ ndịk ye asuenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">itie a-awo ndomokeed imiidʌññọ.<verse eid="JER 51:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38" />Afịd mbon amọ ekuun nte mme ñyịn ekpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:38">ammọ ekpọi nte nditọ ekpe.<verse eid="JER 51:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39" />Ado ke idaha ammọ edịppeke idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">ami ñyaanam usọrọ nnọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">ñnyʌñ nnam ammọ ekpa mmịn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:39">nọ ammọ ebọọñ ñkpo ye imam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">ndin edaiya ke nsi-nsi, idemmeke aba,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 51:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40" />“Ami ñyaasuuhọ ammọ nnịm ke isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:40">nte mme edọñ ke itie ubakunam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:40">nte akukịmedọñ ye mme ebod.<verse eid="JER 51:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41" />“Naña ediimʌm Sesak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:41">emʌm ñkpooninua afịd ekondo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:41">Die ke ñwuudo Babilọn adiiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:41">ke iso afịd mme idịd!<verse eid="JER 51:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42" />Akpainyañ ayaadakka afʌk Babilọn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:42">mbufịd akpa amọ ayaafʌk anye.<verse eid="JER 51:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43" />Mme abio amọ eyaenaa ukpọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">nsaad isọñ ye akpautatan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">isọñ a-awo ndomokeed imiidʌññọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">awo ndomokeed imiinyʌññọ isaña ke anye iboiyo.<verse eid="JER 51:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44" />Ami ñyaamia Bel ufen ke Babilọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">ñnyʌñ nnam anye akọkkọ se anye akemen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">Mme idịd idiinyʌkkọke aba ke atutu ibịne anye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">Ndin ndibene Babilọn ayaaduọ.<verse eid="JER 51:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45" />“Ikọd mmi, iwuọ idi ikpọñ anye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">Ifeeñe iyem uwem ndufo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">Ifeeñe ibọkkọ ufiob iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JER 51:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46" />Ikiiduọọk idodanyen, ikiinyʌñ ikop ndịk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">ke ini ekoppo etob ke abio;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">mbʌk keed adi isua ami, mfen adi isua mfen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">mbʌk afai ke isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">ye ake adaukara a-anwanake ye adaukara.<verse eid="JER 51:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47" />Sia, ke akpanikọ, ini ado ayaadi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">a-ami ndiimia mme ubobodñkpọ Babilọn ufen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">eyaesuenne afịd isọñ amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">ndin afịd mbon amọ se ewot eyaenaa ke esịd ammọ.<verse eid="JER 51:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48" />Ndin hefịn ye ekondo ye afịd se idọñọ ke esịd ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">eyaesio ñkpo idaara ebaña Babilọn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">sia ayaato ke adoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">mme andisobo eyaenwana ye anye,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 51:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49" />“Babilọn ana aduọ ke ntak mbon Isrel e-ekewotto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:49">ukem naña mbon ewotto ke afịd ekondo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:49">eduọ ato ke ntak Babilọn.<verse eid="JER 51:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50" />Ndufo mbon e-ekebọkkọke akañkañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">inyọñ ikiinyʌñ ida ibiat ini!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">Itoiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke idịd anyan usʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">inyʌñ itoiyo Yeruselem ke akikere ndufo.”<verse eid="JER 51:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51" />“I-isuenne ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">sia i-isọñ ñnyịn anyen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">ndin abuud i-ifʌk ñnyịn iso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:51">sia mme isenawo emaedʌk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">ndisana itie ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="JER 51:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52" />“Ado mme usen esʌk edi,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:52">“a-ami ndiimia mme ubobodñkpọ amọ ufen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">ndin ke afịd isọñ amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:52">mbon edatta unan eyaemịm.<verse eid="JER 51:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53" />Akpekọm Babilọn adọọk aka ke mme hefịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">anyʌñ asọọñọ mme akpọsọñ itie amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">ami ñyaadọñ mme andisobo nnọ anye,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="JER 51:53" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54" />“Uyom ayịd ato Babilọn adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">uyom akwa nsobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">ato ke isọñ mbon Babilọn.<verse eid="JER 51:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaasobo Babilọn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">anye ayaanịme akpọsọñ uyom amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">Ayobio mbon usua ayaafịt adi nte akpọsọñ mmọọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">mme ñkpoyo uyio ammọ eyaemaana efịt.<verse eid="JER 51:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56" />Andisobo ayaadi abịne Babilọn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">eyaemʌm mbon ekọñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">ndin eyaebuñ mme utịgha ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Abasi usiene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">anye ayaakpe utịb ayọhọ-ayọhọ.<verse eid="JER 51:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57" />Ami ñyaanam mme adaaha amọ ye ideen aniọñ ekpa mmịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">mme adaukara, adaaha ye mbonekọñ amọ ñko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">ammọ eyaedaiya ke nsi-nsi inyʌññọ idemme aba,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">Adidem, a-anyịñ amọ adooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan abo.<verse eid="JER 51:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">“Eyaenịm ikpọ ndibene Babilọn ke isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">eyaenyʌñ esịn ikañ ke mme anyan inuaatob amọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">mbon awo etọọñ idem ammọ ke se imiibaaha ufọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">ñwaidem mme idịd ado ifia anọ edemeikañ.”<verse eid="JER 51:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59" />Ami ado etob a-prọfed Yerimaiya akenọọhọ akpan ayịnufọk Seraiya ayịn Neria, ayịn Maseiya, ke ini anye akekaaha Babilọn ye Sedekaiya adidem Yuda ke ayọhọ isua inaañ ke ukara amọ. <verse eid="JER 51:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60" />Yerimaiya amaawet ke ikpañwed abaña afịd mme ñkpọ se idiitịppe inọ Babilọn, afịd se ekewet ebaña Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 51:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61" />Ndin Yerimaiya amaabo Seraiya ate, “Afo amaakewuọ Babilọn, kịt bo ke afo amekoot afịd mme ikọ ami ke akpọsọñ uyio. <verse eid="JER 51:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62" />Ndin bo, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, afo amebo ke imọ iyaisobo abio ami, mbaak mme awo me unam edidʌñ ke esịd amọ; anye adiina ukpọk ke nsi-nsi.’ <verse eid="JER 51:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63" />Afo umaukoot ikpañwed ami uma, tobo anye ke itiad nyʌñ top anye sịn ke inyañ Yufretis. <verse eid="JER 51:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64" />Ndin bo, ‘Kpa ukem ami ke Babilọn adiiduọ, inyʌññọ idakka ida aba ato ke nsobo a-ami ndiiben ndot anye ke idem. Ñko mbon amọ eyaeduọ.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:64">Mme ikọ Yerimaiya etre mmi.<verse eid="JER 51:64" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JER 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52" />
  <para style="s1">Iduọ Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1" />Sedekaiya akedo isua edịb mme keed idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua duob mme keed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Hamutal, ayịn awonwaan Yerimaiya; anye aketo Libna. <verse eid="JER 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña Yehoiyakịm akenam. <verse eid="JER 52:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3" />Ke ntak iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam afịd mme ñkpọ ami aketịppe ke Yeruselem ye Yuda, ndin ke akpatre anye amaabịne ammọ asio ke iso amọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:3">Ndin Sedekaiya amaasọñ iwuod ye adidem Babilọn.<verse eid="JER 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob, ke ayọhọ isua ukara Sedekaiya usʌkkeed, Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn amaanam isañ adʌk Yeruselem ye afịd udịmekọñ amọ. Ammọ emaenam nnaaekọñ ekanna abio enyʌñ ebọp nnaaekọñ ekanna anye ekʌk. <verse eid="JER 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5" />Emaekanna abio ekʌk tutu ayọhọ isua duob mme keed ake ukara adidem Sedekaiya.<verse eid="JER 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6" />Ke ayọhọ usen usʌkkeed ke ayọhọ afiọñ inaañ, akañ amaakpon ke abio tutu ndidia ikibaaha aba se mbon awo edia. <verse eid="JER 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7" />Akem emaewuut ndibene abio, ndin afịd udịmekọñ emaefeeñe. Ammọ ekesaña ke ufañ ndibene iba akekpereke inwañ adidem ewuọ ke inuaatob abio ke akonayio, akpesʌkado mbon Babilọn emaekekanna abio ekʌk. Ammọ emaefeeñe ekaa ukañ Araba, <verse eid="JER 52:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8" />ado udịmekọñ Babilọn emaebịne Adidem Sedekaiya enyʌñ ekebọhọ anye ke ukañ unaisọñ Yeriko. Emaediañña afịd mbon ekọñ amọ ekpọñ anye, ammọ emaenyʌñ esuana, <verse eid="JER 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9" />ndin emaemʌm anye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:9">Emaeben anye esọk adidem Babilọn ke Ribla ke isọñ Hamad, itie a-anye akebiideke ikpe anọ anye. <verse eid="JER 52:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10" />Do ke Ribla adidem Babilọn amaawoot nditọ ideen Sedekaiya anye akịt ke anyen amọ; anye amaanyʌñ awoot afịd mme adaaha ke Yuda. <verse eid="JER 52:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11" />Akem anye amaakaap adidem Sedekaiya anyen asịññe, abọp anye ke ñkpọnọ brọns anyʌñ aben anye akaa Babilọn, itie e-ekesịnne anye ke ufọkñkpakọb tutu akem usen ñkpa amọ.<verse eid="JER 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob ke ayọhọ afiọñ ition, ke ayọhọ isua ukara duob mme usʌkkeed ake Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn, Nebusaradan, adaiso udịmekọñ ukpeme adidem, akenamma utom anọ adidem Babilọn, amaadi Yeruselem. <verse eid="JER 52:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13" />Anye amaasịn ikañ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ufọkubọọñ adidem ye afịd ufọk ke Yeruselem. Anye amaafọp afịd akpan ufọk anịm ke isọñ. <verse eid="JER 52:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14" />Afịd udịmekọñ Babilọn, ke idak ndadusʌñ adaiso udịmekọñ ukpeme adidem, emaewuut afịd mme ndibene e-ekekannake Yeruselem. <verse eid="JER 52:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15" />Nebusaradan, adaiso udịmekọñ ukpeme adidem, amaakoono anyọñ nte ntañnsio ubaak mme akpọikpọi uweene ye mbon se ikisʌhọ ke abio, adiana ye ubaak mbon unam utomusọ ye mbon se ikifeghe ikeene adidem Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 52:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16" />Ado Nebusaradan amaasʌhọ ubaak mme akpọikpọi uweene ke abio ado adinam utom ke mme inwañ fain ye mme inwañ mfen.<verse eid="JER 52:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17" />Mbon Babilọn emaeboom mme adaaha brọns, mme itiad idaha ye Akpainyañ brọns ekebaaha ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin ammọ emaekoono afịd mme brọns ami enyọñ Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 52:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ ekoono mme ako, mme udọk, mme ufadikañ, mme usan usiime mmọọñ, mme usañ ye afịd ñkpoduoho brọns ekesikamake enam utom ke tembịd. <verse eid="JER 52:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19" />Adaiso udịmekọñ ukpeme adidem amaakoono mme besịn, mme usan udọñ ukañ, mme usan usiime mmọọñ, mme ako, mme udodutuenikañ, mme usan ye mme ntəño bọwịd e-ekesikamake enwọñ ukọd unwọnwọñ uwa, afịd ñkpọ se ekekama ataa kold me ataa silfa enam.<verse eid="JER 52:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20" />Brọns ke mme abai iba ado, Akpainyañ ye ñyaaraenañ brọns duob mme iba ke idak amọ, ye uwewere ñkpọndaha, a-adidem Sọlọmọn akenamma anọ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, amaadoppo akan se ekpekekan edomo. <verse eid="JER 52:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21" />Abai keedekeed akedo kubid duob mme itiaita ke unyọọñ ye kubid duob mme iba ke ekara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 27 ke ukoñ ye ikpad 18 ke ekara me ñkpọ nte mita 8.1 ke ukoñ ye mita 5.4 ke ekara</char></note> amọ, udob ukpa amọ keedekeed, ye ufañ akedoppo ñkpọ nte nnuun inaañ anyʌñ atịkke. <verse eid="JER 52:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22" />Brọns ke unyọọñ abai keed akedo kubid ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 7 1/2 me mita 2.3</char></note> ke ukoñ ñko emaebana anye afịd idem ekanna ke udʌk ye mme pomekrened a-brọns. Abai anye ako, ye mme pomekrened amọ, akedo ukem. <verse eid="JER 52:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23" />Pomekrened anaañ mme duob mme itiokeed ekeba ke mme mbañ amọ; afịd ibad pomekrened se ikiba ikanna akedo ikie.<verse eid="JER 52:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24" />Adaiso mbon ukpeme amaamʌm Seraiya ekamba aku, Sefanaiya udiana ekamba aku ke ndaha ye mme akpeme inuausʌñ awo ita nte mbon ñkpakọb. <verse eid="JER 52:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25" />Ke atu mbon ekesʌkkọ ke abio, anye amaaben etubom ekọñ a-aseeghe ñkpọ abaña mme anwana ekọñ, ye mme anọitem adidem itiaba. Anye amaanyʌñ aben awedñwed a-akedooho etubom akeseeghe ñkpọ abaña edidat mme awo ke abio nsịn ke ekọñ; mbon ekedatta esịn ke ekọñ ke atu mbon e-ekekịtte ke abio ekedo awo ata. <verse eid="JER 52:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26" />Nebusaradan a-akedooho adaiso ekọñ amaakoono afịd ammọ asọk adidem Babilọn ke Ribla. <verse eid="JER 52:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27" />Do ke Ribla ke isọñ Hamad, adidem Babilọn amaanam ewot ammọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:27">Ke ntoro Yuda amaadʌk ufʌn, akpọñ isọñ amọ.<verse eid="JER 52:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 52:28" />Ibad mbon se Nebukadnesa akeben anyọñ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 52:28" />
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 52:28">ke ayọhọ isua itiaba,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:28">mme Yuu tọsịn ita mme edịb mme ita (3,023)<verse eid="JER 52:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 52:29" />ke ayọhọ isua duob mme itiaita ke ukara Nebukadnesa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:29">awo ikie itiaita mme edịb mme duob mme iba (832) ke Yeruselem;<verse eid="JER 52:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 52:30" />ke ayọhọ isua amọ edịb mme ita,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:30">Nebusaradan adaiso ekọñ ukpeme adidem amaaben mme Yuu ikie itiaba mme aba mme ition (745) akaa asenidịd.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 52:30" />
  <para style="li4" vid="JER 52:30">Afịd awo ekedo tọsịn inaañ mme ikie itiokeed (4,600).<verse eid="JER 52:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esaana Yehoiyakịn Eyaak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme itiaba ake Yehoiyakịn adidem Yuda a-akebaaha ke asenidịd, ke isua ake Awel-Maaduk akekappake ado adidem Babilọn, ke ayọhọ usen edịb mme ition ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob mme iba, anye amaasaana Yehoiyakịn adidem Yuda ayaak, anyʌñ asio anye ke ufọkñkpakọb. <verse eid="JER 52:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32" />Anye amaatañ ikọ emem-emem ye anye anyʌñ anọ anye itie ukpono akekoñño akan ake mme ndidem mfen e-ekebaaha ye anye ke Babilọn. <verse eid="JER 52:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33" />Ndin Yehoiyakịn amaasịññe afọñ ñkpakọb amọ ndin ke afịd ayio uwem amọ akedia ñkpọ ke akpokoro adidem. <verse eid="JER 52:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34" />Ke usen ke usen adidem Babilọn amaanọ Yehoiyakịn akʌk ekpadafọñ ke afịd ayio uwem amọ, tutu akem usen ñkpa amọ.<verse eid="JER 52:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52" />
</usx>